<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsia yi mbwe yi ósono Luke</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsia yi Mbwe yi ósono</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKE</para>
  <para style="imt3">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu me mukaana wu a Nsia yi Mbwe yi ósono Luke. Luke ka áli ntumu a Yiisu o, lo nde ákakala ya baara ba bákabulugye ya Yiisu ya nde ágyighili ofwulu bo bu óli bumweẽ bu Yiisu. Ŋa mbihi, nde ásono mukaana wu kundaa mbwuru wu budziri wu a nkwumu Teofile. Luke áli ngaa-libughu ya nde ási midzye milagha ya ntumu Poole. Ŋa kara li baara bwohono ba básono Bisono bibi Ngili, yini a nde wuulu ka áli mu-Dzwife o. Lo nde ágyighili osuo ekulu ki ba-Dzwife mpaala bandughu ba nde bagyighili osoolo nande Yiisu áli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke ályele ti ba-Dzwife áli bákakebe mukogho wu aayabvwuhu bo. Me Mubvwuhu wu óbili mibighili mi Nzaami munsa Bisono bibi Ngili bu bályele ti Nzaami sa agweghe nde. Nzaami ásoolo ti kala ti Mubvwuhu ka li o, baara ba nsie yohono sa bapfighili. Mu obo nde ágweghe Mwana a nde wu a mbunu mpaala abvwuhu baara ba mansie mwohono ba baasa kana mu nde. Mwana munde me Yiisu-Kriste.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke ásuo munsa mukaana wu bunu-abo báburu mwana wu, mandagha ma ágyighili nde ŋa yulu a nsie yi, ya mandagha ma áluo nde baara, lipfu li nde ya osighili o nde ŋa kara li baara ba bákpi. Yiisu áluo baara ya litumu lwohono, nde ádzuhu babyele, nde ábyi mifulu mi mibi, nde agyighili mandagha malagha maala baara bákiŋimi mu mo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luke ásono mukaana mukimi: Bigyighili bi bantumu. Nde ályele mandagha ma mábwi mu bantumu obaana bu bágyene a Yiisu ku yulu ya bunu bakriste bátsaŋama mu mansie mwohono.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Bu me bu baakakabala mukaana wu:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Mandagha ma mátsiini Luke mu osono mukaana wu a Nsia yi Mbwe wu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Bunu-abo báburu Dzã Muboghoro ya Yiisu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:5-2:52">1.5–2.52</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Maluo ma Dzã Muboghoro (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Liboghoro li Yiisu ya bunu satana ágyeele nde mpaala abwihi nde mu masumu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 3:21-4:13">3.21–4.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Yiisu áyikala ku Ngalile (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14–9.50</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Yiisu pala mu Ngalile mu ogye ku Yerusaleme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9.51–19.27</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Limiŋi li Yiisu lili masini ŋa yulu a nsie: Mumfwunu ya lipfu li nde (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-23:56">19.28–23.56</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Yiisu sighili mu lipfu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">24.1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">- Yiisu moŋono kundaa binduono bi nde ya bagyene a nde ku yulu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24:13-53">24.13-53</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ebaana e ndagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Ta Teofile, baara balagha baagyeele osono mandagha ma máluru ŋa kara li bihi-a-be. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Bo básono mo bwunu a bu ólyele bihi bampughulu ba bámono mandagha mamo obaana mu ebaana, ya ba bágwi litumu lili oluo mandagha ma Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Me mu obo, mehe si aansagha ogyighili ogyahaba mandagha mwohono ma máluru obaana ku ebaana, ya me aamono ti me mfaana osono mo ya bunkere. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Me ndi mu osa obo mu kuulu we baghala engaŋma ki mandagha ma báluo we.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi a oburu o Dzã Muboghoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Mu matala ma óli Erode mukogho wu a etsulu e nsie kii Yude, óli ya ngaa a Nzaami mutsyini nkwumu a nde Dzakari. Nde áli mumõ ŋa kara li emvuŋunu ki bangaa ba Nzaami baba dzumu li Abiya. Ya Elidzabete mukala a nde áli musi dzumu li Aarõ. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bo bansa buolo báli baara baba bunsumu ŋa busu bu Nzaami, ya bo bákagyighili onama mikyene ya mikele mi Mfumu myehene. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Lo bo ka báli a mwana o, mu kuulu Elidzabete áli etini, ya bo bansa buolo áli ayi biŋmini.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Etsughu etsyini, Dzakari ákasala esala ki bungaa bu Nzaami munsa nzo a Nzaami yi nene mu kuulu bibye bíli bitsughu bibi mukubu a emvuŋunu e bo mu osala. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ti bu óli epfu ki bangaa ba Nzaami, bo báti empa ki nga-a-bwehe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ŋa baakata dzeke mu osuolo elogho bwunu we mbwuru. Lo okata mu okatubu mburu bwunu we bitsulu bi miti mu nsie</char></note> ya básuolo Dzakari mu osomo mu ngwumu a Mfumu yi a ngili mu oyitsughu malyimi mama mpihi yi mbwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mpwumu a baara yohono yíli ku mbala mu okasamana, mu matala mama otsughu malyimi mama mpihi yi mbwe <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ngye-yulu a Mfumu ayamoŋono kundaa Dzakari, ya atemene mu kwogho kii babaghala, ŋa bele a ebini ki baakatsughu malyimi mama mpihi yi mbwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Bu amono ngye-yulu munde, nde ápaŋama ya ámono nzalamweẽ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Lo ngye-yulu ályele kundaa nde ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">«Dzakari ka amono nzalamweẽ o!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">Nzaami aagyughu lisamana li we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">Mukala a we Elidzabete sa aburu we mwana wu baghala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:13">We sa gwa nde nkwumu Dzã.<verse eid="LUK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />We sa kala kunsa esee ki elagha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:14">ya baara balagha sa baŋene mu oburu o nde,<verse eid="LUK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />mu kuulu nde sa akala mbwuru wu munene ŋa busu bu Mfumu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">
    <char style="qt">Nde akala ka aŋma bviini bwunu we mala ma maakolo o.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:15">Nde sa akala wu alwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili obaana matala ma aakala nde munsa mweẽ a ngughu a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Nde sa abvurulu basi Isarayele balagha kundaa Mfumu, Nzaami a bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Nde sa atswama ku nkulu, ŋa busu bu Nzaami, mu mufulu ya mu lileene li Eli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">Mu obo nde sa abvurulu eyeŋẽ ŋa kara li bataara ya baana ba bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:17">ya osa kuulu ti babo ba baagwene okagyughu Nzaami babagha munzeele wu a baara banga-a-bunsumu. Obo nde sa asa kuulu ti baara bakala a dzyi li likughu mu okihi Mfumu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Mu obo Dzakari ályele kundaa ngye-yulu ti: «Bunu-abo me aangyahaba ti mandagha mamo sa matswighi? Buulu me ayi eŋmini ya mukala a me si maaŋmini.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ngye-yulu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Me ndi Ngabiryele, me ndi ŋa busu bu Nzaami mu osalala nde. Nde aatumu me mu oyabili ya we, ya oyagwa we Nsia yi Mbwe yi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Buulu we aabihi osa kana mu mi aandyele me we, we sa kala nkini ya we ka afiritsughu ndagha o tee matala ma ootswughu mandagha ma. Mandagha ma sa mamoŋono mu matala ma ógwaa Nzaami.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mu matala mamo mpwumu a baara yíkakebe Dzakari yíkiŋimi mu kuulu nde ákagyili munsa nzo yi a ngili. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Bu ayapala, nde ka áfirikaleene obili ya bo o, ya bo bábaghala ti nde ndagha ábwana a yo munsa nzo yi a ngili. Nde ákabili ya bo mu bilyimi ya ákala nkini.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Bitsughu bi nde bibi esala bu bikughu, Dzakari ábvughuru ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Elidzabete mukala a nde ákeghele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bagha yimi</char></note>. Mu obo nde ási bangoono bataana baala nde ásweme. Nde ákabili bu: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Litala ndagha yi oosi Mfumu mu me! Nde aamono ti ma matala ma omaha me budzwa ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngye-yulu yalyele nsia yi a oburu o Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ŋa óto yimi li Elidzabete mu bangoono basemene, Nzaami ágweghe Ngye-yulu Ngabiryele ku bvulu lili Nadzarete mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kundaa mutughu mutsyini wu ógwi Dzodzefe, musi dzumu li mukogho Dabvide bilyimi. Nkwumu a nde Mari. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ngye-yulu bu asomo munsa nzo a nde, ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ya esee, we li a bwehe, Mfumu li ya we!»<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mari ákiŋimi ku olagha bu agyughu mandagha mamo. Nde ka ábaghala bunu-a-bo mboro oyo yíkadzyi olyele o. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ngye-yulu ályele kundaa nde ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:30">«Mari, ka mono nzalamweẽ o, mu kuulu we aabagha bwehe kundaa Nzaami.<verse eid="LUK 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />We sa keghele ya we sa buru mwana wu baghala, we sa gwa nde nkwumu Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Nde sa akala mbwuru wu munene ya sa bata nde Mwana a Nzaami wu a Ensoõ-Yulu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:32">Nzaami sa agwa nde likubu li Dabvide, nkagha-kwuru a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Nde sa akala mfumu a dzumu li Dzakobe mu mibvu ya mibvu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:33">Emfumu e nde ka ekala a masini o.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mari áfwulu kundaa ngye-yulu ti: «Me nkini aangyahaba babaghala o. Bunu-abo ndagha oyo yikughu okala?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ngye-yulu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Mufulu a Ngili sa agya mu we ya mpaana a Nzaami wu a Ensoõ-Yulu sa yifughu we ti edzwunu. Me mu obo mwana wu akala aaburu we sa akala wu a ngili, ya sa bata nde Mwana a Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Ya mono, Elidzabete, musi dzumu li we edzi-dzighi sa aburu si mwana wu baghala munsa buŋmini bu nde, nde wuulu baara baakalyele ti nde li etini, mu li yimi li nde ayi bangoono basemene, <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />buulu, Nzaami ka aakakuono a ndagha o.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Ya Mari ályele ti: «Me ndi musala a Mfumu, nyaã myehene mikala kundaa me ti bwunu a bu lyele we.» Ŋa mbihi oŋo ngye-yulu ábulusihi nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mari gyene yitala Elidzabete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mu bitsughu bibye, Mari ágyene mu maswa-maswa ku bvulu limõ lili etsulu e nsie kii minguo mimi Yude. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Bu ato oko, nde ásomo munsa nzo a Dzakari ya ágwi Elidzabete mboro. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ŋa ogyughu Elidzabete mboro yi ógwi nde Mari, mwana a nde ányiŋi munsa mweẽ. Elidzabete álwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />ya ákehe engubu mu likyi lili mpini ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:42">«Mu bakaha bwohono, Nzaami aabvulu oseme we, ya liseme li nde lili mu mwana wu aaburu we! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Me nande ndi mu kuulu ngughu a Mfumu a me agya kundaa me? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Mu matala ma aangyughu me mboro a we, mwana aanyiŋi mu esee munsa mweẽ a me. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Esee kundaa munde wu si kana ti mandagha ma oolyele Mfumu mu nde, sa makeele.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekwumu e Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mu obo Mari ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">«Endwu e me esyighi Mfumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Ya mukolo a me aalwulu mu esee mu nkooro a Nzaami, mubvwuhu a me.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Mu engaŋma mu kuulu nde aakaala mihi mi nde kundaa me musala a nde wu gwene a mupfunu. Obaana mu matala ma, biseene byehene sa bilyele ti me nga-a-esee,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />mu kuulu Nzaami nga a Lileene aagyighili mandagha ma manene kundaa me. Nkwumu a nde yili yi a ngili.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Nde aakamono babo ba baakagwa nde budziri nyiĩ mu biseene ya biseene.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Nde aasala mu mpini a myaã mi nde, litumu li kwogho e nde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">ya aatsala baara ba bali a limpampana.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Nde aamaha mikogho mu bimfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">ya akuhubu baara ba bagwene a limpampana.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Nde aaluhu bupfulu bulagha kundaa babo ba bali a nzala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">ya aabvurulu bisini myaã-a-myaã.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Nde aayabaha baara ba Isarayele basala ba nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">ya nde aalibili mweẽ mu osuo ngebe a nde,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Bwunu a bu ályele nde kundaa bataara ba bihi, mu nkooro a Abarahame ya dzumu li nde mu matala nswe matala.»<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mari ási ku bele a bangoono batere mu nzo a Elidzabete. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ábvughuru ku bula bu nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baburu Dzã Muboghoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Matala ma ooburu Elidzabete máto, ya nde áburu mwana wu baghala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Baara ba báli bitaa-taa bibye ya basi dzumu li nde bagyughu nsia yi a bubwe ba ósi nde Mfumu. Mu obo bákala mu esee ya nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Mwana bu akuhu bitsughu mpuomo, bo bágyi mu osohobo nde nzo a mbaa. Baara bwohono bákadzyi ogwa nde nkwumu a taara a nde Dzakari. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Lo ngughu a nde ályele ti: «Pele, sa bagwa nde kwumu Dzã.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bo bályele nde ti: «Mu dzumu li we ka oli ya nkwumu oyo o.»<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Mu obo bafwulu Dzakari mu bilyimi nsa nkwumu nde adzyi ogwa mwana a nde. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Dzakari bu aluomo mana baya, ásono: «Nkwumu a nde Dzã.» Baara bwohono bákiŋimi. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ya ŋaana oŋo, Dzakari áleene ofiribili ya nde ábwi oseme Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Mu obo, baara bwohono ba báli bitaa-taa bibye bámono nzalamweẽ, ya mu etsulu e nsie kii minguo mimi Yude, baara bákabulubili mu mandagha mo mwohono mamo. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Baara bwohono ba bákagyughu ndagha oyo bákatsimi ya bákagwa bifwulu kunsa mukolo ti: «Mwana wu nande àakala? Mu engaŋma, Mfumu li ya nde.»<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzakari bighili mu ekwumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Dzakari, taara a mwana, áli alwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili ya ábighili mandagha ma:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Nyaã masyighi makala kundaa Mfumu, Nzaami a Isarayele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">mu kuulu nde aayabaha baara ba nde ya okwulu bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Nde aagwi bihi Mubvwuhu wu a mpini</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">ŋa kara li bateghele ba mukogho Dabvide, musala a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ti bu átswama olyele nde mu matala ma makulu mu miŋma mi mibighili mi nde mimi ngili.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Nde ali ágwi misiini ti sa ákwulu bihi-a-be ŋa myaã mi bataara ya ŋa myaã mi babo bwohono ba baakabele bihi-a-be.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Me mu obo nde aamono bankagha ba bihi nyiĩ ya aalibili ogwihini o nde kuu ngili mweẽ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Mu engaŋma Nzaami áli álaba mukihi kundaa Abarahame, nkagha a bihi-a-be,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ti sa akwulu bihi-a-be ŋa myaã mi bataara mpaala lisalala nde ku ogwene a nzalamweẽ.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Mu kuulu bihi likala baba bungili ya baba bunsumu ŋa mihi mi nde, mu bitsughu byehene bibi bumweẽ bu bihi.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ya we, mwana a me, we sa kala mubighili a Wu a Nkara Yulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">mu kuulu we sa dzyara ŋa nkulu a Mfumu mu obwehẽ nzili a nde.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ya mu osuo kundaa baara ba nde bunu-a-bo bakughu obvwughu bu babagha kolokolo a masumu ma bo.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Mu nkooro a mukolo wu a nyiĩ wu a Nzaami a bihi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">otsyeme o nde sa osehene ŋa yulu a bihi, ti anga tala lili ku yulu,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />mu otsehebe babo ba bali kunsa mpyibi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ya kunsa edzwunu kii lipfu ya mu obiri myili mi bihi-a-be mu nzili yi a edzuunu.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana ákakulu ya ákabagha mpini mu mufulu. Nde ákabulukala kunsa syehe tee mu matala ma áyapala nde ŋa busu bu basi Isarayele.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Baburu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mu bitsughu bibye, Sedzare Ongusute ágwi litumu bataã mutala a baara bwohono ba bali ku nsie a emfumu e Rome. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Otaã mutala a baara oko kuu nsomo, bási ko mu matala ma óli Kirinyuse mfumu a etsulu e nsie kii Siiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Baara bwohono bákayisono mankwumu ma bo, mbwuru mbwuru, mu bvulu li ndeme.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Dzodzefe si ámara ku bvulu lili Nadzarete mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile ya ágyene ku Beteleeme, bvulu li báburu mukogho Dabvide mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude, mu kuulu nde áli musi dzumu li Dabvide. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Nde áyisono nkwumu a nde ya Mari, ndughu a nde wu ágwi nde bilyimi. Nde áli a yimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ŋaala bo nkini ku Beteleeme matala ma oburu máto nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Nde áburu mwana wu baghala, mwana a nde wu a nsomo. Ádzyiŋi nde kunsa misyene mi biko ya álaha nde ŋa ebini ki baakatwulu bilogho bi ookadza banyama, mu kuulu mu nzo yi baakabwana bandzyi, bo ka bábagha ebini ki baagyeŋeme o.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngye-yulu moŋono kundaa minkaala bibuolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Mu etsulu e nsie ekye, óli a minkaala bibuolo mi míkaluhu mpyibi ku ebiri mu ókabulukebe bibuolo bi bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ngye-yulu a Mfumu mutsyini ámoŋono ŋa nkulu a bo, ya otsyeme ku onene ófi kundaa Nzaami óyadzyi bo. Bo bámono nzalamweẽ yi alagha. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Lo ngye-yulu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ka likala a nzalamweẽ o, mu kuulu me aayandyele be mukyene wu mubwe, wu akala aagwa etswumu e be kyehene esee ki elagha. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Lolo li, mu bvulu lili Dabvide, baaburu mu nkooro a be, mubvwuhu. Nde me Kriste, Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ki me elyimi ki liigyahaba be nde: Sa limono mwana wu badzyiŋi kunsa mipa mi biko ya baalaha nde ŋa ebini ki ookadza banyama.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ŋaana oŋo mu ensihibi, mpwumu a bangye-yulu baba mikaã mi bambumbulu baba mayulu, yíyabvuŋunu ya ngye-yulu munde. Ya bo bábwi osyighi Nzaami ti:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Nsia kundaa Nzaami mu ensoõ-yulu, ya edzuunu ŋa nsie, kundaa baara ba adzyi nde.»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Minkaala bibuolo mi yimono Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Bangye-yulu bu bábulusihi bo mu obvughuru ku yulu, minkaala bibuolo míbili bo-a-bo: «Litswe ku Beteleeme, mpaala liyitala mandagha ma maabwi, ma oolyele bihi-a-be Mfumu.» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Ya bo bágyene maswa-maswa ya bámono Mari, Dzodzefe ya emwa-mwana ki bálaha munsa ebini ki ookadza banyama. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Bu bamono nde, bo bályele mandagha mamo ma bályele kundaa bo mu nkooro a mwana munde. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Bo bwohono ba bágyughu mandagha ma ólyele minkaala bibuolo bákiŋimi ku olagha. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mari ákabunu mandagha mo mwohono ma ya ákatsimi mo munsa mukolo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ya minkaala bibuolo, míbvughuru, mikabulusyighi Nzaami ya ogwa nde baana, mu myehene mi bágyughu ya bámono bo, mu kuulu myehene míli bwunu a bu ólyele bo ngye-yulu.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basohobo Yiisu nzo a mbaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Bitsughu mpuomo bu bikughu, matala mama osohobo mwana nzo a mbaa máto, bágwi nde nkwumu Yiisu, yi ólyele ngye-yulu, nsomo ngughu a nde akeghele.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babiri Yiisu ku Nzo a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Bitsughu bibi otsehebe nyuru bu bikughu, bwunu a bu ókatumu Mikyene mi Moyidze, bo bágyene a mwana ku Nzo a nzaami ku Yerusaleme mu osuo nde kundaa Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Bwunu a bu básono mu Mikyene mi Mfumu ti: <char style="qt">Nswe mwana wu a nsomo wu baghala wu baaburu sa bagwaghala nde kundaa Mfumu. </char> <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Ya bo bágwi ekaba, bwunu a bu ókalyele Mikyene mi Mfumu, <char style="qt">bidzu-dzughu byele, bwunu we mabeeme mwolo, maala nkini ka maayele o </char>.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeõ ya emwa-mwana Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ku Yerusaleme áli oli ya baghala mutsyini nkwumu a nde áli Simeõ. Nde áli mbwuru wu bunsumu ya wu aakagwa Nzaami budziri, wu áakakebe obuono o Isarayele, ya Mufulu a Ngili áli ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Mufulu a Ngili ályele kundaa nde ti nde ka kpa o tee ku aamono nde Kriste Mfumu. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Mu obo, Mufulu a Ngili ágyene a nde ku Nzo a nzaami, mu matala ma óyasomo taara ya ngughu a emwa-mwana e bo Yiisu mu Nzo a nzaami, mu osa mimye mi ókatumu Mikyene mu nkooro a nde, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simeõ ágwolo mwana, ásyighi Nzaami ya ályele ti: <verse eid="LUK 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Mfumu, mu matala ma, nyaã musala e we agye mu edzuunu, ti bu áli alyele we.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Mu kuulu mihi mi me miimono obvwughu o we,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ku átswama ogyighili we ŋa busu bu baara bwohono.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Oko me otsyeme ku akala oosuo omoŋono kundaa bikaana, ya nsia kundaa baara ba we, Isarayele.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandagha ma ólyele Simeõ mubighili mu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Taara ya ngughu a Yiisu bákiŋimi bu bagyughu mi ókalyele Simeõ mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simeõ áseme bo, ya ályele kundaa Mari, ngughu a Yiisu ti: «Mono, mwana wu li ŋa mu nkooro a obwa ya otemene kuu baara balagha mu Isarayele, ya mu okala elyimi kiili baara balagha akala baagwene odzyi kye. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Nde sa asuo mansweghe ma mali kunsa kara li mikolo mi baara balagha. Mu mi mitala weme, lipee sa litobolo we mukolo, mpaala mi ookatsimi baara balagha kunsa mikolo, baara basoolo mye.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ane, mubighili wu mukaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Óli si mubighili wu mukaha, nkwumu a nde Ane, mwana a Fanwele, mu dzumu lili Asere. Nde áli ayi eŋmini, ya bamvulu yini a nsaama ási ku bala. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ásomo bupfiili, tee ŋa áto nde bamvulu makwumu-mpuomo ya bana (84). Nde ka ákagye la ya Nzo a nzaami o. Nde ákasalala Nzaami mpyibi ya mwiĩ, mu okakuru muswele mu bala ya mu okasamana. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Mu matala maana mamo, nde si áli oŋo, mu okabvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami, ya mu okabulubili mu mwana munde, kundaa bo bwohono ba bákakebe okwulu o Yerusaleme.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvughuru ku Nadzarete: Bufulu bu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Dzodzefe ya Mari bu bamana ogyighili myehene mi ookatumu Mikyene mi Mfumu, bo bábvughuru ku bvulu li bo ku Nadzarete, mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Emwa-mwana ékakulu ya ékabagha mpini, ékalwulu mu bunsughu ya bwehe bu Nzaami búli mu kye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu Nzo a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Nswe mvulu, taara ya ngughu a Yiisu bákagye ku Yerusaleme ku kyiri kii Paake. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yiisu bu ato bamvulu kwumu ya buolo (12), nde ágyene ya bo, bwunu a bu óli epfu e kyiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Bitsughu bi kyiri bu bifi, mu matala ma bákabvughuru bo, mwana Yiisu ábulusyili ku Yerusaleme, kuulu taara ya ngughu osoolo we. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bo bákatsimi ti nde áli munsa mpwumu. Bu badzyara etsughu etsyini mu nzili, ya babaana okabulusagha nde kundaa basi dzumu li bo, ya kundaa ba basoolo bo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Lo, bu bagwene omono nde, bo bábvughuru ku Yerusaleme mu okabulusagha nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Bitsughu bitere bu bikughu, bo báyabagha nde mu Nzo a Nzaami, ábwi nsini ŋa kara-a-kara li baluo-mikyene, mu okagyughu bo ya mu okagwa bo bifwulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Baara bwohono ba bákagyughu nde bákakiŋimi mu mayele ma nde, ya mu mamvuru ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Taara ya ngughu bu bamono nde, bákiŋimi, ya ngughu a nde ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mwana a me, mu emakye we aasi bihi bu? Mono ati, me ya taara a we liikpi mu okabulusagha we.» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Lo nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Mu emakye be lili mu okabulusagha me? Bunu, be ka ligyahaba o ti me mfaana okanama mandagha ma Taara a me?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Lo bo ka bábaghala ndagha yi ályele nde kundaa bo o. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ŋa nseele, nde ákumunu ya bo ku Nadzarete. Nde ákagyughu taara ya ngughu a nde. Ya ngughu a nde ákagyighili okebe mandagha mwohono mamo munsa mukolo a nde.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Ya Yiisu ákakulu mu bunsughu, mu nyuru ya mu bwehe ŋa nkulu a Nzaami ya ŋa nkulu a baara.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Maluo ma Dzã Muboghoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mu mvulu wu a kwumu ya bataana (15) wu a emfumu kii Tibere Sedzare mukogho wu a nsie yi a Rome, Ponse Pilate áli mfumu wu a etsulu e nsie kii Yude, Erode mfumu wu a etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile, Filipe mwana a taara a nde mfumu wu a etsulu e nsie kii Iture ya kii Tarakonitide, ya Lisanyase áli mfumu wu a etsulu e nsie kii Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ane ya Kayife báli bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami baba nsomo. Me mu matala mamo Nzaami ályele mandagha ma nde kundaa Dzã, mwana a Dzakari, ku syehe. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Dzã ákadzye mu etsulu e nsie ki eli be-bele a mwele wu a Dzurudẽ. Nde ákabuluta mukwughu wu: «Ligyiŋi mayele, libagha oboghoro kuu ogyiŋi mayele mu kolokolo a masumu.»<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ti bu básono mu mukaana a mubighili Edzayi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">«Likyi li munde wu li mu okakehe engumbu ku syehe:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">Ligyighili nzili a Mfumu, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">
    <char style="qt">lisa mankwulu ma nde makala nsumu!</char><verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />
    <char style="qt">Nswe mbye sa badzyighi yo</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Nswe munguo ya nswe nkwighi sa bakirili bye bipere,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Mafuru ma manzili sa basa mo nsumu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">
    <char style="qt">Manzili ma mali bikumu-bikumu sa basa mo elehe</char><verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />
    <char style="qt">Ya baara bwohono sa bamono obvwughu o Nzaami.»</char><verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Nde ákalyele kundaa mpwumu a baara yi áakagya kundaa nde mu oyaboghoro ndiri: «Etswumu kii bampili! Nande aasuo be bu obara nkehe a Nzaami yi li mu ogya? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mu obo, lisuo bigyighili bi bifaana ya ogyiŋi mayele, ya ka libaana okabululyele mu beme o ti: “Taara a bihi Abarahame”, buulu me ndyele ti: mu mameẽ ma, Nzaami kughu otehebe baana kundaa Abarahame! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ekwu ayi bamaatwulu ŋa yulu a midza mi muti: nswe muti wu gwene oburu bimburu bi bibwe, lo nde wu okpaa ya wu otsili ku mbaa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Mpwumu a baara yífwulu nde ti: «Lo bihi emakye lifaana osa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Munde wu li a binkuru byele, agwa etsyini kundaa munde wu gwene a kye, ya munde wu li a bi-odza, asa bumõ si.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Mintolo-mpagha si mígyi mpaala baboghoro bo, ya bályele kundaa nde ti: «Muluo, bihi emakye lifaana osa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Ŋa liikatolo mpagha, ka likaluhu mutala wu bátumu o.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Bambumbulu si báfwulu nde ti: «Lo bihi emakye lifaana osa?» Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ka ligwohono kii mbwuru mu mpini o, ya ka lipfiri mpya o, lo liikakala a esee mu mufuru wu a ndaa-beme. Ya likala a esee mu nzi yi baakafiri be mu ngoono.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzã Muboghoro gwi nsia a munde wu li mu ogya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:11-12">Mat 3.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">Mar 1.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:24-28">Dzã 1.24-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Baara bákabulukebe ya bákabulugwa bifwulu kunsa mikolo mi bo mu nkooro a Dzã, ti ampe nde me Kriste. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Mu obo Dzã ábvuhulu kundaa bo bwohono ti: «Me ndi mu okaboghoro be mu madza, lo munde wu bvulu me mu mpini li mu ogya. Munde wu bvulu me, ya me ka nkughu onyana musyi a bikoghoro bi nde o. Nde sa aboghoro be mu Mufulu a Ngili ya mu mbaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Nde aakwara mukele mu kwogho e nde mu okabala bimburu ya nsele. Nde sa akwu bimburu kunsa etaghala e nde, lo nde sa atsughu nsele ku mbaa yi aagwene okadzimi.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:3-4">Mat 14.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-18">Mar 6.17-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Mu maluo ma malagha mama ogwa mpama, Dzã ákabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa baara. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Lo Dzã áfyeẽ Erode, mfumu a etsulu e nsie, mu nkooro a Erodyade, mukala a mbwee a nde, ya mu mandagha mwohono ma mabi ma ási nde. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Ŋa yulu a mandagha mwohono, Erode ásyimi Dzã ya álo nde mu boloko.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baboghoro Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Bu bamana oboghoro baara bwohono, Yiisu si báboghoro nde. Mu matala ma ákabuono nde, yulu lídzubulu, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />ya Mufulu a Ngili áyasughuru ŋa yulu a nde mu efaana kii beeme, ya ndagha yídzumu mu yulu: «We li mwana a me wu mukolo, me aankamono esee mu we.»<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bankagha-kwuru ba Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yiisu áli a bamvulu bele makwumu-matere (30) ŋa ábaana nde esala e nde. Nde áli bwunu a bu ókabulutsimi baara ti mwana a Dzodzefe, wu áali mwana a Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Mwana a Matate, mwana a Lebvi, mwana a Meleki, mwana a Yanayi, mwana a Dzodzefe, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />mwana a Matatyase, mwana a Amose, mwana a Nawume, mwana a Eseli, mwana a Nangayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nangayi mwana a Maate, Maate mwana a Matatyase, Matatyase mwana a Semeyi, Semeyi mwana a Yoseke, Yoseke mwana a Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda mwana a Dzãanane, Yowanane mwana a Resa, Resa mwana a Dzorobabele, Dzorobabele mwana a Salatyele, Salatyele mwana a Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri mwana a Meleki, Meleki mwana a Adi, Adi mwana a Kosame, Kosame mwana a Elemadame, Elemadame mwana a Ere, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ere mwana a Yiisu, Yiisu mwana Elyedzere, Elyedzere mwana a Yorime, Yorime mwana a Matate, Matate mwana a Lebvi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lebvi mwana a Simeõ, Simeõ mwana a Yuda, Yuda mwana a Dzodzefe, Dzodzefe mwana a Yoname, Yoname mwana a Elyakime, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Elyakime mwana a Meleya, Meleya mwana a Mena, Mena mwana a Matata, Matata mwana a Natã, Natã mwana a Dabvide, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dabvide mwana a Dzese, Dzese mwana a Obede, Obede mwana a Boadze, Boadze mwana a Sala, Sala mwana a Naasõ, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Naasõ mwana a Aminadabe, Aminadabe mwana a Adimine, Adimine mwana a Arani, Arani mwana a Eserõ, Eserõ mwana a Farese, Farese mwana a Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda mwana a Dzakobe, Dzakobe mwana a Idzake, Idzake mwana a Abarahame, Abarahame mwana a Tera, Tera mwana a Nahore, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahore mwana a Seruke, Seruke mwana a Rangawu, Rangawu mwana a Faleke, Faleke mwana a Ebere, Ebere mwana a Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala mwana a Kayiname, Kayiname mwana a Arafakade, Arafakade mwana a Seme, Seme mwana a Nowe, Nowe mwana a Lameke, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameke mwana a Matusaleme, Matusaleme mwana a Enoke, Enoke mwana a Yarede, Yarede mwana a Maleleele, Maleleele mwana a Kename, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kename mwana a Enose, Enose mwana a Sete. Sete mwana a Adã, Adã mwana a Nzaami.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Satana gyeele Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Mu matala ma ófi Yiisu ku Dzurudẽ, nde áli alwulu mu Mufulu a Ngili, ya Mufulu a Ngili biri nde ku syehe. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Mu bitsughu makwumu-mana (40) Satana ágyeele nde. Nde ka ali áli elogho si etsyini o. Ŋa bihi a bitsughu bi bye, nzala yifuru nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Satana lyele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ti we li mwana a Nzaami, lyele kundaa limeẽ li likighiri limpa.» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yiisu bvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «<char style="qt">Basono bu, mbwuru ka li mweẽ mu yini a mampa o</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Satana biri nde ku nkara a yulu, ya mu mana tala, suo nde bimfumu bi nsie byehene, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />ya lyele kundaa nde ndiri: «Me sa ngwa we litumu lwohono li, ya nsia a lo, mu kuulu kundaa me bágwi bye, ya me nkughu ogwa bye kundaa munde wu ndzyi me bye ogwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Kala ti we kunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a me, lo lwohono tumu likala lili we.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yiisu bvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Basono bu: <char style="qt">“Yini a ŋa nkulu a Mfumu Nzaami a we, we faana okunu mabuo ŋa nsie, ya yini a nde we faana osamana.</char>”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ŋa nseele, Satana biri nde ku Yerusaleme, twulu nde ku yulu a nzo a Nzaami ya lyele nde ti: «Kala ti we li mwana a Nzaami, bwa ku nsie», <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />mu kuulu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">«<char style="qt">Nde sa awa litumu kundaa bangye-yulu ba nde mu nkooro a we</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">
    <char style="qt">Mpaala bo bakebe we</char>.<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />
    <char style="qt">Ya ti: Sa baseene we mu myaã</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">
    <char style="qt">Mpaala kwulu e we enyaã okubu kya mu limeẽ</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yiisu bvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Básono si ti: “Ka gyeele Mfumu Nzaami a we o”.»<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Satana amana ogyeele Yiisu mu bifaana byehene, bulusihi nde mu mana matala.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gyene ku Ngalile ya baana oluo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yiisu bvughuru ku Ngalile ya mpini a Mufulu a Ngili, ya nsia yitsaŋama mu etsulu e nsie kyehene mu nkooro a nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nde ákabululuo mu manzo ma ba-Dzwife mama lisamana, ya baara bwohono bákasa nde nsia.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baara baba ku Nadzarete babihi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yiisu bvughuru ku bvulu li Nadzarete ku ákulu nde. Mu etsughu kii Sabate, nde somo nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife ti bu óli epfu e nde. Nde temene mu otala mandagha ma Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ya bagwi nde mukaana wu a mubighili Edzayi. Bu adzubulu nde, mono ebini ki básono ti:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Mufulu a Mfumu li mu me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Buulu nde aakili me maala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mu ogye a Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa bawele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Nde aaweghe me</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Mu ota mukwughu wu okwulu kundaa ba bali mu manzo ma boloko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ya kundaa binkpa-mihi ti sa bamono,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Obvuhulu kunsa bumpoholo babo ba bali kunsa kimini.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Ota mukwughu mu mubvu wu a bwehe bu Mfumu.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Bu adzyi mukaana, bvurulu nde kundaa esala ya bwi nsini. Bo bwohono ba báli munsa nzo a lisamana babwi okatala nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Oŋo nde baana olyele kundaa bo ti: «Lolo li, bisono bi bi liigyughu be, biikeele.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Baara bwohono báli bampughulu mu nde, ya bákakiŋimi mu mandagha mama bwehe ma mákapala mu muŋma a nde, ya bákalyele ti: «Bunu, wu ka li mwana a Dzodzefe o?»<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Nde lyele kundaa bo ti: «Me ngyahaba ti be sa lita me nkumu yi: “Ngaa, saha nyuru a weme.” Ya be sa lifirilyele me si ti: “Myehene mi liigyughu bihi mi aasi we ku Kaperenawume, yighili mye si mu etsulu e nsie e weme ki”.» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde firilyele ti: «Mu engaŋma, me ndyele be ti: Ka oli a mubighili ti mumõ wu bákihi mu etsulu e nsie e ndeme. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Mu ngaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti: Bapfiili ba bakaha báli balagha mu matala ma Eli mu Isarayele, ŋa odzughubu yulu mu bamvulu batere ya bangoono basemene, ya munzyala ágyi mu nsie nsyini. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Lo ka bágweghe Eli kundaa mupfiili si mumo mu bo o, yini a ku Sarepeta, mu etsulu e nsie kii Sidõ, kundaa mupfiili wu mukaha wu áali omo bágweghe nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Banga-a-buala si áli balagha mu Isarayele, mu matala mama mubighili Elidze, lo ka oli a si mumõ mu bo o wu bátsehebe, ŋa yulu a yini a Naamane musi Siri.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bo bwohono ba báli munsa nzo a lisamana bu bagyughu mandagha mamo, bakolo nkehe. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Batemene, bapaha nde ku mbala a bvulu ya babiri nde ku bele a mbye yi a munguo wu bátwu bvulu, mpaala batsili nde munsa mbye. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Lo Yiisu ábululuru ŋa kara-a-kara li bo, ágyene o nde.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu saha baghala nga-a-mufulu wu mubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ákumunu ku bvulu lili Kaperenawume mu etsulu e nsie Kii Ngalile. Oko nde ákaluo baara mu etsughu kii Sabate. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Baara bákakiŋimi mu nduo-nduo yi ákaluo nde, mu kuulu nde ákaluo ti mbwuru wu li a litumu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mu nzo a lisamana óli ya baghala mutsyini wu áali a mufulu wu mubi. Nde ákehe engubu mu yulu ti: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Aa! Nsa ndagha yili ŋa kara li bihi ya we, Yiisu musi Nadzarete? Bunu, we bu aagyi mu oyapfihili bihi? Me nsoolo we na nde li: We li wu a ngili wu oogweghe Nzaami!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yiisu áfulu mufulu munde epama ya ályele ti: «Kuru muŋma a we, ya pala mu baghala wu!» Mufulu wu mubi ábwihi mbwuru munde mu nsie ŋa kara-a-kara li baara, ya ápala mu nde ku ogwene a omweẽ nde mpara. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Baara bwohono bámono nzalamweẽ ya bákabili bo-a-bo ti: «Yi nki ndagha? Mbwuru li mu okabili mu litumu ya mu lileene kundaa mifulu mi mibi, ya mye mili mu okapala!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ya nsia yítsaŋama mu nkooro a nde mu etsulu e nsie kyehene.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu babyele balagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu bu apala mu nzo a lisamana, ágyene ku nzo a Simõ. Oko, buko bu Simõ wu mukaha áli a mukaama wu a mpini. Baara basyama kundaa Yiisu mu nkooro a nde. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Bu apfuŋumu ŋa bele a nde, Yiisu fulu mukaama epama ya mukaama pala mu nde. Ŋaana oŋo, mukaha munde, temene, bwi mu okakaba bo bi-odza.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Bwihi bu buyili, baara bwohono ba báli a mabyele mama mawa-mawa, bayabiri mo kundaa Yiisu. Nde naã bo myaã ya dzuhu bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mifulu mi mibi si mipala mu babyele balagha ya mu okabulukehe bingubu ti: «We me Mwana a Nzaami!» Lo Yiisu ákafulu mye bipama, ya ka ágwi mye muswa mu obili o, mu kuulu mye mígyahaba ti nde me Kriste.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu yiluo mu Ngalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Bwihi bu buki, Yiisu ábulupala mu bvulu ya ágyene ku syehe. Mpwumu a baara yibaana osagha nde tee bagyene ku áli nde. Bu bamono nde, bayeele osa myehene kuulu nde anyaã osihi bo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Lo nde lyele kundaa bo ti: «Me mfaana oyiluo si Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Emfumu e Nzaami ku mabvulu ma make, kuulu me mu obo baagweghe me.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Oŋo nde ágyene mu okabululuo mu manzo ma lisamana mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ti binduono bibi nsomo mbili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:35-51">Dzã 1.35-51</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:1-11">21.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Yiisu áli átemene mu mukogho a bana lili Ngenedzarete. Mpwumu a baara yíyasa nde mpiŋi mu ogyughu Ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Nde ámono mabwara mwolo ma bátwulu ŋa yulu a nseghe mu mukogho a bana. Ka óli a mbwuru mumo o, mu kuulu bilebe-banswi bísughuru ya bíkaswagha nkoho a bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yiisu ákumu mu bwara butsyini bu búli bu bundaa Simõ, ya áluomo kundaa nde ti: «Sehe eke mu kara a madza.» Ya nde ábwi nsini ya ábaana oluo mampwumu ma baara.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Bu amana obili, nde ályele kundaa Simõ ndiri: «Sehe a bwara ku oli madza yighi, ya litubu nkoho a be mu olebe banswi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simõ ábvuhulu nde ti: «Muluo, bihi liimono mpara mu mpyibi yi nsyini, lo ka liibagha elogho o. Lo buulu we lyele, me likoho aafirintubu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Bu batubu likoho mu madza, bábagha banswi balagha, ya likoho li bo líbaana okagha. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bo bákoro banganda ba bo ba báli mu bwara bubuke mu oyabaha bo. Bo bágyi ya báluhu mabwara mansa mwolo, kuulu mo mábaana odzyama.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simõ Piere bu amono obo, ákunu mabuo mu nsie ŋa nkulu a Yiisu ya ályele ti: «Mfumu, mara o we ŋa bele a me, mu kuulu me ndi mbwuru nga-a-masumu.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simõ, ya bwohono ba báli ya nde bámono nzalamweẽ mu bubi ba bágyighili bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Óli bumõ si kundaa Dzake ya Dzã, baana ba Nzebede, bambaala ba Simõ. Yiisu ályele kundaa Simõ ti: «Ka amono nzalamweẽ o! Obaana lolo li, we sa kala elebe kii baara.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Bu bayabvughuru a mabwara ŋa yulu a nseghe, bo bábulusihi bilogho byehene ya bánama Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu saha nga-a-buala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Etsughu nga-emõ, Yiisu áli mu bvulu litsyini. Omo óli ya baghala mutsyini wu áali a bubyele bu buala. Baghala munde bu amono Yiisu, ábwi busu mu nsie ŋa nkulu a nde, ya ábuono nde bu: «Mfumu, kala we dzyi, we kughu otsehebe me.» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yiisu álabala kwogho, ábyeme nde ya ályele ti: «Me ndzyi, kala wu a tse-tse.» Ya ŋaana oŋo, buala bu nde búfi. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu átswi nde mukele wu: «Ka lyele kundaa mbwuru si mumõ o. Lo gye yimoŋono weme kundaa ngaa a nzaami, ya gwa ekaba kii otsyeme ki ótumu Moyidze, mpaala okala elyimi kii bumpughulu kundaa baara.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lo nsia a Yiisu yíbvulu otsaŋama mu nkooro a nde, ya mampwumu ma baara malagha mákagya mu ogyughu nde, ya mu kuulu madzughu mu mabyele ma bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Lo nde, nde ágyene ku syehe ku ákabuono.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu saha mbwuru wu ópki binama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Etsughu etsyini, Yiisu bu ákaluo, ba-Faridzyẽ ya baluo-mikyene áli babwi nsini oŋo. Bo báfi mu mabvulu mwohono mama ku Ngalile, ku Yude ya bvulu lili Yerusaleme. Lileene li Mfumu li líli mu nde, límoŋono mu libughu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Ya mono, baara bágyi a mbwuru mutsyini wu ópki binama ŋa yulu a mbughu. Bo basagha bu baasohobo nde munsa nzo, ya bu otwulu nde ŋa nkulu a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Lo bo ka bábagha bu baasohobo nde o, mu nkooro a mpwumu a baara. Bo bákumu ku yulu a see li nzo lili eyala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">see li nzo lili eyala </char><char style="ft" closed="false">see li nzo li batwu mu ebagha kii eyala. Ku yulu a see lilo baara bákabwa nsini mu okamoŋo, mu okasamana ya mu okagwolo mpie mu nkonkolo.</char></note>, bátobolo see, ya básurulu nde mu mbughu ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono ŋa nkulu a Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yiisu bu amono kana li bo, ályele kundaa baghala wu ópki binama ti: «Baghala, masumu ma we baasi mo kolokolo.» <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Oŋo, baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ bábaana otsimi ya bályele ti: «Mbwuru wu aatsaala Nzaami wu, nde nande ali? Nande kughu osa masumu kolokolo kala ka oli yini a Nzaami o?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yiisu bu abaghala bitsimi bi bo, ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Mu emakye be lili a bitsimi bibye kunsa mikolo mi be? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nki ndagha yi gwene a mpara, olyele ti: “Masumu ma we baasi mo kolokolo”, bwunu we: “Temene ya dzyara”»? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mu kuulu be ligyahaba ti Mwana a mbwuru li a litumu lii osa masumu kolokolo ŋa yulu a nsie – Nde ályele kundaa mbwuru wu ókpi binama ti: «Temene, gwolo laba li we ya bvughuru ku nzo a we». <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ŋaana oŋo, mbwuru munde átemene ŋa mihi mi bwohono, ágwolo mbughu yi bálaha nde, ya ágyene ku nzo a nde, mu okabulusyighi Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Baara bwohono bákiŋimi ku olagha ya bákasyighi Nzaami. Bo báli a nzalamweẽ ya bákabili bu: «Lolo liimono ndagha yi okiŋimi.»<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ti Lebvi mbili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ápala ya nde ámono muntolo-mpagha mutsyini wu ábwi nsini ŋa nzo a mpagha. Nkwumu a nde Lebvi. Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Nama me!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lebvi átemene, ábulusihi bilogho byehene, ya ánama nde. <verse eid="LUK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lebvi ási Yiisu kyiri ki enene mu nzo a nde. Mintolo-mpagha ya baara babake báli oŋo, ya bákadza emõ ya bo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ba-Faridzyẽ ya baluo-mikyene ba báli omo bákaŋuŋunu ya bályele kundaa binduono bi Yiisu bu: «Mu emakye be lili mu okadza ya oŋma emõ ya mintolo-mpagha ya banga-a-masumu?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo bu: «Ba bali nsiili ka bali a nzala a ngaa o, Lo babyele. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Me ka aangyi mu oyata baba bunsumu mbili o, lo banga-a-masumu mpaala bagyiŋi mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efwulu mu nkooro a okuru muswele mu bala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bo bályele kundaa nde ti: «Binduono bi Dzã biikakuru muswele mu bala matala mwohono ya biikabuono Nzaami, binduono bi ba-Faridzyẽ bumõ si. Lo bibi ndaa we yini a okadza ya okaŋma.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yiisu ábvuhulu bo ti: «Bunu, be likughu oluomo bandughu baba mulumu bakuru muswele mu bala, mu matala maala nde nkini li ya bo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Lo bitsughu bili mu ogya, ya mbala-tsughu ŋa akala baamaha bo mulumu la ya bo, bo sa akala bakuru muswele mu bala.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mankumu mama enkuru ya mala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yiisu áfirita bo nkumu yi: «Ka oli a mbwuru wu kughu okaghala mupa a eko mu enkuru ki enyaghara mu obaama enkuru ki ekulu o. Buulu, nde sa akaghala enkuru ki enyaghara, ya mupa enkuru wu aamaha nde mu kye, ka li nsihi ya enkuru ki ekulu o. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Bumõ si, ka oli a mbwuru wu kughu oloŋono mala ma manyaghara mu nduru yi a mu ebaana kii nyama yi nkulu o, buulu mala ma manyaghara sa mabaala mamfulu. Lo mala sa matsaŋama ya mamfulu sa mabyi. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Lo, mala ma manyaghara okaloŋono mu manduru mama mu bibaana bi banyama ma manyaghara. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ya ka oli a mbwuru o wu kughu osa nzala a mala ma manyaghara, kala ti nde maaŋma ma mayele. Buulu nde sa alyele ti: “Mala ma mayele mabvulu bubwe.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu li mfumu a Sabate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ya mu etsughu etsyini kii Sabate, Yiisu ákaluru munsa manseghe mama bele. Binduono bi nde bíbwi okabuluka binsia bi mburu, bíkanyoõ ya bíkadza yo. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ba-Faridzyẽ babake bályele bo ti: «Mu emakye be lili mu okasa mandagha maala ka bágwi muswa mu etsughu kii Sabate o?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yiisu ábvuhulu bo bu: «Be ka liikataã ndagha yi ósi Dabvide o, mu matala ma ófuru nde nzala, nde ya ba báli ya nde? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Bunu nde ásomo mu nzo a Nzaami, ágwolo mampa mama ekaba, áli mo ya ágwi si kundaa ba báli ya nde. Mampa mamo, bo ka báli a muswa mu odza mo o, ŋa yulu a yini a bangaa ba nzaami.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Nde áfirilyele kundaa bo ti: «Mwana a mbwuru li mfumu a Sabate.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu etsughu kii Sabate Yiisu dzuhu baghala wu bágwolo kwogho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mar 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Mu etsughu ekimi kii Sabate, Yiisu ásomo mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife, ya ábaana oluo. Óli a baghala mutsyini omo wu bágwolo kwogho. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ bákabulutala Yiisu mu omono kala ti nde kughu odzuhu mubyele mu etsughu kii Sabate, mpaala bo babagha ndagha yi baafwunu nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Lo Yiisu bu ágyahaba bitsimi bi bo, ályele kundaa baghala munde wu bágwolo kwogho ti: «Temene ya kala ŋa kara-a-kara ŋa.» Nde átemene ya ákala mu mukiri. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Me mfwulu kundaa be kala ti oli muswa mu ogyighili ma mabwe bwunu we ma mabi, mu obvwuhu bwunu we mu odzwa mbwuru mu etsughu kii Sabate?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yiisu átala ngulu ya ngulu, nde ályele kundaa baghala munde ti: «Labala kwogho e we!» Nde álabala kye, ya kwogho e nde ébvughuru bu éli nsomo. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Lo baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ bákolo nkehe yi alagha ya bákabili bo-a-bo, bunu-a-bo bakughu osa Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu suolo bantumu kwumu ya buolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:13">Big 1.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mu bitsughu bibye, Yiisu ágyene ku yulu a munguo mu oyisamana. Nde áluhu mpyibi yohono mu okasamana Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bwihi bu buki, nde áti binduono bi nde mbili, ya ásuolo kwumu ya byele (12), ya ágwi bye nkwumu yi bantumu. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ma me mankwumu ma bo: Simõ, wu ágwi nde nkwumu yi a Piere, Andere mbwee a nde, Dzake, Dzã, Filipe, Baretelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matye, Toma, Dzake mwana a Alefe, Simõ wu baakata ti mu-Nzelote, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwana a Dzake, ya Yuda Isikaryote wu aatyeghe nde.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu luo baara ya dzuhu babyele balagha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Mat 4.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-13">Mar 3.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Bu akumunu munguo emõ ya bo, Yiisu átemene ŋa epere, ŋa óli mpwumu yi nene yi a binduono bi nde, ya mpwumu yi nene yi a baara baba ku Yude lwohono, baba ku Yerusaleme, baba ku mukogho a mubu, baba Tire ya baba Sidõ. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Bo bwohono bágyi mu ogyughu nde ya mu kuulu nde adzuhu bo mu mabyele mabo. Babo ba ókamwehẽ mifulu mi mibi kimini badzughu. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Mpwumu a baara yohono yíkasagha obyeme nde mu kuulu lileene líkapala munde ya líkadzuhu bo bwohono.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esee ya Nyiĩ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:2-12">Mat 5.2-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Mu obo, Yiisu bu akaala mihi mi nde kundaa binduono bi nde, ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Esee kundaa be bawele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">Mu kuulu Emfumu e Nzaami eli Kii ndaa be.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Esee kundaa be ba lili mu okpa nzala mu matala ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">mu kuulu be sa ligyughuru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Esee kundaa be ba lili mu okalili mu matala ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">mu kuulu be sa lisebe.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Esee kundaa be, kala ti baara babele be, babihi be, batughu be ya balyele mandagha ma mabi mu be, mu nkooro a Mwana a mbwuru».<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />«Limono emiini mu etsughu ekye, ya likala kunsa muyayaã, mu kuulu embwaã e be eli ki enene mu yulu. Bwunu obo si bataara ba be bákasa kundaa mibighili.»<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />«Lo, nyiĩ kundaa be bisini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:24">mu kuulu be limaabagha libuono li be!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Nyiĩ kundaa be ba lili kunsa bupfulu mu matala ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">mu kuulu mbala-tsughu be tumu likpa nzala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Nyiĩ kundaa be ba lili mu okasebe mu matala ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">etsughu eli ki liisomo be pfiili ya liilili.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Nyiĩ mu matala ma obili baara bwohono mu bubwe bu be,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:26">mu kuulu me obo si bataara ba be bákasa kundaa mibighili mimi mpya.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagha yitala odzyi mitaara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mat 5.38-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Lo kundaa be ba lili mu okagyughu me, me ndyele be ti: Liikadzyi mitaara mi be, liikasa bubwe kundaa ba baakabele be. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Liikaseme babo ba baakabiili be bipwolo. Liikabuono Nzaami mu babo ba baakabuulu mpya mu be. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Kala ti mbwuru kaha we limpala mu tama, lo taama nde si tama lilike, ya kala ti nde gwohono we enkuru e we ki ela kii kobo, nyaã nde si agwolo enkuru kii mu ntulu. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Nswe munde wu aaluomo we elogho, lo gwa nde kye. Ya kala ti mbwuru gwohono elogho e we, ka firiluomo nde kye o. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Mandagha ma lidzyi be ti baara bagyighili be mo, behe si ligyighili bumõ kundaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Kala ti be okadzyi babo ba baakadzyi be, lo mu emakye baatuono be? Banga-a-masumu si ti baakadzyi babo ba baakadzyi bo! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Mu kuulu, kala ti be bubwe okasa kundaa babo ba baakasa be bubwe, lo mu emakye baatuono be? Banga-a-masumu si ti baakasa bumõ. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Kala ti be okasohobo kundaa babo ba lili a be bitsimi ti sa babvurulu, lo emakye baatuono be? Banga-a-masumu si ti baakasohobo kundaa banga-a-masumu, mpaala babvurulu bo bwunu obo si!»<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />«Lo be, liikadzyi mitaara mi be, liikasa bubwe, ya liikasohobo wene a okala a etsimi kiili ti sa babvurulu be. Mufuru a be sa akala wu munene, ya be sa likala baana ba Nzaami wu a Ensoõ-Yulu, mu kuulu nde li a mukolo mubwe kundaa ba baagwene okabvurulu matuono, ya kundaa banga-a-mukolo bubi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Liikakala ya mukolo wu a nyiĩ bwunu a bu oli a Taara a behe si mukolo wu a nyiĩ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu luo mu mi mitala omono bipfu bi banganda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Ka likalamana banganda o, mpaala banyaã olamana behe si. Ka likabwihi banganda o, mpaala banyaã obwihi behe si. Lisa babake kolokolo, ya sa basa behe si kolokolo. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Likakaba banganda, ya sa bakaba behe si. Sa batsogho bilogho bi biluru mu mankuru ma be, ya sa bakomo bye ku oluru. Mu kuulu, sa bakateese be mu eteese ekye ki liikateese be bambaala.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yiisu áfirita bo nkumu yi: «Enkpa-mihi ka ekughu osuo nganda enkpa-mihi nzili o. Kala pele, bo bansa buolo sa bayibwa munsa dzunu. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Enduono ka eluru muluo a kye o, ya nkana si mumõ ka luru mfumu a nde o. Lo, nswe munde wu baaluo bubwe, nde sa akala ti muluo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Mu ema we li mu okatala mana lisele li lili mu lihi li nganda, ŋaala we li a mubaa a muti mu lihi li weme? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Bwunu we bunu-a-bo we kughu olyele nganda ti: “Ngee a me, nyaã me maha we lisele mu lihi”, ŋaala we mubaa a muti wu li mu lihi li weme omono we? We li mbwuru wu a bifa byele. Matswama maha a ti mubaa a muti wu li mu lihi li we. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, we sa gyighili omono bubwe mu omaha lisele mu lihi li nganda.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muti ya mburu a nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat 7.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Muti wu mubwe ka kughu oburu bimburu bi bibi o, ya muti wu mubi ka kughu oburu bimburu bi bibwe o. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Nswe muti okagyahaba mu bimburu bi nde. Ka bakughu oka finge mu munsene-a-nsene o, ya ka bakughu oka bimburu bi bviini mu mungaama o. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mbwuru wu mubwe li a bitsimi bi bibwe mu mukolo a nde. Mbwuru wu mubi li a bitsimi bi bibi mu mukolo a nde. Mu engaŋma, muŋma a mbwuru okapaha mi milwulu kunsa mukolo a nde.»<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efaana kii manzo mwolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Mu emakye be liikata me “Mfumu, Mfumu”, lo be liigwene okagyighili mandagha ma aakandyele me be? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Me sa nsuo be efaana ki mbwuru wu gyi kundaa me, gyughu mandagha ma me ya salala mo. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Nde li efaana kii baghala wu aatwu nzo. Nde tsimi miwaghala mi mila ya twu bitsini bi bibagha bi nzo ŋa yulu a limeẽ. Mvulu bu anoõ, ndwuru yigyi mu mwele ya madza mayisiŋi mu nzo oyo ya eturu kyehene, lo yo obwa we, mu buulu bágyighili otwu yo. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Lo munde wu gyughu mandagha ma me ya kuono osalala mo, nde li efaana kii baghala wu aatwu nzo mu yulu a dzyele, ku ogwene a bitsini bi bibagha. Mvulu bu anoõ, ndwuru yigyi mu mwele ya madza mayisiŋi mu nzo ya eturu kyehene, mabwihi nzo ya mabiri yo nkwu-nkwughu.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu musala a mfumu a bambumbulu nkama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat 8.5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yiisu bu amana olyele mandagha mwohono mamo kundaa baara ba bákagyughu nde, nde ágyene ku Kaperenawume. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Oko óli a mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu ba Rome nkama. Nde áli a musala wu ákadzyi nde ku olagha. Musala me ábyele ya ákadzwana ya lipfu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Mfumu munde bu agyughu ti Yiisu aayato ŋa Kaperenawume, nde ágweghe ndaama a bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife bayilyele Yiisu ayabvwuhu nkana a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Bo bágyene kundaa Yiisu ya bábuono nde ku olagha ti: «Wu aagweghe bihi li mbwuru wu mubwe ya we faana obaha nde, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Mu kuulu nde dzyi baara ba nsie a bihi-a-be, ya me nde aatwuhu bihi nzo a lisamana.»<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Mu obo Yiisu ágyene ya bo. Nde ato ŋa bele a nzo a mfumu munde, mfumu a bambumbulu ágweghe ndaama a bandughu ba nde kundaa Yiisu mu olyele nde bu: «Mfumu, nyaã omono oko mpara yi ogya ku nzo a me! Me ka nkughu mu ogyagha we munsa nzo a me o. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Me obo me aamono si ti me ka mfaana oyabwana a we o. Lo tsughu yini a ndagha, ya musala a me sa adzughu. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Me ndi mu litumu li bamfumu ba me, ya meme si ndi a bambumbulu ba aakantumu me. Kala me ndyele mutsyini ti: “Gye!” Nde sa agye. Kala me ndyele wu muke ndiri: “Gya!” Nde sa agya. Kala me ndyele musala a me ti: “Sa bu!” Nde sa asa obo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yiisu ayughu obo, nde ákiŋimi. Nde ákaghala kundaa baara ba báyanama nde, ya ályele bo ti: «Mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be, ngu okala mu Isarayele, me nkini amaamono mbwuru wu li a kana li linene lili bu o.» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Bandughu ba mfumu a bambumbulu bábvughuru kundaa nde ya bámono musala wu áali mubyele ádzughu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu siili mwana a mupfiili mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ágyene ku bvulu lili Nayine. Binduono bi nde ya mpwumu a baara yi nene bágyene ya nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Mu matala ma ákasomo nde kunsa bvulu, nde ámono ebyimi ki bákayidzyighi ku mampyeme: Mwana nga mumõ wu a baghala mu mweẽ ngughu a nde, ya ngughu a nde áli mupfiili. Mpwumu a baara baba bvulu lilo báli ya mupfiili. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mfumu bu amono mupfiili munde, nde ámono nyiĩ yi alagha. Mu obo nde ályele kundaa nde ti: «Ka lili o!» <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Bu asele, Yiisu ábyeme lwana ya baara ba bákabiri lo bátemene. Nde átsughu ndagha ti: «Munkuru-mbala, me bu ndyele we, temene!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Mvwumu ásighili, ábwi nsini ya ábaana obili. Yiisu ágwi nde kundaa maama a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Baara bámono nzalamweẽ. Bo básyighi Nzaami ya bákalyele ti: «Nzaami aagweghe bihi mubighili wu munene!» Ya báfiribwehe ti: «Nzaami aayamoŋono kundaa baara ba nde!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Mu obo nsia a Yiisu yítsaŋama mu etsulu e nsie kii Yude kyehene, ya mu bitsulu bi nsie bi bili be-bele a Yude.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzã Muboghoro gweghe binduono bi nde kundaa Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Binduono bi Dzã Muboghoro bílyele nde mandagha mwohono mamo. Mu obo, nde áti binduono bi nde byele mbili <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ya ágweghe bye kundaa Yiisu mu ofwulu nde ti: «We me mbwuru wu liikakyele, bwunu we mukimi liikyele?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Bo bato kundaa Yiisu bályele nde bu: «Dzã gweghe bihi mu ofwulu we, “kala we me mbwuru wu liikakyele, bwunu we mukimi liikyele?”»<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mu matala maana mamo, Yiisu ádzuhu babyele balagha, ya ba báli a mpara yi a mawa-mawa. Nde ábyi mifulu mi mibi mi míli ya bo, ya ádzubulu mihi mi babo ba áli ókpi mihi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ályele kundaa baara ba ógweghe Dzã ti: «Ligye lilyele kundaa Dzã myehene mi liimono ya mi liigyughu be»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">«<char style="qt">Binkpa-mihi bili mu omono, </char> bikara bili mu odzyara, bangaa buala ayi tse-tse, <char style="qt">Binkpa-matswi bili mu ogyughu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:22">
    <char style="qt">Ba bakpi bali mu osighili mu lipfu,</char> ya bawele bali mu ogyughu Nsia yi Mbwe.<verse eid="LUK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Esee kundaa munde wu aagwene obwihi kana li nde mu nkooro a me!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ŋa bihi a ŋa óbvughuru baara ba ógweghe Dzã, Yiisu ábaana obili mu nyuru a Dzã kundaa mpwumu a baara. Nde ályele bo ti: «Emakye be liiyitala ku syehe? Libaŋana li okanyihi efulu? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Bu lo be emakye liiyitala? Mbwuru wu aalaha binkuru bibi ntala? Lo, ba baakalaha binkuru bibi ntala ya ba bali kunsa busini okakala mu manzo ma mikogho. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Lo emakye be liiyitala? Mubighili? Heẽ, me ndi mu olyele be, nde bvulu mubighili». <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Mu kuulu Dzã me munde Bisono biikalyele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">«<char style="qt">Me sa ntswahaba ntumu a me ku nkulu a we.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="qt">Mu ogyighili we nzili</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />«Me ndyele be bu: Ŋa kara li baara bwohono ba báburu mu bakaha, ka oli ya mbwuru wu bvulu Dzã o. Lo munde wu bvulu nde busala mu Emfumu e Nzaami bvulu nde bukwuru. <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Ya baara bwohono ba bagyughu nde, ya mintolo-mpagha, bo bábaghala ti Nzaami li wu a bunsumu, ya bákihi ti Dzã aboghoro bo. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Lo ba-Faridzyẽ ya Baluo-mikyene bu babihi mi okadzyi Nzaami osa mu bo, bábihi ti Dzã aboghoro bo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yiisu áfirilyele ti: «Ya na me aambvughu baara baba eseene ki? Bo efaana kii na bali? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bo bafaana ya bike-bike bi biibwi nsini ŋa ebini ki ookabvuŋunu baara bwohono, ya bali mu okalyele mu yulu kundaa babake ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">“Bihi liifulu mamvulu-a-mvulu, lo be ka liikini o! Bihi liigyimi bikwumu bibi minyoõ, lo be ka liilili o.”»<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />«Dzã Muboghoro aagyi, nde ka ákadza mampa ya ka ákaŋma mala o. Mu obo, be liilyele ti: “Nde li a mufulu wu mubi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana a mbwuru aagyi. Nde li mu okadza ya okaŋma, ya be lili mu okalyele ti: “Mbwuru wu ki agyahaba nde yini a odza ya oŋma mala. Nde li mbaala a mintolo-mpagha ya banga-a-masumu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Lo bunsughu bu Nzaami buumoŋono bubu bunsumu kundaa baana ba nde.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Simõ mu-Faridzyẽ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mu-Faridzyẽ mutsyini áti Yiisu mbili mu oyidza ya nde, ya Yiisu ágyene ku nzo a nde ya ábwi nsini mu odza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ŋa bula bubo óli a mukaha mutsyini nga-a-masumu. Ŋa ágyughu nde ti Yiisu ákadza mu nzo a Mu-Faridzyẽ munde, nde áli a mbwara yi alwulu mu mananaase. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Nde ágyene ŋa myili mi Yiisu, ábaana olili ya ábwoho myili mi Yiisu mu mansaŋa ma nde. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde akakwono mye mu mfu a nde. Nde ákanyuburu myili mi Yiisu, ya ákagyogho mye mananaase. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mu-Faridzyẽ wu áati Yiisu mbili amono obo, nde ábili kunsa mukolo a nde ti: «Kala ti mbwuru wu mubighili ali, mu engaŋma, nkini nde aagyahaba ti mukaha wu li mbwuru nga-a-masumu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele kundaa mu-Faridzyẽ munde ti: «Simõ, me ndi a ndagha yi aandyele we.» Simõ ábvuhulu nde ti: «Bili o we Muluo!» <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yiisu átsughu ndagha ndiri: «Baara buolo áli basomo nzi kundaa wu aakasohobo nzi. Mutsyini badenali nkama, ya wu muke badenali makwumu mataana. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Buulu bo bansa buolo ka báleene ofiri ebyimi ekye o, nde ányaghala bo ebyimi kyehene. Mu we, ŋa kara li bo buolo, nande aabvulu dzyi nde?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simõ ábvuhulu nde bu: «Mu bitsimi bibi me, munde wu ányaghala nde ebyimi ki eluru olagha.» Yiisu ályele nde ti: «We aabili ku bwe.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ŋa nseele, nde bu akaghala mihi kundaa mukaha munde, ályele kundaa Simõ ti: «We aamono mukaha wu? Me aayansomo mu nzo a we ya we ka aagwi me madza ma oswagha myili o. Lo nde aabwoho me mye mu mansaŋa ma nde, ya aakwono mye mu mfu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />We ka aanyuburu me o, lo, obaana bu aayansomo me mu, nde ka aakolo mu okanyuburu myili mi me o. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />We ka aagyirili me maala ku yulu a mutswi o, lo nde aagyirili mananaase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mananaase: madza ma mumpfu-mpfu.</char></note> mu myili mi me. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Me mu obo, me ndi mu olyele we ti: Buulu nde aasuo dzyi li lilagha, mu olyele ti Nzaami aasi masumu ma nde ma malagha kolokolo. Lo munde wu baasi masumu ma nde ma masala kolokolo aakasuo si dzyi li lisala.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele kundaa mukaha munde ndiri: «Masumu ma we baasi mo kolokolo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baara ba bákadza ya Yiisu bábwi okabili mu bomo ti: «Mbwuru wu nande ali mu osa masumu ma baara kolokolo?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Lo Yiisu ályele mukaha munde ndiri: «Kana li we liibvwuhu we. Gye mu edzuunu.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bakaha ya ba bákabulunama Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ágyene mu mabvulu ya mala mu okabulutsala nsia yi a Emfumu e Nzaami ya okabululuo. Bantumu ba nde kwumu a buolo (12) bákakala ya nde emõ <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />ya ndaama a bakaha ba ádzuhu ya ba ábyi nde mifulu mi mibi mu bo. Óli Mari wu baakata ti musi Mangadala, wu óbyi Yiisu mifulu nsaama mi mibi, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Dzaane mukala a Syudza wu ali musala a Erode, Sudzane ya bakaha balagha bakimi. Bo bwohono bákasalala bilogho bi bo mu obaha Yiisu ya binduono bi nde.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mukunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Mu obo mpwumu a baara yi nene yígyi kundaa Yiisu, ya nde áti bo nkumu yi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Etsughu etsyini, mukunu mutsyini ápala mu oyinyahala nsia mu nseghe. Mu matala ma ákabulunyahala nde yo, ndaama yíbwi mu mukogho a nzili. Baara bádzyara yo ya baŋmini báli yo. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Ndaama yinke yíbwi mu nsie yi a mameẽ. Bu yilughubu, yo yíkee mu kuulu oŋo nsie ka yíli a madza o. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Ndaama yinke yíbwi mu nsie yi áli a mingaama. Mingaama bu mílughubu, míkulu emõ ya mburu oyo, mísi mburu mpiŋi. Yo yíkwono okulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ndaama yinke yíbwi mu nsie yi mbwe. Yo yíkulu, yíkulu, ya nswe liburu líburu mburu nkama.» Bu amana obili obo, Yiisu áfiribili mu mpini ti: «Nyaã wu li a matswi, agyughu!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu emakye Yiisu abili mu mankumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, binduono bi Yiisu bífwulu nde ti nkumu oyo bunu-a-bo yidzyi olyele. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Nde ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Nzaami aasuo kundaa be mansweghe ma Empu e Nzaami. Lo kundaa baara babake, myehene okaluru mu mankumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">mu kuulu, “si bapana mihi, banyaã omono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">Si bagyughu, banyaã obaghala.”»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu baala nkumu yi a mukunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:14-20">Mar 4.14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Nkumu oyo bu yidzyi olyele: mburu me Ndagha a Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Baara ba báli mu mukogho a nzili, me baara ba baakagyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, ŋa mbihi dyabulu gyi yamaha yo mu mikolo mi bo mu kuulu banyaã osa kana, ya banyaã obvwughu. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Baara ba bali mu nsie yi a mameẽ yi obwi mburu, me babo baala bu bagyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, bakihi yo ya esee. Lo ka bali a midza o. Bo baakasa kana mu mana a matala. Ŋa ookagya bigyeele, bo baakabwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ndaama yi aakabwa ŋa kara li mingaama, me babo baala bu bagyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, bagyene ya banyaã minyoõ ya bisee bi nsie bisi yo mpiŋi, ya bimburu bi yo ka biikakulu o. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mburu yi aakabwa mu nsie yi mbwe, me baara babo baala bu bagyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, bakebe yo mu mukolo wu a bunsumu ya wu mubwe, ya baakakwara yo ya baakaburu bimburu ya mukama.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mwindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mar 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Ka oli ya mbwuru wu aakanahaba mwindi mu ofughu nde nkuru o, bwunu we mu otwulu nde ku nsini a mbughu. Lo mu otwulu nde ŋa yulu a ebini ki baakatwulu nde, mu kuulu baara ba baasomo mu nzo bamono otsyeme. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Mandagha mwohono ma másweme sa magyighili omoŋono, ya mansweghe mwohono sa bagyighili ogyahaba mo ya opaha mo ku mbala. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Mu obo, lisa mayele mu ngyu-ngyughu a be! Mu kuulu sa babwehe elogho kundaa munde wu li a kye, lo kundaa munde wu aagwene a elogho o, sa bamaha ki aakatsimi nde ti li a kye.»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngughu ya bambwee ba Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, ngughu ya bambwee ba Yiisu báyatala nde, lo bo ka báleene oto ŋa áli nde o mu nkooro a mpwumu a baara. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Mbwuru mutsyini ályele nde ndiri: «Ngughu ya bambwee ba we bali ku mbala. Bo bali ya nzala a we.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Lo Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Ngughu a me ya bambwee ba me, me babo ba baakagyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, ya ba baakasalala yo.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu kahaba efulu ki enene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Etsughu etsyini, Yiisu ásomo munsa bwara ya binduono bi nde, ya ályele bo ti: «Litswe lisaghaba mu ngulu a mubu.» Mu obo, bo bágyene. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Bu bákadzughu bwara, Yiisu ábwi tolo. Mu matala maana mamo, efulu kii mpini ébaana osa mu yulu a madza ma bana, ya bwara búbaana olwulu mu madza. Mu obo, lipfu lígyele bo. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Binduono bísiili Yiisu ya bílyele nde ti: «Mfumu! Mfumu! Bihi-a-be lifi ekulu!» Yiisu bu asighili, áfyeẽ efulu ya mimpaŋa mi madza mu mpini. Efulu éfi ya edzuunu éyabvughuru. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo nde áfwulu bo ndiri: «Kana li be kunu lili?» Enkwughu ésughuru bo ya bákiŋimi. Bo bábili bo-a-bo ti: «Wu nsa mbwuru wu aakatumu efulu ya madza, ya bye biikagyughu nde?»<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu byi mifulu mi mibi mi míli mu baghala mutsyini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yiisu ya binduono bi nde bápala mu ngulu a bana ya básomo mu etsulu e nsie kii ba-Ngerasenyeẽ, ki eli nkolo ya nkolo ya Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ŋa ópala Yiisu munsa bwara, baghala mutsyini wu áali musi bvulu áyabwana a nde. Baghala munde áli a mifulu mi mibi. Edzighi nde áli átsili binkuru. Nde ka áli a nzo o, lo kunsa mampyeme ákabulugyoŋomo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Bu amono Yiisu, nde ákehe mungili, ákunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a nde, ya ályele mu mpini yohono ti: «Nsa ndagha yili ŋa kara li me ya we Yiisu Mwana a Nzaami Wu Ensoõ-Yulu? Yoboo, ka mwehẽ me mpara o!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Nde ábili obo mu kuulu Yiisu ákalyele mufulu wu mubi ndiri: «We, mufulu wu mubi, pala mu baghala wu!» Nsa alagha mufulu ákasomo mu nde, ya bákakuru nde myaã mu bukolo ya bákatwulu nde myili munsa edzu, lo nde ákatsyiri bye. Mufulu wu mubi ákabulubiri nde kunsa syehe. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yiisu áfwulu nde ndiri: «Nkwumu a we na?» Nde ábvuhulu ndiri: «Mpwumu». Mu kuulu mifulu mi mibi milagha míisomo mu nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mifulu mi mibi míbuono Yiisu bu: «Ka tumu bihi ligye ku nsini a mbie yi a nda yi a laŋa-laŋa o.»<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ŋa bele oŋo óli a mukaã a bangubulu wu munene wu áakabuludza ŋa yulu a munguo. Mifulu mi mibi míbuono Yiisu agwa bo muswa wu oyisomo mu bangubulu. Nde ágwi bo muswa munde. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mu obo, mifulu mípala mu baghala munde, míyisomo mu bangubulu. Bangubulu bwohono bákumunu ku nsini a munguo, báyibwa mu bana ya báfi ekulu.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Baara ba bákabulukebe bo bámono mi miluru. Mu obo bo bábara ya báyitsala nsia yi a ndagha oyo kunsa bvulu ya mu mala. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Baara báyatala mi míluru. Ŋa báyato bo ku óli Yiisu, bámono baghala wu áali a mifulu mi mibi ábwi nsini ŋa myili mi Yiisu. Nde álaha ku obwe ya embwuru éyabvughuru nde. Nzalamweẽ yíbagha bo. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Baara ba bámono mi miluru balyele bo bunu-a-bo baghala munde ábvwughu. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo baara bwohono ba báli mu etsulu e nsie kii ba-Ngerasenyeẽ bályele Yiisu ndiri: «Mara mu nsie a bihi!» Bo bályele obo mu kuulu báli a nzalamweẽ yi alagha. Mu obo Yiisu si ásomo mu bwara ya ágyene.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Baghala wu áali a mifulu mi mibi áluomo Yiisu muswa wu okala ya nde. Lo Yiisu ábihi ya ályele nde ti: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Bvughuru ku nzo a we, ya yilyele baara mandagha mwohono ma oogyighili Nzaami mu we.» Nde ágyene ya átsala nsia munsa bvulu lwohono yi a mi ósi Yiisu mu nde.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu mukaha mutsyini ya siili mutughu mutsyini mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ŋa óyabvughuru Yiisu mu ngulu a bana, mpwumu a baara yíbwana a nde mu kuulu bo bwohono bákakebe nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, mukwuru mutsyini wu a nzo a lisamana yi a ba-Dzwife áyato. Nkwumu a nde áli Dzayiruse. Nde ákunu mabuo mu nsie ŋa nkulu a Yiisu ya ábuono nde agye ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Nde áli a mwana wu mukaha mumõ wu a mvulu kwumu ya ywolo (12). Nde ákadzwana ya lipfu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yiisu bu ákagye, mpwumu a baara yínama nde ya yísi nde mpiŋi. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Ŋa nsa mpwumu a baara oyo óli a mukaha mutsyini. Nde áli a ebyele kii okapala makili ki ési mvulu kwumu ya ywolo (12). Nde ámana nzi a nde yohono kundaa bangaa-libughu, lo mbwuru si mumõ ka ási ti nde amono bubwe o. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Bu agyi ku mbihi a Yiisu, ábyeme mubele a enkuru e nde ya makili másaakaŋama. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Mu obo Yiisu áfwulu ndiri: «Nande byeme me?» Baara bwohono bátunu ya Piere ályele ti: «Mfumu, we li mu omono ti mpwumu a baara yiidzyi we ya yili mu osa we mpiŋi.» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Lo Yiisu ályele bu: «Mbwuru aabyeme me, mu kuulu me mono ti mpini yiipala mu nyuru a me.» <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ŋa ómono mukaha munde ti Yiisu agyahaba ndagha oyo, nde áyabwa ŋa myili mi Yiisu ya enkwughu kyehene. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ályele ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono mu emakye nde aabyeme enkuru e Yiisu, ya bu aadzughu nde mu matala maana mamo. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ndiri: «Ma mwana, kana li we liibvwuhu we. Gye mu edzuunu!»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ŋaala Yiisu nkini mu okabili, mbwuru mutsyini wu áafi ku nzo a Dzayiruse, mfumu a nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife ályele nde ti: «Mwana a we aakpi. Muluo ka li a ki aafiriyisa oko o.» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Lo Yiisu bu agyughu obo, ályele Dzayiruse ndiri: «Ka kala a nzalamweẽ o, sa yini a kana, nde sa adzughu.»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Yiisu bu áyato ŋa nzo a Dzayiruse, nde ka ágwi baara muswa wu osomo ya nde o. Yini a Piere, Dzake, Dzã, taara ya maama a mwana báasomo ya nde. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Baara bwohono bákalili ya bákanyoõ mu nkooro a lipfu li mwana. Mu obo Yiisu ályele ndiri: «Ka lili o! Nde ka aakpi o, lo nde ogyoŋomo aagyoŋomo.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Bo bákasebe nde mu kuulu bo bágyahaba ti mwana aakpi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Lo, Yiisu bu akwara mwana mu kwogho, ályele kundaa nde mu mpini ndiri: «Mwana, temene!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Mu matala maana mamo, ewumu e mwana éyabvughuru, ya maswa-maswa nde átemene. Yiisu ályele bo bagwa nde bi-odza. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Taara ya maama a mwana bákiŋimi ku olagha. Lo Yiisu átswi bo mukele banyaã olyele mbwuru ndagha oyo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gweghe bantumu kwumu ya buolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yiisu áti bantumu ba nde kwumu ya buolo (12) mbili ya ágwi bo emfumu ya mpaana yi obyi mifulu mi mibi ya odzuhu babyele. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Ŋa nseele, nde ágweghe bo bayitsala nsia yi a Emfumu e Nzaami, ya badzuhu babyele. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ka libiri elogho si emõ mu nzili o, ngu okala mukaana, empogholo, bi-odza, nzi, bwunu we enkuru kii byele. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Mu nswe nzo yi bagyagha be, likala omo tee matala ma liimara be oŋo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kala ti baara babihi be ogyagha, lipala mu bvulu lilo, ya likubulu lifufunu mu myili mi be mpaala okala bumpughulu mu bo.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bantumu bágyene, bátsala nsia yi a Emfumu e Nzaami mu bula nswe bula, ya bádzuhu babyele mu bibini byehene.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia a Yiisu yigwi Erode nzalamweẽ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Erode, mfumu a etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile, ágyughu myehene mi míkaluru, nde ka ábagha yi obili o, mu kuulu bana bákalyele ti: «Munde ngu Dzã Muboghoro aasighili mu lipfu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Babake bákalyele ti: «Munde ngu Eli aayabvughuru». Ya babake si ti: «Mumõ ŋa kara li mibighili mi mikulu aasighili mu lipfu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Lo Erode ályele ndiri: «Me aantumu bakehe Dzã mutswi. Lo mbwuru wu li mu okabulusa mandagha ma ndi mu ogyughu me nande?» Mu obo nde ákasagha omono Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gwi mapfwunu mataana ma baara bi-odza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Dzã 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Bantumu kwumu ya buolo (12) bu bayabvughuru, bályele Yiisu myehene mi bási bo. Yiisu ábiri bo ku ebini ki egwene a baara, mu nkolo yi a bvulu lili Betesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Baara balagha bagyughu ti Yiisu ákagye ku bvulu lilo, bo bánama nde. Nde ágyagha bo, áluo bo mu mi mitala Empu e Nzaami, ya ádzuhu babyele.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Bwihi bu bugyili, bantumu ba Yiisu kwumu ya buolo (12) bágyi kundaa nde ya bályele ti: «Lyele baara bagye ku mala ma masala ya ma manene ma mali bitaa-taa bi mu kuulu bayisagha bi-odza ya ebini ki ogyoŋomo. Bihi-a-be ŋa kara-a-kara a syehe lili.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Lo Yiisu ályele bo bu: «Ligwa bo bi-odza beme.» Lo bo bábvuhulu nde bu: «Bihi bi lili a bye yini a mampa mataana ya banswi buolo. We budzyi ti bihi ligye liswumu bilogho bi okughu odza mpwumu a baara yi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Mutala a babaghala ba báli oŋo áli ku bele a mapfwunu mataana (5 000). Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ndiri: «Libwihi baara nsini mu makaba mama baara makwumu mataana (50).» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Binduono bi nde bísi obo, ya bílyele baara bwohono babwa nsini.<verse eid="LUK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ágwolo mampa mataana ya banswi buolo, átala ku yulu, ábvurulu matuono kundaa Nzaami, ákehe mampa ya banswi, ágwi kundaa binduono bi nde mu kuulu bakaba bye kundaa baara. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Baara bwohono báli ya bágyughuru. Binduono bítolo bitsulu bi mampa ya ndaama a banswi bi bísyili, ya báluhu bitubu kwumu a byele.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere lyele ti Yiisu me Kriste</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mar 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Etsughu etsyini Yiisu ákasamana ŋa ebini kiili baara we, ya binduono bi nde bíli ya nde. Nde áfwulu bo ti: «Mu mbiili a baara, me nande ndi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bye bíbvuhulu nde bu: «Bitsimi bi baara bana ti we li Dzã Muboghoro, babake ti we li Eli, babake si ti we li mumõ ŋa kara li mibighili mi mikulu wu aasighili mu lipfu.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Lo, mu be, me nande ndi?» Piere ábvuhulu ti: «We li Kriste a Nzaami.» <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yiisu átswi bo mukele banyaã olyele mbwuru ndagha oyo.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lyele ndagha yitala lipfu li nde ya osighili o nde mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mat 16.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30">Mar 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yiisu áfirilyele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Mwana a mbwuru faana omono mpara yi alagha. Bakwuru, bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya Baluo-mikyene sa babihi nde. Sa badzwa nde, ya bitsughu bitere biluru, nde sa asighili mu lipfu.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele kundaa baara bwohono ti: «Kala ti mbwuru dzyi onama me, nde faana otunu nyuru a ndeme. Lo nde faana obiri kuruwa li nde nswe etsughu ya onama me. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Mu kuulu wu dzyi obvwuhu laama li nde, sa apfihili lo. Lo munde wu aapfihili lo mu nkooro a me, sa abvwuhu lo. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Nsa ndaana mbwuru aabagha kala ti bagha bupfulu bu nsie nsyini, lo pfihili laama li nde? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nswe munde wu akala aamono budzwa mu me ya mu mandagha ma me, Mwana a mbwuru sa amono nde budzwa ŋa ayabvughuru nde kunsa nsia a nde, nsia a Taara a nde, ya yi a bangye-yulu. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mu engaŋma, me ndyele be, ndaama a baara mu ba bali ŋa ka bakpa o, nsomo-a-nsomo bamono Emfumu e Nzaami.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu kunsa nsia a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mar 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Bitsughu mpuomo bu biluru ŋa mbihi a ŋa ályele nde mandagha mamo, Yiisu ágwolo Piere, Dzã ya Dzake, ya ákumu ku yulu a munguo mu oyisamana. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Mu matala maala nde mu okasamana, busu bu nde bu sobo efa ya biko bi nde bígyighili opeŋeme kuu oluru. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Mu matala maana mamo, babaghala buolo, Moyidze ya Eli, bákabili ya Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bo báyapala kunsa nsia ya bámoŋo ya Yiisu mu mi mitala bunu-a-bo nde ali afaana omana esala e nde mu oyikpa ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Piere ya bantumu buolo babake bábwi mukaba a tolo, lo bu babulusighili, bámono nsia a Yiisu ya babaghala buolo ba báli ya nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Mu matala ma óbaana Moyidze ya Eli ogye, Piere ályele Yiisu ndiri: «Muluo, bubwe buulu bihi lili ŋa. Bihi bibvulu bitere liitwu: Etsyini kii we, etsyini kii Moyidze ya etsyini kii Eli.» Piere ka ákasoolo mi ákabili nde o.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ŋaala nde nkini mu okabili obo, edzi égyi ya edzyimi-a-dzyimi ekye éfughu bo. Nzalamweẽ yíbagha bantumu ŋa básomo bo kunsa edzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, likyi lífi kunsa edzi lídzumu ti: «Wu me mwana a me, wu aansuolo me, ligyughu nde.» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Bu bamana ogyughu ndagha oyo, bantumu bámono yini a Yiisu ngasighi. Bo ka bátsughu ndagha o mu myehene mimye, ya mu matala mamo, bo ka bályele mbwuru mi bámono bo o.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu mwana wu aali mufulu wu mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mar 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Etsughu etsyini bu eluru, Yiisu ya binduono bi nde bitere bákumunu ku nsie a munguo, ya mpwumu a baara yi nene yíyabwana a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ŋa kara li mpwumu a baara, baghala mutsyini ákehe engubu ndiri: «Muluo, yoboo, mono mwana a me nyiĩ! Yini a mumõ wu me ndi a nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nswe matala, mufulu wu mubi aakasomo mu nde. Mu obo, mu matala maana mamo, mwana agwolo baana okehe mingili. Nde bwi elogho, ya fulu lipala mu muŋma. Mufulu munde li mu osuo nde kimini ya ka dzyi onyaã nde o. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Me aambuono binduono bi we bibyi mufulu munde, lo bye ka biileene o.»<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yiisu ágwi mvuru yi: «Ekaana ki egwene a kana, ya ki egwuŋumu! Tee nki matala me aankala ya be? Ya tee nki matala me aankuru mukolo mu be?» Mu obo Yiisu ályele baghala munde ndiri: «Yabiri mwana a we ŋa!» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mu matala ma ókayabehene mwana kundaa Yiisu, mufulu wu mubi ábwihi nde mu nsie ya ányihi nde mu mpini yohono. Lo Yiisu áfulu mufulu wu mubi epama, ádzuhu mwana ya ábvurulu nde kundaa taara a nde. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Baara bwohono bákiŋimi mu omono mpaana a Nzaami.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yiisu firibili mu mi mitala lipfu li nde</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ŋaala baara nkini mu okakiŋimi mu mandagha ma ókasa Yiisu, nde ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Be, ligyighili otyeghe matswi mu mandagha ma: Bafaana otyeghe Mwana a mbwuru ŋa myaã mi baara.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Lo binduono bi nde ka bábaghala ndagha oyo o. Nzaami átwulu bo kunsa nzi-nzimini mu kuulu banyaã ogyahaba mambaala ma ndagha oyo, ya bye bíbara nzalamweẽ mu ofwulu Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nande luru bunene ŋa kara li binduono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Binduono bítsoho bo-a-bo mu ogyahaba nande luru bunene ŋa kara li bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Lo Yiisu bu agyahaba bitsimi bi bo, ágwolo muke-muke, átwulu nde ŋa bele a nde <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ya ályele bo ndiri: «Nswe mbwuru wu gyagha muke-muke wu, mu nkwumu a me, meme nde agyagha. Ya nswe mbwuru wu gyagha me, wu aagweghe mehe si nde agyagha. Mu kuulu munde wu luru busala ŋa kara li be bwohono, me munde bvulu bunene.»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munde wu gwene bele bihi, ya bihi ali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Dzã ályele Yiisu ndiri: «Muluo, bihi liimono baghala mutsyini wu li mu okabyi mifulu mi mibi mu nkwumu a we. Bihi liisagha okahaba nde mu kuulu nde ka li mu okanama we ya bihi o.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Lo Yiisu ályele nde ndiri: «Ka likahaba nde o, mu kuulu munde wu gwene bele be, ya be ali.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babihi ogyagha Yiisu mu bula butsyini baba Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Yiisu ámono ti matala maa osihi nsie mu ogye ku yulu maabehene. Nde ágwolo munkaana wu ogye ku Yerusaleme. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Nde átswahaba baara ba bágyene ku bula butsyini baba etsulu e nsie kii Samari mu ogyighili nde ebini kii ogyoŋomo. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Lo baara ba bula bubo bábihi ogyagha nde, mu kuulu bagyahaba ti nde ku Yerusaleme ákagye. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Bu bágyughu obo, binduono bi nde byele, Dzake ya Dzã bályele ti: «Mfumu, we dzyi ti bihi liluomo mbaa yi mayulu yisughuru yiyadzwa bo?»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yiisu ákaghala kundaa bo ya áfyeẽ bo. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Mu obo, Yiisu ágyene ku bula bukimi ya binduono bi nde.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba badzyi onama Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ŋa báli bo mu nzili, baghala mutsyini ályele Yiisu ti: «Me sa nama we ku nswe ebini ki aagye we.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yiisu ályele nde ndiri: «Mibagha mili a miŋma, ya baŋmini bali a manzo, lo Mwana a mbwuru ka li a ebini kii ogwumu bwunu we kii ogyoŋomo o.» <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Nde ályele kundaa baghala mukimi ti: «Nama me!» Lo baghala munde ábvuhulu nde ti: «Mfumu, nyaã me manswama oyidzyighi taara a me.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yiisu ágwi nde mvuru yi: «Nyaã ba bákpi badzyighi bo-a-bo. Lo we gye yitsala Nsia yi a Emfumu e Nzaami.»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Baghala wu muke ályele ndiri: «Mfumu, me sa nama we, lo nsomo-a-nsomo nyaã me ngye yingwa basi dzumu li me mboro yi masini.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yiisu ábvuhulu nde ti: «Mbwuru wu kwara teme mu obaana osala nseghe, ya tala ku mbihi ka li a esala o mu mi mitala Emfumu e Nzaami.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gweghe binduono makwumu-nsaama ya byele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:7-16">Mat 10.7-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Mfumu ásuolo babaghala makwumu-nsaama ya buolo (72) bakimi ya ágweghe buolo-buolo mu nswe bvulu ya nswe ebini ki ágwaa nde ogye. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Nde ályele bo ndiri: «Esala kii otolo bimburu mu manseghe elagha, lo baara ba baasala basala. Liluomo kundaa Mfumu a nseghe agweghe basala bakimi mu otolo bimburu. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Ligye! Me ndi mu ogweghe be ti anga baana ba bindoomo ŋa kara li bango. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ka libiri nzi, empogholo, bwunu we bikoghoro o. Ka liluhu matala mu nzili mu okabulugwa baara mamboro o. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Nswe nzo yi liisomo be, nsomo lilyele ndiri: “Nyaã edzuunu ekala mu nzo yi!” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Kala mbwuru wu edzuunu li omo, edzuunu e be sa ekala ya nde. Kala pele, kye sa ebvughuru kundaa beme. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mu obo, likala mu nzo oyo, lidza ya liŋma nswe elogho ki baagwa be, mu kuulu musala faana obagha mufuru mu esala e nde. Ka lipala mu nzo oyo mu oyigyoŋomo mu nzo nswe nzo o.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kala ti be lisomo mu bvulu litsyini ya baara bagyagha be, lidza bi baagwa be. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Lidzuhu babyele ba bali mu bvulu lilo, ya lilyele baara ndiri: “Emfumu e Nzaami eeyabehene ya be.” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Lo, kala be lisomo mu bvulu litsyini ya baara babihi ogyagha be, ligye mu minsagha ya lilyele ti: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Bihi likubulu si lifufunu li bvulu li be li liinabara mu myili mi bihi. Lo ligyahaba yo ti Emfumu e Nzaami ali eeyabehene ya be.” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Me ndi mu olyele be engaŋma, mu etsughu ki oosa Nzaami muyala a basi nsie, masyeme ma basi Sodome sa maluru osala ya mama bvulu lilo.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabvulu ma mabihi osa kana Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:21-23">Mat 11.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Nyiĩ mu be, baara ba bvulu lili Koradzine, ya behe si baba bvulu lili Betesayida! Kala ti bimamaã bi oosi Nzaami mu mabvulu ma be, ku mama Tire ya Sidõ nde ási bye, baara baa oko nkini edzighi ekye ali bakaagyiŋi mayele, bakaalaha mangooro, ya bakaagyogho lifuru a mbaa mu nyuru mu osuo ti bo baagyiŋi mayele. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mu obo, mu etsughu ki oosa Nzaami muyala a basi nsie, masyeme ma oobagha Tire ya Sidõ sa maluru osala ya ma liibagha be. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Behe si, baara baba bvulu lili Kaperenawume! Be bu liikatsimi ti Nzaami sa akuhubu be tee ku mayulu? Pele, be sa libwa ku nsini a ebini ki oli mu okakebe ba bákpi masyeme.»<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yiisu áfirilyele binduono bi nde ti: «Nswe mbwuru wu gyughu be, me agyughu. Nswe wu bihi be, me abihi, ya nswe mbwuru wu bihi me, mbwuru wu aagweghe me abihi.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binduono makwumu-nsaama ya byele (72) biyabvughuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Binduono makwumu-nsaama ya byele (72) bíyabvughuru ya esee kyehene ya bílyele ti: «Mfumu, si okala mifulu mi mibi miikagyughu bihi, ŋa liikatumu bihi mye mipala mu baara mu nkwumu a we!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Me áli aankamono ŋa ófi Satana ku yulu ya ábwi ti bu ookabwa ngayulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Ligyughu! Me aangwi be mpaana yi odzyara mu yulu a bantaala ya bangie, ya mu odzyara lileene lwohono li mutaara, ya ka oli a elogho ki ekughu osa be bubi o. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Lo ka liŋene mu kuulu mifulu mi mibi mili mu okagyughu be o. Likala a esee mu kuulu mankwumu ma be baasono mo mu mayulu.»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esee e Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mu matala mamo, Mufulu a Ngili áluhu Yiisu mu esee ki elagha, mu obo Yiisu ályele ti: «Taara, Mfumu a yulu ya nsie! Me mvurulu we matuono, mu kuulu we aasweghe mandagha ma kundaa banga-a-munzeele ya banga-a-mayele, lo we aasuo mo kundaa bike-bike. Mu engaŋma, Taara, weme aadzyi ti okala obo. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Taara a me, we aatwulu bilogho byehene ŋa myaã mi me. Ka oli a mbwuru wu gyahaba Mwana nande ali o, kala ka oli yini a Taara o, ya ka oli a mbwuru wu gyahaba Taara nande ali o, kala ka oli Mwana. Mwana dzyi osuo bo Taara mu kuulu boho si basoolo nde.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ŋa nseele, Yiisu ákaghala kundaa binduono bi nde ya ályele yini a kundaa bo ti: «Esee mu be ba lili mu okamono mandagha ma! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Mu engaŋma, me ndi mu olyele be, mimono ya mikogho milagha miikadzyi omono mi lili mu okamono be, lo ka miimono mye o. Boho si báli a nzala ogyughu mi lili mu okagyughu be, lo ka baagyughu mye o.»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a musi Samari nga-a-mukolo wu mubwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Muluo-mikyene mutsyini ágyi kundaa Yiisu mu osagha obwihi nde, nde átsughu ndagha ti: «Muluo! Emakye me mfaana osa mu obagha laama lii mibvu ya mibvu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yiisu ágwi nde mvuru yi: «Bunu-abo básono mu mikyene mi Nzaami? We bunu-a-bo li mu obaghala mye?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Baghala munde ábvuhulu bu: <char style="qt">«Dzyi Mfumu Nzaami a we mu mukolo a we wohono, mu muwumu a we wohono, mu mpini a we yohono ya mu bitsimi bi we byehene</char>. Ya <char style="qt">Dzyi nganda-mbwuru ti budzyi we nyuru a weme.</char>» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Mu obo, Yiisu ályele nde ti: «We aagwi mvuru yi mbwe. Sa obo, ya we sa bagha laama.»<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Lo baghala munde bu ádzyi osuo ti efwulu e nde éli mu nzili, nde áfwulu Yiisu ndiri: «Nande li nganda-mbwuru a me?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yiisu ábvuhulu bu: «Etsughu etsyini baghala mutsyini ámara Yerusaleme ya ákakumunu ku Dzeriko. Mu nzili, bantwumu bábwirili nde, bátwulu nde mpene, bágwyini a nde mpaana, átaghaba ngaama ya bo bábulusihi nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ngaa a nzaami mutsyini áluru mu nzili oyo. Bu amono baghala munde, nde ábululuru o nde mu mukogho a nzili wu muke. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, mu-Lebvite áyato oŋo. Bu amono baghala munde, ndehe si áluru mu mukogho a nzili wu muke. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Lo musi Samari mutsyini áluru si mu nzili oyo. Bu amono baghala munde, nyiĩ yíbagha nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Mu obo, nde ásele ŋa bele a nde, ási nde maala ya bviini mu mambaala ya ákuru mo. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ákuhubu nde ŋa yulu a syevale a nde, ábiri nde ku nzo a banzyi, ya ábughu nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Bwihi bu buki, nde ágwolo badenali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denye litsyini lili nzi yi bákafiri mbwuru mu etsughu etsyini kii esala.</char></note> buolo, ágwi kundaa musala a nzo a banzyi, ya ályele nde ti: “Gyighili oyabughu nde, ya ŋa ayamvughuru me, me sa mvurulu we nzi yi aagyehe we mu nde ŋa yulu.”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yiisu áfirilyele nde ndiri: «Ŋa kara li baara batere babo, nande li nganda-mbwuru a baghala munde wu ogwyini a bantwumu mpaana?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Muluo-mikyene ábvuhulu ti: «Me mbwuru munde wu aamono nde nyiĩ». Mu obo Yiisu ályele ti: «Gye, ya wehe si sa bumõ».<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ku nzo a Marete ya Mari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Mu matala maala Yiisu áli mu nzili ya binduono bi nde, nde ásomo mu bula butsyini, mukaha mutsyini wu a nkwumu Marete agyagha nde mu nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Nde áli a mbwee wu mukaha, nkwumu a nde Mari. Nde áyibwa nsini ŋa myili mi Mfumu ya ákagyughu maluo ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Bisala bi nzo áli bígwolo Marete nyuru. Mu obo nde ásele ŋa ndaa Yiisu ya ályele nde ti: «Mfumu, we ka li mu otsimi ti mbwee a me bubi aasi mu onyaã me ngasighi ya esala kyehene ki o? Lyele nde ayabaha me.» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mfumu ábvuhulu nde bu: «Marete, Marete, we li mu onyoõ ya omono mukolo mpara mu mandagha malagha. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Lo yini a elogho etsyini eli a mupfunu. Mari aasuolo kaba li libwe, ya ka oli ya mbwuru wu aagwohono nde lo o.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu luo binduono bi nde bu bafaana osamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Etsughu etsyini, Yiisu ákasamana ŋa ebini etsyini. Bu amana, mumõ ŋa kara li binduono bi nde ályele nde ti: «Mfumu, luo bihi bu lifaana osamana, ti bu óluo Dzã binduono bi nde». <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yiisu ályele bo ndiri: «Ŋa liikasamana be, liikalyele bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Taara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nyaã nkwumu a we yikala yi a ngili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">nyaã Emfumu e we egya!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Gwa bihi bi-odza bibi faana mu nswe etsughu.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Sa masumu ma bihi kolokolo, mu kuulu bihi si liikasa babo ba baakasa bihi bubi kolokolo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Ya ka atala bihi libwa mu bigyeele o.”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yiisu áfirilyele bo ndiri: «Kala mumõ ŋa kara li be gyene yitala ndughu a nde kara-a-kara a mpyibi mu olyele nde ti: “Ndughu a me, sohobo me mampa matere. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Mu kuulu me mumõ mu bandughu ba me wu li mu dzwe maayato ku nzo a me, ya me ka ndi a elogho ki aangwa nde o.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Kala ti ndughu a we wu li munsa nzo bvuhulu: “Nyaã me pii, me nzo aankuru ofi, ya me ya baana ba me liigyoŋomo. Me ka nkughu ofirisighili mu ogwa we mampa o.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Me ndi mu olyele be yo: “Si kala ti nde ka sighili o ya ogwa we mampa mu kuulu we li ndughu a nde, nde sa asighili ya sa agwa we byehene bi li a we nzala bye, mu kuulu we ka aabara budzwa o mu oluomo ya we aasi epini.” <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Mu obo, me ndyele be ti: “Liluomo, ya sa bagwa be, lisagha, ya sa libagha, likoboro, ya sa badzubulu be. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Mu engaŋma, munde wu luomo sa bagwa nde, munde wu sagha, sa abagha, ya sa badzubulu kundaa munde wu aakoboro. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Nki Taara wu kughu ogwa mwana a nde ntaala kala ti mwana luomo nde nswi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Bwunu we ngie, kala ti mwana luomo nde bi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Kala ti be baara ba babi lisoolo ogwa bilogho bi bibwe kundaa baana ba be, lo Taara a be wu li ku mayulu, bunu akughu ogwene ogwa Mufulu a Ngili kundaa babo ba baaluomo nde nde?”»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu byi mifulu mi mibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mar 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Etsughu etsyini, Yiisu ábyi mufulu wu mubi wu áasi ti mbwuru akala nkini. Mufulu munde bu apala, baghala munde ábaana obili ya mpwumu a baara yíkiŋimi ku olagha. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Lo baara bana bályele ti: «Me mu nkwumu a Beledzebule, mukwuru a mifulu mi mibi nde ali mu okabyi mifulu mimye.» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Ya babake, bu bádzyi ogyeele Yiisu, báluomo nde asa elyimi ki eefa ku yulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Lo Yiisu bu ágyahaba bitsimi bi bo, ályele ndiri: «Nswe nsie yiili baara bali kunsa etaara ka yilaama o, ya manzo ma yo sa maakabwa mana ŋa yulu a mamake. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Mu obo, kala Satana li mu osa ti baara ba nde badzwana bo-a-bo, bunu-a-bo emfumu e nde eelaama? Be lili mu okalyele ti me Beledzebule li mu okagwa me mpaana yi obyi mifulu mi mibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Kala ti Beledzebule li mu okagwa me lileene lii obyi mifulu mi mibi, lo baana ba be nande aakagwa bo lileene lii okabyi mye? Mu obo, bo bomo sa balyele ti be ligyahaba ndagha. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Lo, kala mu lileene li Nzaami me ndi mu okabyi mifulu mi mibi, oli mu osuo ti Emfumu e Nzaami ayi emaayato kundaa be.»<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />«Ŋa ookakebe baghala nga a mpini wu li a bidzwana bi bikughu nzo a nde, bilogho bi nde byehene biikakala kunsa ekagha. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Lo, kala mbwuru wu luru nde mpini yadzwana ekyini ya nde, mbwuru munde sa agwohono bidzwana bi nde byehene bi aakasa nde kana, ya sa akaba bilogho bi nde byehene.»<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />«Nswe munde wuulu ka li emõ ya me o, li mutaara a me, ya nswe munde wu aagwene okabvughu ya me, nde aakatsala.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mufulu wu mubi bvughuru mu nyuru a mbwuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Ŋa ookapala mufulu wu mubi mu nyuru a mbwuru, nde aakayisagha ebini kii ogwumu ku syehe. Kala ti ka bagha kye o, nde sa atsimi bu: “Nyaã me mbvughuru ku nzo ku aamfi me.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Mu obo nde sa abvughuru ya sa ayabagha nzo bakuomo ya yifaana. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde sa apala ayigwolo mifulu mi mibi mikimi nsaama mi miluru nde bubi. Mye sa miyasomo ya sa mikala omo. Mu obo, mbwuru sa amono mpara yiluru oyo yi áli a nde nsomo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esee kii ngaŋma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yiisu bu amana obili obo, mukaha mutsyini wu áali kunsa mpwumu a baara átsughu ndagha ti: «Esee kundaa mukaha wu aaburu ya aaŋmihi we mabyene!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Lo Yiisu ágwi mvuru yi: «Lo esee kundaa baara ba bali mu okagyughu Ndagha a Nzaami ya ba bali mu okasalala yo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu bihi osa emamaã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Ŋa ósi mpwumu a baara Yiisu ŋa kara, nde ályele bo ndiri: «Baara baba eseene kii lolo ki bali babi! Bo bali mu oluomo elyimi. Lo ka bamono elyimi o, kala ti ka yini a kii Dzonase o. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu óli Dzonase elyimi mu basi Ninibve, Mwana a mbwuru si sa akala elyimi mu baara baba eseene ki. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Mu etsughu ki osa Nzaami mumfwunu a basi nsie, Ngasa a nsie yi a Sude sa atemene ŋa nkulu a baara baba eseene ki, ya sa agwa bo masyeme, mu kuulu nde aamara bula bu nde ba buli la mu oyagyughu maluo mama bunsughu ma ookaluo Salomõ. Lo ŋa oli ya mbwuru wu bvulu Salomõ. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mu etsughu kii mumfwunu a basi nsie, basi Ninibve sa batemene ŋa nkulu a baara baba eseene ki, ya sa bagwa bo masyeme mu kuulu bo baagyiŋi mayele ŋa baagyughu bo mukwughu wu ooti Dzonase. Lo, ŋa oli ya mbwuru wu bvulu Dzonase.»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mwindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Ka oli ya mbwuru wu aakanahaba mwindi mu osweghe nde bwunu we mu ofughu nde nkuru o, lo ŋa yulu ebini ki baakatwulu mwindi mu kuulu ba baasomo mu nzo bakala kunsa otsyeme. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Lihi li we lili ti mwindi a nyuru a we. Kala nta-ntala a we li yi mbwe, nyuru a we yohono sa yikala kunsa otsyeme. Lo, kala nta-ntala a we li yi mbi, nyuru a we yohono sa yikala kunsa mpyibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Mu obo, we faana osa mayele mu kuulu otsyeme ku oli mu we onyaã okala mpyibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Kala nyuru a we yohono yili kunsa otsyeme, ku ogwene a esighi si etsyini kunsa mpyibi, yo yohono sa yikala kunsa otsyeme ti ŋa ookatsehebe we mwindi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu fyeẽ ba-Faridzyẽ ya Baluo-Mikyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yiisu bu amana obili, mu-Faridzyẽ mutsyini ályele nde ayidza ku nzo a nde. Mu obo Yiisu ásomo mu nzo ya ábwi nsini mu odza. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mu-Faridzyẽ munde ákiŋimi mu omono ti Yiisu ka áswagha myaã o, nsomo-a-nsomo abaana odza ti bu óli ekulu ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mu obo, Mfumu ályele nde ti: «Be ba-Faridzyẽ, be lili a epfu ki okatsehebe bibaha ya mandoŋõ ma be ku mbihi, lo mu kara be lili a nzala a pfyibi ya mandagha mama nkehe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Be mayele we! Nzaami wu aagyighili bilogho bi biikamoŋono, me nde si aagyighili mukolo a mbwuru. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mu obo ligwa bawele bilogho bi bili mu bibaha ya mandoŋõ ma be, ya bilogho bi be byehene sa bikala bibi tse-tse.»<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />«Lo nyiĩ mu be ba-Faridzyẽ! Be liikagwa Nzaami kaba lili kwumu lili bilogho bi liikakunu be, ti bu oli mampihi-a-mpihi ya miswoho mimi bifa-bifa. Lo be liikadzinimi bunsumu ya dzyi li Nzaami. Mamo mandagha ma lifaana okasa be, ya ogwene odzinimi bibike nsimi.»<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />«Nyiĩ mu be ba-Faridzyẽ! Be liikadzyi okabwa nsini mu bipehe bibi ku nkulu mu manzo ma lisamana, ya be liikadzyi ti baara bakagwa be mamboro mama budziri mu bibini bi ookabvuŋunu baara. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Nyiĩ mu be! Be lili efaana kii mampyeme ma magwene a elyimi, maala baara bali mu okadzyara mo ku ogwene a ogyahaba.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mumõ ŋa kara li baluo-mikyene ályele nde ndiri: «Muluo, ŋa bili we obo, we aatughu bihi si!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yiisu ábvuhulu nde ti: «Nyiĩ si mu be baluo-mikyene! Be liikagwa baara matsulu mama leme mu obiri, lo be ka liikabaha bo si eke o. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Nyiĩ mu be! Mu kuulu be liikatwu mampyeme ma mibighili, lo bankagha ba be báadzwi mye. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Mu obo, be lili mu okasuo bumpughulu ti be liikakihi bigyighili bi ósi bankagha ba be, mu kuulu bo bádzwi mibighili, ya be liikatwu bo mampyeme. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Lo Nzaami mu mayele ma nde mwohono ályele bu: “Me sa ngweghe mibighili ya bantumu. Bo sa badzwa bana ya sa bamwehẽ babake kimini.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Mpaala baara baba eseene ki babagha masyeme mu nkooro a makili ma mibighili myehene mi bádzwi obaana ebaana e nsie, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />obaana lipfu li Abele tee mu lili Dzakari wu bádzwi ŋa kara li ebini ki baakatsughu Nzaami bikaba ya nzo a Nzaami yi nene. Me ndi mu olyele be, baara baba eseene ki sa babagha masyeme mu nkooro a makili ma bo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />«Nyiĩ mu be baluo-mikyene, mu kuulu be liimaha bvungulu li nzo yi aakagwa baara ligyahaba, be beme ka liisomo omo o, ya lili mu okakahaba babo ba badzyi osomo omo.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Mu matala ma ómara Yiisu ŋa ebini ekye, baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ bábaana okolo nde nkehe yi mbi ya okagwa nde bifwulu mu mandagha malagha. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Bo bákasagha osomo nde mu mweẽ nkini-a-nki nde ákughu opaha ndagha yi mbi.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Baara banga a bifa byele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mu matala mamo, mapfwunu ma baara mayabvuŋunu, mu obo babake bákadzyara myili mi banganda. Yiisu ábaana olyele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Lisa mayele mu pfini lili ba-Faridzyẽ, li lili mandagha mama fughuru-fughuru. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Etsughu eli kiili mandagha mwohono mama ensweghe sa magyighili omoŋono, ya mansweghe mwohono sa bagyahaba mo. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Mu obo, mandagha mwohono ma liibili be kunsa mpyibi, sa bagyughu mo mu nkara a mwiĩ, ya mandagha ma liilyele be mu mamfwunu munsa mangwumu ma manzo, sa bata mo mukwughu ku yulu a see li nzo lili eyala.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwuru wu bafaana obara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«A baana-abo, me bu ndyele be: Ka libara baara baala yina a nyuru bakughu odzwa o, lo ka bakughu osa elogho ekimi o. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Me be aansuo nande be lifaana obara. Mbwuru wu lifaana obara be, munde wuulu ŋa mbihi ŋa aamaha nde mbwuru muwumu, nde li a lileene lili otsili nde ku mungele-a-mbaa. Me ngyighili olyele be yo, me nde be lifaana obara. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ka baakatyeghe binswini-a-nswini bitaana mu mana a mipara myele o? Lo Nzaami ka aakadzimini si emõ mu bye nsimi o. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ngu okala mfu a be yi a ku mutswi, Nzaami gyahaba mutala a yo. Mu obo ka likala a nzalamweẽ o. Ŋa mihi mi Nzaami, be liluru mupfunu ya binswini-a-nswini bilagha!»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okihi bwunu we obihi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Me ndyele be bu, nswe mbwuru wu aakihi me ŋa mihi mi baara, Mwana a mbwuru si sa akihi nde ŋa mihi mi bangye-yulu ba Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Lo munde wu aatunu ŋa mihi mi baara ti nde ka gyahaba me o, Mwana a mbwuru sa abihi nde si ŋa mihi mi bangye-yulu ba Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Nswe mbwuru wu tughu Mwana a mbwuru kughu obagha kolokolo, lo munde wu aatsaala Mufulu a Ngili ka kughu obagha kolokolo o.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Ŋa akala baabiri be mu manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife mu osa be muyala, bwunu we kundaa bamfumu ya ba baakatumu, ka likala a mikolo maã-maã mu mandagha ma liibvuhulu be bo o, bwunu we mu mandagha ma akala liibili be. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Mu kuulu mu matala mamo Mufulu a Ngili sa asuo be mandagha ma lifaana obili be.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a esini ki egwene a munzeele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mbwuru mutsyini ŋa kara li ba báli oŋo ályele Yiisu ti: «Muluo, lyele naana a me akaba ya me pfa li oosihi taara bihi.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yiisu ágwi nde mvuru yi: «Ta baghala, nande aatwulu me nsughu a lamana a be bwunu we mbwuru wu aakaba pfa li be?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo nde ályele bo ndiri: «Lisa mayele linyaã okala a ntono a nzi, mu kuulu mbwuru ka kughu obagha laama lili ngaŋma mu nkooro a bilogho bi ali a bye o, si kala ti nde li a bye kyele.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Mu obo nde áti bo nkumu yi: «Esini etsyini éli a manseghe ma máburu ku olagha. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Nde ákatsimi ti: “Bunu-abo me aansa? Me ka aafirinsyili a ebini kii olwunu bimburu byehene bi aantolo me mu nseghe o.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Mu obo, nde ályele ti: “Me bu aansa: Me sa mbwihi bitaghala bi me ya me sa ntwu bibaã bi biluru bunene, ya me sa ntwulu mburu a bele a me ya bilogho bi me omo. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo sa ndyele muwumunu a ti: We aabunu bilogho bilagha bi bikughu osa bamvulu balagha. Gwumu o we, dza, ŋma ya kala mu esee!” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Lo Nzaami ályele nde ti: “We ewulu! Mu mpyibi yiyi we kpa aakpa. Lo bilogho byehene bi aalwunu we, nande aabyala bye?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yiisu áfiribwehe bu: «Bumõ kundaa munde wu aakakwu busini mu nkooro a ndeme, lo nde ka li esini ŋa nkulu a Nzaami o.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osa kana mu Nzaami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele binduono bi nde ndiri: «Me mu obo me ndyele be ti: Ka limono mukolo mpara mu nkooro a bi-odza bi bifaana mu laama li be o, bwunu we mu binkuru bi bifaana mu manyuru ma be o. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Mu kuulu, laama liluru bi-odza, ya nyuru yiluru binkuru. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Litala bangankwaã: Bo ka baakakunu o, ka baakatolo o, ka bali a bibaã bwunu we mangwumu ma baakalwunu bimburu o, lo Nzaami aakabuŋunu bo. Ligyahaba ti be liluru baŋmini mupfunu. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Nande ŋa kara li be kughu obwehe etsughu mu laama li nde mu nkooro a minyoõ mi nde? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Kala be ka likughu osa enda-ndagha kii obo o, mu emakye be lili a minyoõ mu bilogho bibike? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Litala bu ookamene bifulu mu ebiri, bye ka biikasala o, bye ka biikatwu o, lo me ndyele be ti, si kala Salomõ, mbwuru wu áali a nsia yi alagha, ka álaha bubwe oluru efulu emõ mu bye o. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Kala ti Nzaami aakalaha obo lolo nsele yili mu ebiri ya yiili mbala sa batsili yo ku mbaa, lo bunu-abo nde akala aangwene olaha be obo, be baara banga-a-kana li lisala? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Lo be, ka likasagha bilogho bi liidza bwunu we bi liiŋma, ya mikolo mi be minyaã okala mu yulu mu okatsimi mandagha mamo. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Mu kuulu, yini a babo baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o baakasughu mukolo mu bilogho byene bibye. Lo Taara a be gyahaba ti be lili a nzala a bilogho bibye. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nsomo-a-nsomo be lifaana osagha Emfumu e Nzaami, ya sa bagwa be bilogho bibike bibye.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Mukaã a bindoomo wu asala, ka kala a nzalamweẽ o, mu kuulu Taara a be aamono ti oli bubwe nde agwa be Emfumu e nde.<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Busini mu mayulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mat 6.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Lityeghe bilogho bi lili a be ya ligwa nzi kundaa bawele. Likala a bimpogholo bi nzi bi biigwene okakagha, lilwunu mu mayulu busini bu buugwene okafa, mu kuulu oko muturu ka kughu oturu bo o, ya bansiele ka bakughu odza bo o. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Mu kuulu ebini ki okala busini bu be, me oŋo ŋa okala mikolo mi behe si.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisala bi biikakahala mihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Likala yeelee, <char style="qt">likuru nswele mu bala</char> ya lisa kuulu ti miindi mi be mikala mi minama. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Behe si, likala ti anga baara ba bali mu okakebe mfumu a bo, wu aagyene ku kyiri kii mabala, mpaala badzubulu nde nzo maswa-maswa ŋa ayabvughuru nde ya ŋa aakoboro nde muŋma a nzo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Esee kundaa bisala bi ooyabagha mfumu a bo ŋa aagya nde mu okakahala mihi! Mu engaŋma, me ndyele be, nde sa alaha binkuru bi nde bii esala, sa abwihi bo nsini ŋa tabele, ya nde ndeme sa agwa bo bi-odza. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Ngu okala ti nde gyi kara-a-kara a mpyibi bwunu we ku ookya bwihi, ya nde ayabagha bo mu okakahala mihi, bo sa bakala kunsa esee ki elagha.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Limatsimi ati. Kala ti nga-a-nzo aakasoolo matala ma okagya muturu, nde nkini aakasa myehene mu kuulu banyaã obulu nzo a nde. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Behe si likala yeelee, mu kuulu Mwana a mbwuru kughu ogya mu matala maala be ka lili a si bitsimi bi mo o.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esala ki ebwe ya ki ebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Mu obo Piere áfwulu nde ti: «Mfumu, we yini a mu bihi aati nkumu oyo, bwunu we mu baara bwohono?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mfumu ábvuhulu nde ndiri: «Nande li musala wu aakakebe ya aakasalala bilogho bi mfumu a nde wu mayele ya wu bakughu osa kana mu nde, wu ootwulu mfumu mukwuru a basala ba nde, mu kuulu akagwa bo bi-odza mu matala ma mafaana? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Esee kundaa musala munde kala ti mfumu a nde yabvughuru ya yabagha nde mu okasala esala ekye! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Mu engaŋma me ndyele be, mfumu munde sa agwa bilogho bi nde byehene ŋa myaã mi nde, mu kuulu nde akatala bye. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Lo kala ti musala munde tsimi bu: “Mfumu a me li mu ogyili”. Ya kala nde baana odzwa basala babake baba babaghala ya baba bakaha nkubu, kala ti nde bwi mu odza, oŋma ya okolo mala, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mfumu a musala munde sa ayabvughuru ensihibi mu etsughu ya matala maala nde ka agyahaba o. Nde sa agwini a nde nkubu yi luru, sa abagha masyeme mamo ya baara ba bagwene a kana. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Musala wu gyahaba mi okadzyi mfumu a nde, lo kwono ogyighili dzyi li nde, sa bakaha nde nswa-nswa yi alagha. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Lo munde wu gwene gyahaba mi okadzyi mfumu a nde ya gyighili mandagha ma makughu osa ti bakaha nde nswa-nswa, ka badzwa nde nkubu yi alagha o. Sa basagha bi bilagha kundaa munde wu baagwi bi bilagha. Sa baluomo bi biluru kundaa munde wu baagwi bi bibvulu.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu aayabiri munkaghaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Me aayantsili mbaa ŋa yulu a nsie. Me áli ndzyi omono mbaa oyo yimaalughulu. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Oli a liboghoro li mfaana me obagha, ya mukolo a me li a mbaa mu obaabagha lo!<verse eid="LUK 12:50" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Be bu litsimi ti me edzuunu aayangwa ŋa nsie? Pele! Me bu ndyele be: Me aangyi mu okabala baara. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Mu kuulu, obaana etsughu kii lolo dzumu lili baara bataana sa likaghaba, nkolo mõ baara batere, nkolo yinke baara buolo: <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Munkaghaba sa akala ŋa kara li taara ya mwana a nde wu baghala, ŋa kara li <char style="qt">mwana wu baghala </char> ya <char style="qt">taara </char> a nde, ŋa kara li ngughu ya mwana a nde wu mukaha, ŋa kara li <char style="qt">mwana wu mukaha</char> ya ngughu a nde, ŋa kara li <char style="qt">bako ba bakaha bo-a-bo</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obaghala bilyimi bibi matala ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yiisu áfirilyele kunda mpwumu a baara bu: «Ŋa liikamono be edzi kii epyini ku ookadzyama tala, mu matala maana mamo be liikalyele ti: “Mvulu sa anoõ”. Ya ookakala obo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Ya ŋa liikamono be efulu ki eekafa ku Sude, be liikalyele: “Lolo mwiĩ sa agyighili obala”. Ya ookakala obo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku baana a Isarayele, oli ya syehe li linene ku oli a mwiĩ wu alagha. Mu obo efulu ki eekafa oko eekayabiri mwiĩ.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Be baara ba lili fughuru-fughuru! Be ligyahaba okabaghala mandagha ma liikamono ku yulu ya ŋa nsie ŋa. Mu emakye liikuono obaghala mandagha ma mali mu oluru mu matala ma?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyiẽ ya mitaara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mat 5.25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Mu emakye be beme liikakuono obaghala mandagha mama bunsumu? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Mu matala ma li mu okagye we kundaa nsughu a lamana ya mutaara a we, sa myehene mu ogwihini ya nde ŋaala be nkini mu nzili. Kala pele, mbwuru munde sa abiri we kundaa nsughu a lamana, ya nsughu sa agwa we ku myaã mi bambumbulu mu kuulu balo we mu boloko. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Me ndyele be, we ka pala mu boloko o, kala ti we ka mana ofiri ebyimi kyehene o.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ogyiŋi mayele bwunu we okpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mu matala maana mamo, ndaama a baara báyalyele Yiisu mi míbwi mu basi Ngalile ba ódzwi Pilate, mu matala ma bákatsughu bo bikaba. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yiisu ábvuhulu bo ti: «Be bu litsimi ti basi Ngalile babo bámono mpara oyo, mu kuulu bo bábvulu a masumu mu baara bwohono baba mu Ngalile? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Pele! Lo me ndyele be, kala ti be ka ligyiŋi mayele o, be bwohono sa likpa ti bu bákpi bo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Lo baara kwumu a mpuomo (18) ba bákpi ŋa óbwi nzo yi mutele yi a Silowe ŋa yulu a bo, be bu litsimi ti bo báluru baara bwohono babake baba Yerusaleme bubi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Pele! Lo me ndyele be, kala ti be ka ligyiŋi mayele o, be bwohono sa likpa ti bu bákpi bo.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mufinge wu aagwene okaburu bimburu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21.18-19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:43">43</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:4-5">Rom 2.4-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yiisu áfirita nkumu yi: «Baghala mutsyini áli ákunu mufinge mu nseghe a nde yi a bviini. Etsughu etsyini nde áyasagha bimburu, lo ka ábagha elogho o. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Mu obo nde ályele kundaa musala a nseghe a bviini ti: “Mibvu ayi mitere mi ndi mu okayasagha me bimburu mu mufinge wu, lo ka ndi mu okabagha elogho o. Kpaa nde! Mu emakye nde ali mu okakala nsie kuu bwunu?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Lo musala ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Mfumu, mafirinyaã nde mubvu wu. Me sa nsimi nde mu bele-a-bele, ya me sa ndo nde mbwoho, <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />nkini-a-nki buru bimburu mu bitsughu bi biigya. Kala pele, sa kpaa o we nde”.»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu mukaha mutsyini mu etsughu kii sabate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-13">Mat 12.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:1-6">Luk 14.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:8">Bik 146.8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Mu etsughu kii sabate, Yiisu ákaluo mu nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Omo óli a mukaha mutsyini wu áali a mufulu wu mubi wu áagwi nde epfwumu, mu bamvulu kwumu a mpuomo (18). Ebughu e nde éli ekorono ya nde ka ákakughu otemene nsumu o. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yiisu bu amono nde, áti nde mbili ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mukaha, baakwulu we mu epfwumu e we». <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo nde ánaã nde myaã. Mu matala maana mamo, mukaha átemene nsumu ya ábwi okasyighi Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Lo mukwuru a nzo a lisamana a ba-Dzwife ákolo nkehe mu kuulu Yiisu ádzuhu mbwuru mu etsughu kii sabate. Mu obo, nde ályele kundaa mpwumu a baara ti: «Bihi-a-be bitsughu bisemene lili a bye bibi esala<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:9-10">Opa 20.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:13-14">Det 5.13-14</ref></char></note>. Liikayasagha libughu mu bitsughu bibye, lo ka mu etsughu kii sabate o.» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mfumu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ndiri: «Be lili baara baba bifa byele! Mu etsughu kii sabate, nande ŋa kara li be aagwene okanyana ngoomo bwunu we aane a nde swe ŋa ebini ki aakadza nde mu oyigwa nde madza aŋma? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ya mwana a Abarahame wu mukaha wu, bamvulu kwumu a mpuomo (18) bamaaluru, obaana bu ókuru nde Satana minkana. Mu obo, bubi mu bu aanyana me nde minkana mimye mu etsughu kii sabate?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ŋaala nde mu okabili obo, mitaara mi nde mímono budzwa, lo mpwumu a baara yímono esee mu mandagha ma manene ma mabwe ma ókasa Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a liburu li mutaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Mu obo, Yiisu áfirilyele ti: «Mu nki efaana Emfumu e Nzaami eli, ya emakye me nkughu obvughu kye? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Kye efaana ya liburu li mutaade li ókunu mbwuru mu ebwa e nde. Bu lilughubu, likulu ya likighiri muti, mu obo baŋmini baba yulu báyatwu manzo mu mampala ma nde.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a pfini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13.33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yiisu áfirilyele ti: «Ya emakye me nkughu obvughu ya Emfumu e Nzaami? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Kye efaana ya pfini li ólo mukaha mutsyini ya ábvughu lo ya makaba matere mama farine. Mu obo nkpaŋa yohono yíkumu.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muŋma a nzo wu a sala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ŋa ókagye Yiisu ku Yerusaleme, nde ákabulusomo mu mabvulu ya mu mala, ya ákabululuo. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mbwuru mutsyini áfwulu nde ndiri: «Mfumu, yini a mana ndaama a baara akala baabvwughu?» Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Lisa makpa lisomo mu muŋma a nzo wu a sala. Mu kuulu, me ndyele be yo, balagha akala baasagha osomo lo bo ka baleene o.»<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />«Etsughu eli mu ogya, kiili nga-a-nzo sa atemene ya sa akuru yo. Mu obo be sa likala ku mbala, sa libaana okoboro nzo ya olyele ndiri: “Mfumu, dzubulu bihi nzo!” Lo nde sa abvuhulu be bu: “Me ka ngyahaba ku liifi be o!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Mu obo be sa lilyele nde: “Bihi ali liikadza ya okaŋma emõ ya we, ya we aakaluo mu minsagha mi bihi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Lo nde sa abvuhulu kundaa be bu: “Me ka ngyahaba ku liifi be o! Ligye la ya me, be bwohono ba lili mu okasa bubi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Oko sa okala a bilili ya nkerene a myini, mu matala ma liimono be Abarahame, Idzake ya Dzakobe ya mibighili myehene, babwi nsini mu Emfumu e Nzaami, lo be bapaha be ku mbala. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Baara balagha baafa ku esete ya ku wesete, ku nore ya ku sude, sa basomo kunsa malagha ma odza mu Emfumu e Nzaami<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Mat 19.30</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:16">20.16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10.31</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Ya mono, baara babake ba bali binsiele-mbihi sa bakala baba nsomo, ya ba bali baba nsomo sa bakala binsiele-mbihi.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gyene ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Mu matala maana mamo, ndaama a ba-Faridzyẽ yígyi kundaa Yiisu ya yílyele nde ti: «Mara ŋa, gye o we, mu kuulu Erode dzyi odzwa we.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Lo Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Ligye liyilyele mubagha munde bu: “Mono, me ndi mu obyi mifulu mi mibi ya odzuhu babyele lolo, ya mbala, ya etsughu kii bitere, esala e me sa efa”. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Lo me mfaana osa esala e me lolo, mbala ya mbaala ŋa epala, mu kuulu yini a ŋa Yerusaleme bafaana odzwa mubighili, ka oli nkolo nkimi o.»<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />«Yerusaleme, Yerusaleme! We wu aakadzwa mibighili ya wu aakadzwa mu mameẽ babo ba ookagweghe Nzaami kundaa we. Lo mu nswe matala, me aakansagha obvughu baana ba we ti bu ookabvughu nsuhu baana ba nde kunsa mapaba. Lo be ka liikadzyi o. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Mono, Nzaami sa atyeghe nzo a be ebughu. Me ndyele be yo, be ka lifirimono me o, tee matala ma liilyele be ti: <char style="qt">Liseme likala mu munde wu li mu ogya mu nkwumu a Mfumu</char>.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Dze 22.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Bik 118.26</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu firidzuhu mubyele mu etsughu kii sabate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mu etsughu emõ kii sabate, Yiisu áli áyadza ku nzo a mukwuru ba-Faridzyẽ mutsyini. Ba-Faridzyẽ bákagyighili otala nde. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Mbwuru mutsyini wu áli a bubyele baba bituru ágyi ŋa nkulu a Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yiisu áfwulu baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ ti: «Bunu, oli a muswa wu odzuhu mbwuru mu etsughu kii sabate, bwunu we pele?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Lo bo ka bábvuhulu ndagha o. Mu obo, Yiisu ákwara mubyele, ádzuhu nde ya ályele nde abvughuru ku nzo. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Nande mu be wuulu kala ti mwana a nde wu baghala, bwunu we ngoomo a nde bwi munsa dzunu li madza mu etsughu kii sabate, ka apaha nde maswa-maswa o?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Bo ka bákughu ogwa nde mvuru mu ndagha oyo o.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebini kii nsomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yiisu bu amono ti baara ba óti mu-Faridzyẽ mbili mu oyadza bákasuolo bibini bibi nsomo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Kala ti mbwuru ti we mbili mu ogye ku mabala, ka ayibwa nsini ŋa ebini kii nsomo o. Nkini-a-nki baati mbwuru mukimi wu luru we bunene mbili. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ya mbwuru wu aati be bansa buolo mbili anyaã oyalyele we ndiri: “Gwa nde ebini ki”. Mu obo, we sa mono budzwa mu oyibwa nsini ŋa ebini kii masini. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Lo, kala ti bati we mbili, gye yibwa nsini ŋa ebini kii masini, mu kuulu mu matala ma ogya munde wu aati we mbili, nde sa alyele kundaa we ti: “Ndughu a me, kumu ŋa yulu ŋa!”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:6-7">Man 25.6-7</ref></char></note> Mu obo, we sa kala a budziri ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono ba bali mu odza ya we. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Mu kuulu, munde wu aasagha oseŋene mu endeme, sa babvurulu nde linsie, ya munde wu aabvughuru linsie, sa baseene nde.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagha yitala baara ba lifaana ota mbili ku malagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yiisu ályele si kundaa munde wu áati nde mbili ndiri: «Ŋa aakadza we mu mwiĩ, bwunu we mu nkonkolo, ka akata bandughu ba we mbili o, si okala banaana ya bambwee ba we, taara ya ngughu a we, bisini bi bili bitaa-taa ya we o, mu kuulu boho si sa babvurulu we mi aagyighili we bo. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Lo, kala we dzyi odza malagha, ta bawele, banga-a-bipfwumu, bikara ya binkpa-mihi mbili. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Mu obo, we sa kala a esee mu kuulu bo ka bali a elogho ki baabvurulu we o. Yini a Nzaami akala aabvurulu we bye, mu matala ma oosighili baba bunsumu mu lipfu.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a malagha ma manene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Bu amana ogyughu mandagha mamo, mbwuru mutsyini wu áabwi nsini ya Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Esee kundaa munde wu akala aadza mu malagha mama Emfumu e Nzaami!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ndiri: «Mbwuru mutsyini ási malagha ya áti baara balagha mbili. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Matala ma odza bu mato, nde ágweghe musala a nde mu oyilyele bo bu: “Ligya, mu kuulu bilogho byehene biikughu”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:4">Mat 22.4</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Lo bo bwohono mu etsimi emõ, bábaana ogwa mabwu. Wu a nsomo ályele nde ti: “Me aanswumu nseghe ya me mfaana oyitala yo. Me mbuono we, sa me kolokolo”. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Mukimi ályele nde ndiri: “Me mfi ku oswumu bangoomo kwumu, ya me ndi mu nzili mu oyigyeele bo. Me mbuono we, sa me kolokolo”. <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Ya mukimi si ályele ti: “Me bu bu nkie, mu obo, me ka nkughu ogya o.” <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Musala munde ábvughuru kundaa mfumu a nde ya ályele nde myehene mimye. Mu obo mfumu ákolo nkehe ya ályele kundaa musala a nde ti: “Sa maswa, gye mu bibini bi ookabvuŋunu baara bwohono, ya mu minsagha mimi munsa bvulu, gya a me ŋa bawele, ba banga-a-bipfwumu, binkpa-mihi ya bikara.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Musala ályele kundaa nde ti: “Mfumu! Me aansi bu aatumu we, lo nkini ya bibini mu nzo.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Mu obo, mfumu ályele kundaa nde bu: “Gye mu manzili ya kunsa bibolo, sa myehene, tsiini baara basomo mu nzo a me mu kuulu yo yilwulu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Me ndyele be bu, mu baara ba aanti me mbili nsomo, si mumõ mu bo ka adza bilogho mu kyiri e me o.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37-39">Mat 10.37-39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24-26">16.24-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:49-50">Mar 9.49-50</ref></char></note><verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunu-abo mbwuru akughu onama Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Mu kuulu mampwumu ma baara mákanama Yiisu, nde ákaghala ya ályele kundaa bo ti: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Mbwuru wu dzyi ogya kundaa me, ka kughu okala enduono e me o kala ti nde ka bele taara ya ngughu, mukala, baana, bambwee ya banaana ba nde ba bakaha ya ba babaghala, ya laama li ndeme o. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Ya munde wu bihi obiri kuruwa li nde ya onama me, ka kughu okala enduono e me o. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Mu kuulu, ŋa kara li be mbwuru wu dzyi otwu nzo yi mutele, emakye aatswama okasa? Nsomo-a-nsomo, nde sa abwa nsini, ya sa atsimi mu mutala a nzi wu a faana, ya mu otala kala ti nde kughu omana yo. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Kala pele, kala ti nde baana bitsini bi bibagha bi yo, ya kwono omana yo, baara bwohono ba baamono yo sa basebe nde ya balyele ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />“Mbwuru munde aabaana otwu nzo, lo aakwono omana yo”. <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Bumõ si kundaa mukogho wu li a bambumbulu mafwunu kwumu (10 000), kala ti dzyi odzwana mvulu ya mukogho mukimi wu li a bambumbulu mafwunu makwumu muolo (20 000), ema aatswama osa? Nsomo-a-nsomo, nde sa abwa nsini ya atsimi kala ti nde kughu oyibwana a munde wu aayabaana nde mvulu. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Kala nde mono ti ka akughu o, nde sa agweghe nde ntumu buulu bagwihini mu osa eyeŋe, ŋaala wu muke nkini la. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Mu obo, nswe mbwuru ŋa kara li be ka kughu okala enduono e me o, kala ti nde ka asihi bilogho bi nde byehene o.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungba wu gwene a ntyere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Mungba li elogho ki ebwe, lo kala ti ntyere a nde yifi, bunu-a-bo bakughu ofiribvurulu nde yo? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Nde ka aafirisyili a esala o, ngu okala mu nsie, bwunu we mu mbwoho. Lo baakatsili nde ku mbala. Nyaã munde wu li a matswi mu ogyughu, agyughu!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Endoomo ki édzimini emoŋono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Etsughu etsyini, mintolo-mpagha ya banga-a-masumu bákayabehene bo bwohono kundaa Yiisu mu ogyughu nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ba-Faridzyẽ ya baluo-mikyene bákaŋuŋunu ya bákalyele ndiri: «Mbwuru wu li mu okagyagha banga-a-masumu ya li mu okadza ya bo.»<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Lo Yiisu áti bo nkumu yi: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Nande ŋa kara li be kala ti nde li a bindoomo nkama (100), ya kala ti etsyini edzimini, nde ka abulusihi makwumu-wa ya wa (99) bibike ku syehe mu oyisagha emõ ekye ki eedzimini tee ŋa aayimono nde kye o? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Kala ti nde mono kye, nde sa akala a esee, sa atwulu kye ŋa yulu a bisaŋama bi nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Ya bu ayabvughuru ku nzo, nde sa ata bandughu ba nde mbili ya ba bali bitaa-taa bibye, ya sa alyele kundaa bo ti: “Ligya likala mu esee ya me, mu kuulu me aamono endoomo e me ki ali eedzimini.” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Me ndyele be ti mu mayulu si bumõ, kala mbwuru yini a mumõ gyiŋi mayele, sa bamono esee ki eluru ki baakamono mu baara makwumu-wa ya wa (99) ba bali bunsumu ba bagwene a nzala a ogyiŋi mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzi yi aadzimini yimoŋono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Bwunu we, kala ti mukaha li a mipara mimi bisyeẽ kwumu, ya mupara mutsyini dzimini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mu matala mamo, mupara mutsyini mu nde áli nzi yi bákafiri mbwuru mu etsughu etsyini kii esala</char></note>, lo nde ka anahaba mwindi, ka akwomo nzo ya okabulusagha nde ya bunkere tee ŋa aamono nde mupara mu nde o? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ŋa aamono nde mupara, sa ata bandughu ba nde mbili ya ba bali bitaa-taa bibye, ya olyele bo ndiri: “Liyakala mu esee ya me, mu kuulu me aamono mupara a me wu ali aadzimini.” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Bumõ si, me ndi mu olyele be, bangye-yulu ba Nzaami baakamono esee mu yini a nga-a-masumu mutsyini wu gyiŋi mayele.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana wu áadzinimi moŋono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yiisu áfirilyele bu: «Baghala mutsyini áli a baana buolo ba babaghala. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Mbwee ályele kundaa taara a nde ti: “Taara, gwa me kaba lili busini lili ndaa me”. Mu obo taara ákaba bo busini bu nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mana bitsughu bu biluru, mwana wu baghala wu a sala átolo byehene bi áli a bye ya ágyene ku nsie yi a la. Oko nde ábyihi busini bu nde mu laama lili bisee. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Bu agyehe nzi a nde yohono, nde ásyili myaã-a-myaã. Ewala ki enene égyi mu nsie oyo, ya nde ábaana okpa nzala. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Mu obo, nde áyisagha esala kundaa musi nsie oyo mutsyini. Nde ágweghe nde ku ebiri mu okabulukebe bangubulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Mu nkooro a nzala, nde ádzyi ogyughuru mu bi-odza bi bangubulu, lo ka óli a mbwuru wu aagwa nde bye o. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Mu obo, nde ábaana otsimi ya obili bu: “Basala ba taara a me bwohono baakadza bu badzyi, lo me ŋa ndi mu okakpa nzala. <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Me sa ntemene, sa ngye kundaa taara a me, ya sa ndyele nde bu: Taara, me aansi masumu kundaa Nzaami ya kundaa we. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Ka bafaana ofirita me mwana a we o, gwolo me ti mumõ ŋa kara li basala ba we.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Nde átemene ya ágyene kundaa taara a nde.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">«Ŋaala nde nkini la, taara a nde, átaala nde, nyiĩ yíbagha nde. Ábara ntyini, áyibwumu nde ya ányuburu nde. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana ályele kundaa nde ti: “Taara a me, me aansi masumu kundaa Nzaami ya kundaa we, ka bafaana ofirita me mwana a we o”. <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Lo taara ályele kundaa basala ba nde ti: “Lisa maswa, liyabiri me enkuru ki eluru bubwe ya lilaha nde kye. Lilaha nde mulwu mu mulyeme, ya bikoghoro mu myili. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Ligya a pulu li ngoomo lili maala, lidzwa lo. Litswe lidza ya likala kunsa esee. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Mu kuulu mwana a me wu áli ákpi, lo aasighili mu lipfu, áli ádzimini, lo aafirimoŋono”. Ya bábaana osa kyiri.»<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />«Mu matala mamo, mwana wu mukwuru áli munsa nseghe. Nde bu ayabvughuru, áyabehene ya nzo, ya nde ágyughu nkele a bikwumu ya makini. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Nde áti musala mutsyini mbili ya áfwulu ndiri: “Nki ndagha yili mu okaluru mu nzo?” <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Musala munde ábvuhulu nde bu: “Mbwee a we aayabvughuru, ya taara a we aatumu badzwa pulu li ngoomo lili maala bu aamono nde ti nde aagyi bunsiili”. <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Nde ákolo nkehe ya ábihi osomo mu nzo. Taara a nde ápala mu obuono nde asomo mu nzo. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Lo nde ábvuhulu kundaa taara a nde bu: “Mono, bamvulu balagha me ndi mu okasalala we. Me nkini ámaambihi osa litumu li we o. Lo we nkini ámaagwa me si mwana a ntaba mu osa kyiri ya bandughu ba me o. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Lo mu matala ma oyabvughuru mwana a we wu wu aamana busini bu we bwohono mu okabulutaama ya bakaha banga-a-enkwunu, we aatumu badzwa pulu li ngoomo lili maala mu nkooro a nde!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Taara ályele kundaa nde ti: “Mwana a me, we li ya me matala mwohono. Bilogho bi me byehene bili bibi ndaa we. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ali lifaana okala kunsa kyiri ya esee, mu kuulu mbwee a we áli ákpi, ya aasighili mu lipfu, nde áli ádzimini, ya aafirimoŋono.”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Musala wu aakakebe ya aakasalala bilogho bi mfumu a nde wu mayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yiisu ályele si kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Óli a esini etsyini ki éli a musala wu aakakebe ya aakasalala bilogho bi mfumu a nde. Báyalyele nde ti musala a nde ákabyihi busini bu nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Mu obo, Mfumu áti nde mbili ya ályele kundaa nde ti: “Mamo nki mandagha me ndi mu okagyughu mu nyuru a we? Suo me bu aasi we esala e we, mu kuulu we ka kughu ofirikala musala wu aakakebe ya aakasalala bilogho bi me o.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Musala munde átsimi mu mukolo a nde ndiri: “Bunu-abo me aansa, buulu mfumu a me me aamaha mu esala? Me ka ndi a makpa mu osala esala kii manseghe o. Ya okabululuomo nzi kundaa baara, me sa mono budzwa! <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Aa! Me ngyahaba emakye me aansa, mu kuulu baara bagyagha me mu manzo ma bo mu matala ma baamaha me mu esala.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Mu obo, bu ati mbwuru-mbwuru mbili mu ba báli a ebyimi ya mfumu a nde, nde áfwulu wu a nsomo bu: “Ebyimi kii kpe we li a kye ya mfumu a me?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Mbwuru munde ábvuhulu nde ti: “Batono nkama (100) baba maala”. Musala ályele nde ndiri: “Ma mukaana a we wu a ebyimi, bwa nsini mu maswa ya sono: Batono makwumu mataana (50).” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ályele kundaa wu muke ndiri: “Lo we, ebyimi kii kpe we li a kye”? Nde ábvuhulu nde bu: “Me ebyimi kii basaake nkama (100) baba bimburu bi bele”. Musala ályele kundaa nde ti: “Ma mukaana a we wu a ebyimi ya sono bu: basaake makwumu mpuomo (80)”. <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Mfumu ásyighi musala munde wu mubi mu nkooro a mayele ma nde. Mu engaŋma basi nsie baluru mayele mu mandagha ma bo ya ba bali kunsa otsyeme.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Ya me bu ndyele kundaa be: «Nzi yiikapfiri baara balagha, lo be lisalala yo mu kuulu likala a bandughu. Mpaala mu matala ma oofa nzi oyo, sa bagyagha be mu manzo mu bamvulu ya bamvulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mbwuru wu aakagyughu mfumu a nde mu mandagha ma masala, aakagyughu nde si mu mandagha ma manene, wu aagwene okagyughu nde mu mandagha ma masala, ka akala aagyughu nde si mu mandagha ma manene o. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Mu obo kala ti be ka lili a yughu o mu busini baba gwene a bunsumu, nande aasa kana mu be mu busini baba engaŋma? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ya kala ti be ka lili a yughu mu bilogho bi mbwuru mukimi o, nande aagwa be bibi ndaa beme?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Ka oli a musala wu kughu osalala bamfumu buolo o. Kala pele, nde sa abele mutsyini ya sa adzyi wu muke, bwunu we sa anabara mu mumõ ya sa abele wu muke. Be ka lifaana osalala Nzaami ya nzi o.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandagha ma Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Ba-Faridzyẽ ba baakadzyi nzi, bu bagyughu myehene mimye, bo bákasa Yiisu munsensehẽ. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ndiri: «Be lili mu okasa mandagha mpaala limoŋono ti be lili bunsumu ŋa mihi mi baara, lo Nzaami gyahaba mikolo mi be, mu kuulu mandagha ma ookamono baara ti mali ma manene, mali mandagha ma maluru bubi ŋa mihi mi Nzaami.»<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />«Mikyene ya mibighili míkala tee mu matala mama Dzã. Obaana oŋo, bali mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Emfumu e Nzaami, ya nswe mbwuru li mu osa makpa mu osomo mu Emfumu ekye. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Yulu ya nsie bikughu oluru, lo ŋa kara li Mikyene, si mpiri nsyini ka yimara o.»<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />«Nswe baghala wu dzwi bala ya mukala a nde ya kie mukaha mukimi, nde si bukala, ya nswe baghala wu kie mukaha wu aadzwi bala ya mulumu a nde, si bukala.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esini ya Ladzare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />«Áli oli a baghala mutsyini wu esini. Nde ákalaha biko bi bibwe ya bibi ntala. Nswe etsughu nde ákasa malagha. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Óli si ya muwele mutsyini wuulu áli ágyoŋomo ŋa muŋma a ekagha e nzo a esini, nkwumu a nde áli Ladzare, ya nyuru a nde áli yílwulu mu biboõ. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ya nde ákadzyi otolo yini a mpfi-mpfihini a bi-odza yi áakabwa ku nsie a tabele li esini ekye. Ya bambwa si bákayalyere biboõ bi nde.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Muwele ákpi ya bangye-yulu bábiri nde kundaa Abarahame. Esini si ékpi ya bádzyighi kye. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ya ku nsie a ba bákpi, nde ákamono kimini li lilagha. Bu asiili mihi, átaala Abarahame ku la, ya Ladzare ŋa nkara a nde. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nde ákehe engubu ndiri: “Abarahame, taara me, mono me nyiĩ, ya gweghe Ladzare atsubu mbunu a mulyele a nde mu madza ya abwoho me nzalisogho, mu kuulu me ndi mu okamono kimini lilagha munsa mbaa yi.”<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Abarahame ábvuhulu nde ti: “Mwana a me, libili mweẽ ti we áali a busini bulagha mu bumweẽ bu we, ya Ladzare áli kunsa kimini. Mu matala ma, bali mu obuono nde kunu, lo we li mu omono kimini. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Gyahaba ti, mu matala ma oli ya mbie yi nene ŋa kara li bihi-a-be. Mpaala baara ba badzyi omara kunu mu ogya kundaa be ka baleene o, ya ba bali kundaa be ka baleene si osaghaba yo mu ogya kunu o.”<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Esini élyele ndiri: “Taara, me mbuono we, gweghe Ladzare agye ku nzo a taara a me, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />mu kuulu me ndi a bambwee bataana. Nde agye ayilyele bo mpaala bo si banyaã ogya ku ebini kii kimini ki.”<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Abarahame ábvuhulu nde bu: “Bo bali a Moyidze ya mibighili. Bafaana ogyughu bo!”<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ya esini ébvuhulu nde ndiri: “Pele, taara Abarahame. Kala ti mbwuru wu ákpi gyene kundaa bo, bo sa bagyiŋi mayele.”<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Lo Abarahame ábvuhulu kundaa nde bu: “Kala ti bo ka bagyughu Moyidze ya mibighili o, si okala ti mbwuru wu ákpi sighili mu lipfu, bo akala ka bagyughu nde si o.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Obwa mu lisumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Mandagha ma maakasa ti baara babwa mu lisumu ka makughu ogwene o. Lo nyiĩ kundaa munde wu aakala mpeene yi maagya mo! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ali oluru bubwe kundaa nde bakwighi nde limeẽ li linene mu bolo ya batsili nde mu mubu, ya bu abwihi mu lisumu mumõ ŋa kara li bike-bike bi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Be beme lisa mayele. Kala ndughu mu kana bwi mu lisumu, fyeẽ nde. Kala ti nde gyiŋi mayele, sa nde kolokolo. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ya kala ti nde si we bubi nsa nsaama mu etsughu, ya kala ti mu nsa nsaama oyo nde gyi mu olyele we ti: “Me aanyoõ bu aansi we bubi”, sa nde kolokolo.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Bantumu bályele kundaa Yiisu ti: «Mfumu gwa bihi kana lili ngo lo.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Mu obo Mfumu ályele kundaa bo ndiri: «Kala ti be lili a kana ti liburu li mutaade, be likughu olyele kundaa muti wu a sikomore ti: “Tuŋumu ya midza mi we ya gye yibwa mu mubu!” Ya nde sa agyughu be.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandagha ma ofaana osa musala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Nande ŋa kara li be kughu olyele kundaa musala a nde wu aakasala mu manseghe ma nde, bwunu we wu aakakebe mikaã mi nde, ŋa aafa nde ku manseghe bu: “Gya maswa-maswa, bwa nsini, ya dza?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Pele! Lo nde bu aalyele kundaa nde: “Naŋa me bi-odza, laha biko bibi esala ya gwa me bi-odza. Me mana odza ya oŋma, ŋa mbihi oŋo we kughu odza ya oŋma.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Lo liimaamono ti mfumu bvurulu matuono kundaa musala a nde mu kuulu aakagyighili mi aakatumu nde? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Behe si bumõ, ŋa liimana osa myehene mi baatumu be osa, lilyele bu: “Bihi lili basala ba bagwene a mupfunu, bihi liigyighili yini a mamo ma lifaana ogyighili.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu banga-a-buala kwumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ŋaala Yiisu mu okagye ku Yerusaleme, nde áluru mu milili mi etsulu e nsie kii Samari ya kii Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ŋa ákasomo nde munsa bula butsyini, banga-a-buala kwumu báyabwana a nde. Bátemene la-la <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ya bákehe engubu: «Yiisu, Muluo, mono bihi nyiĩ!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Bu amono bo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ligye liyisuo manyuru kundaa bangaa ba nzaami.» Ŋa báli bo nkini mu okagye, bo bámono ti bo baadzughu. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Mumõ ŋa kara li bo bu amono ti nde aadzughu, áyabvughuru ya ákasyighi Nzaami mu yulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Nde ápfumunu busu mu nsie ŋa myili mi Yiisu ya ábvurulu nde matuono. Baghala munde áli musi Samari. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yiisu áfwulu ti: «Bunu, bo bansa kwumu ka baadzughu o? Bu wa babake kunu bali? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Yini a munzyi wu aayabvughuru mu ogwa Nzaami masyighi?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Temene, gye, kana li we liibvwuhu we!»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogya ku Emfumu e Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Ba-Faridzyẽ báfwulu nde ti nsa matala Emfumu e Nzaami eegya, nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Emfumu e Nzaami ka eegyi ti anga elogho ki bakughu omono mu mihi o. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Banyaã olyele be ti: “Limono, ŋa eli”, bwunu we: “Eli kunii!” Limono, Emfumu e Nzaami eli ŋa nsa kara li be.» <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Bitsughu sa bigya, bi likala a be nzala a omono Mwana a mbwuru, ti mu etsughu etsyini, lo akala ka liimono nde o. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Sa akala balyele kundaa be ti: “Nde ŋa ali”, bwunu we: “Kunii ali”. Ka ligye o, ya ka libara ntyini o. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Mu kuulu, ti bu ookasehene mvulu ya bu aakatsehebe nde yulu nkolo ya nkolo, me obo si bu ookala Mwana a mbwuru mu etsughu e nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Lo nde faana otswama omono mpara yi alagha, ya baara ba eseene ki sa babihi nde. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Mi míluru mu matala mama Nowe sa miluru mu etsughu ki oogya Mwana a mbwuru. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Baara bákadza, bákaŋma, bákakie ya bákakwehe tee mu etsughu ki ósomo Nowe munsa bwara ba bunene. Ndwuru yígyi mu nsie nsyini, ya baara bwohono báfi ekulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Bumõ si mu matala mama Lote. Baara bákadza, bákaŋma, bákaswumu ya bákatyeghe, bákakunu ya bákatwuhu manzo. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Lo etsughu ki ópala Lote munsa bvulu lili Sodome, Nzaami ánohõ mvulu wu a mbaa ya wu makele ma maakalughulu mbaa, wu áayadzwa baara bwohono. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Sa okala bumõ mu etsughu ki oyamoŋono Mwana a mbwuru.»<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />«Mu etsughu ekye, mbwuru wu li ku yulu a see li nzo lili eyala, asughuru, anyaã osomo munsa nzo mu ogwolo bilogho. Wu aakala ku manseghe, anyaã si obvughuru ku bula. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Litsimi mi míbwi mu mukala a Lote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Eba 19.26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Munde wu aasagha obvwuhu laama li nde sa apfihili lo. Munde wu aakihi okpa, sa akala mweẽ. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Me bu ndyele kundaa be: mu mpyibi oyo, mu baara buolo ba baakala ku yulu a mbughu mõ, sa babiri mutsyini ya sa basihi wu muke. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Mu bakaha buolo ba bali mu okasighi bimburu, sa bagwolo mutsyini ya sa basihi wu muke. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Mu babaghala buolo ba baakala munsa nseghe, sa bagwolo mutsyini ya sa basihi wu muke.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikaana mi mike mimi nsomo-a-nsomo ka mili ya etsulu ki o.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Binduono bíbvuhulu nde ti: «Mfumu, mandagha mamo kunu-ako akala maaluru?» Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Ku ookala ebyimi, me oko ku oyabvuŋunu bango-mbimi.»<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mupfiili ya nsughu-a-lamana wu mubi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yiisu áti bo nkumu nsyini mu osuo bo ti bafaana okasamana Nzaami matala mwohono ku ogwene okolo. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Mu obo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Óli a nsughu-a-lamana mutsyini mu bvulu litsyini. Nde ka ákabara Nzaami o, ya ka ákagwa si mbwuru mutsyini budziri o. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Óli si a mupfiili mutsyini wu mukaha oko, wu áakalyele kundaa nde ti: “Tsyiri ndagha yi li ŋa kara li me ya mutaara a me.” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Matala malagha nsughu-a-lamana munde ábihi. Lo ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ábili bu mu mukolo a nde: “Si okala ti me ka aakambara Nzaami o, bwunu we me ka aakangwa mbwuru si mumõ budziri o, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />lo me ndagha a mupfiili wu aantsyiri, mu kuulu nde ka li mu okanyaã me pii o. Kala pele, nde sa akayaluhu me nkele bitsughu byehene.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Mfumu áfirilyele bu: «Be liigyughu mbiili a nsughu-a-lamana munde wu mubi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Lo Nzaami ka kughu otsyiri mandagha ma babo ba ásuolo nde o, ba bali mu okasyama kundaa nde mpyibi ya mwiĩ? Ya nde ka asa maswa mu obaha bo o? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Me bu ndyele be, Nzaami sa atsyiri mandagha ma bo maswa-maswa. Lo ŋa oogya Mwana a mbwuru, nde sa ayamono kana ŋa yulu a nsie?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mu-Faridzyẽ ya muntolo-mpagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yiisu áfirita bo nkumu yi mu ogwa maluo kundaa baara ba baakatsimi ti bo bali kunsa bunsumu ya ba baakatsaala babake. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Babaghala buolo bákumu ku nzo a Nzaami yi nene mu osamana. Mumõ áli mu-Faridzyẽ, ya wu muke áli muntolo-mpagha. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mu-Faridzyẽ átemene ya ásamana kunsa mukolo bu: “Nzaami, me mbvurulu we matuono mu kuulu me ka ndi ti baara babake o. Bo bali banga-a-pfyibi, ba bagwene a bunsumu, ba baakabvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we mulumu a nganda-mbwuru, ti anga muntolo-mpagha wu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Me aankankuru nswele nsa ywolo mu limiŋi, me aakangwa kaba lili kwumu mu byehene bi aakambagha me.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Muntolo-mpagha áli átemene la, ya ka ábagha si bu aasiili mihi ku yulu o. Nde ákakoboro ntulu ya ákalyele ti: “Nzaami mono me nyiĩ, me ndi nga-a-masumu!” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Me ndyele be, muntolo-mpagha munde ábvughuru ku nzo a nde ya Nzaami ákirili nde mbwuru wu bunsumu, lo ka mu-Faridzyẽ wu o, mu kuulu munde wu aaseŋene mu endeme, sa basurulu nde linsie, ya munde wu li linsie, sa baseene nde.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gyagha baana ba basala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Baara bágyi a baana ba basala kundaa Yiisu mu kuulu nde abyeme bo. Lo binduono bi nde bu bimono obo, bífyeẽ baara babo. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Mu obo, Yiisu áti baana mbili ya ályele ti: «Linyaã baana ba basala bagya kundaa me, ya ka likahaba bo o, mu kuulu Emfumu e Nzaami eli kii ba bafaana ya bo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Me ndyele be mu engaŋma, nswe munde wu gwene okihi Emfumu e Nzaami ti mwana wu asala, ka asomo omo o.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baghala wu Esini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mfumu a ba-Dzwife mutsyini áfwulu Yiisu ti: «Muluo wu mubwe, emakye me mfaana osa mu obagha laama lili mibvu ya mibvu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mu emakye we li mu olyele ti me mbwuru wu mubwe? Ka oli a mbwuru wu mubwe o, kala ka yini a Nzaami o. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />We gyahaba mikyene: <char style="qt">Ka bvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we ya mulumu a nganda-mbwuru o, ka dzwa o, ka turu o, ka kala mpughulu wu a mpya mu nganda-mbwuru o, gwa taara ya ngughu a we budziri</char>.» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Mbwuru munde ábvuhulu bu: «Obaana bumwana bu me, me aankebe myehene mimye.» <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Bu amana ogyughu nde, Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Elogho etsyini we gwene a kye: Tyeghe byehene bi li a bye, kaba nzi kundaa bawele, ya we sa kala a busini mu mayulu. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, gya, ya nama me.» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Lo bu agyughu obo, mbwuru munde ányoõ ku olagha, mu kuulu nde áli a busini bulagha.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yiisu bu amono minyoõ mi nde, ályele ti: «Mpara kundaa bisini mu osomo mu Emfumu e Nzaami! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Mu kuulu, ka oli mpara o kundaa nyama wu baakata ti syamo mu osomo mu lihi li ntuumu, lo mpara kundaa esini mu osomo mu Emfumu e Nzaami.» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Baara ba bákagyughu mandagha mamo bályele ti: «Mu obo, nande kughu obvwughu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yiisu ábvuhulu bu: «Miili baara ka bakughu osa o, Nzaami kughu osa mye.» <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Piere ályele ti: «Tala, bihi liisihi bilogho bi liili a bye ya liinama we.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Mu obo Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Me ndi mu olyele be ngaŋma, nswe munde wu sihi nzo, mukala, banaana ya bambwee, taara ya ngughu, bwunu we baana ba nde, mu nkooro a Empu e Nzaami, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />nde sa abagha mi miluru mu matala ma, ya laama lili mibvu ya mibvu mu bitsughu bi biigya.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu firilyele sa li litere ndagha yitala okpa ya osighili o nde mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yiisu bu akogho ŋa bele a nde bantumu ba nde kwumu a buolo (12), nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mono! Bihi-a-be ku yulu a Yerusaleme lili mu ogye. Oko myehene mi ósono mibighili mu Mwana a mbwuru sa mikeele. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Sa batyeghe nde ŋa myaã mi baara ba bagwene osoolo Nzaami, sa basa nde munsighi, sa batsaala nde, sa batswulu nde manteẽ, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />ya bu bamana okaha nde nswa-nswa, sa badzwa nde. Ya etsughu kii bitere, nde sa asighili mu lipfu.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Lo bantumu ba nde ka bábaghala ndagha si mõ o. Bo báli kunsa nzi-nzimini. Ka bákagyahaba o bunu-a-bo mandagha mamo mákadzyi olyele.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu enkpa-mihi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Mu matala ma óyabehene Yiisu ŋa bvulu lili Dzeriko, enkpa-mihi etsyini ébwi nsini mu mukogho a nzili mu okaluomo baara nzi. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Bu agyughu mpwumu a baara yi áakaluru, nde áfwulu nki ndagha áakaluru. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bályele nde ti: «Yiisu musi Nadzarete li mu okaluru.» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Mu obo, nde ákehe engubu mu yulu ti: «Yiisu, Mwana a Dabvide, mono me nyiĩ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Ba báli ku nkulu báfyeẽ nde ya bályele nde akuru muŋma, lo nde ákehe bingubu bi biluru: «Mwana a Dabvide, mono me nyiĩ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yiisu bu atemene, átumu bagya a nde kundaa nde. Nde bu ayabehene, Yiisu áfwulu nde ti: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Emakye we dzyi me nsa mu we?» Nde ábvuhulu bu: «Mfumu, sa kuulu me firimono!» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Mu obo, Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Firimono o we! Kana li we liibvwuhu we!» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Mu ena kyini ekye, nde ábaana omono, ya ábwi onama Yiisu mu okabulusyighi Nzaami. Baara bwohono bu bamono obo, básyighi Nzaami.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ya Dzasye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yiisu ásomo mu Dzeriko ya áluru kunsa bvulu lilo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mbwuru mutsyini áli oko, nkwumu a nde Dzasye. Nde áli mfumu a mintolo-mpagha ya áli esini. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Nde ákasagha omono Yiisu, lo nde ka ákughu o, mu kuulu nde áli mutele mupfi, ya mpwumu a baara yíkyi Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Mu obo, nde ábara ku nkulu ya ákumu ku yulu a muti wu a sikomore mu omono Yiisu, mu kuulu oyo nzili yi ákaluru nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yiisu bu ayato ŋa ebini ekye, ásiili mihi ku yulu, ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Dzasye, sughuru mu maswa, mu kuulu me mfaana ogyoŋomo mu nzo a we lolo li.» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Dzasye ási maswa ásughuru, ya ágyagha nde ya esee. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Mu obo, baara bwohono ba bámono mandagha mamo bákaŋuŋunu ya bákalyele ti: «Nde aayigyoŋomo kundaa nga-a-masumu.» <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Lo Dzasye bu atemene ŋa nkulu a Mfumu, ályele nde ndiri: «Mfumu, tala: me nkaba bilogho bi me ŋa kara-a-kara mu ogwa ndaama kundaa bawele. Ya kala ti me aampfiri mbwuru mu ogwolo nzi yiluru kundaa nde, me sa mbvurulu nde yo nsa na.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele bu: «Lolo li baara ba baakakala mu nzo yi baabvwughu, mu kuulu wuhu si li musi dzumu lili Abarahame. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mu kuulu Mwana a mbwuru aagyi mu osagha ya obvwuhu baara ba bádzimini.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a nzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Yiisu áfirita baara ba bákagyughu nde nkumu nkimi, mu buulu nde áto ŋa bele a Yerusaleme, ya baara bákatsimi ti Emfumu e Nzaami mu matala mamo ékaamoŋono. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mbwuru mutsyini wu budziri ágyene ku nsie yi a la mu oyibyala emfumu kii mukogho ya áyabvughuru. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Nsomo agye, nde áti basala kwumu mbili ŋa kara a basala ba nde. Nde ágwi ŋa kara a nswe musala mupara mutsyini wu a mu oore, ya ályele bo ti: “Lita nkaala mu nzi yi tee ku aayambvughuru me.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Lo baara baba nsie a nde bákabele nde. Mu obo, bágweghe baara ŋa mbihi a nde mu oyilyele ku ákagye nde bu: “Bihi ka lidzyi ti nde akala mukogho a bihi o.” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Bu amana obyala emfumu, nde áyabvughuru. Nde áti basala ba ágwi nde nzi mbili mu ogyahaba ndaana yi bábagha bo mu nkaala. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Wu a nsomo ágyi ya ályele ti: “Mfumu! Mupara a we aaburu mipara kwumu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mfumu ályele nde ti: “Bubwe, we li musala wu mubwe. Mu kuulu we aasi waa li me mu bilogho bi bisala, me ntwulu we mfumu a mabvulu kwumu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Wu a buolo ágyi ya ályele ti: “Mfumu, mupara a we aaburu mipara mitaana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Mfumu ályele nde ndiri: “Me ntwulu wehe si mfumu a mabvulu mataana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mukimi ágyi ya ályele ti: “Mfumu, mupara a we ndindi. Me ali aandwunu nde kunsa mupa a eko. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Me aakankala a nzalamweẽ a we, mu kuulu we li mbwuru wu a mukolo wu a kubu. We aakagwolo bilogho bi aagwene okamono we mpara, ya we aakatolo bimburu bi aagwene okakunu we.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mukogho ályele nde ti: “We li musala wu mubi! Me muyala a we aansa mu mandagha ma paha weme. We gyahaba ti me ndi a mukolo wu a kubu, me aakangwolo bilogho bi aangwene okamono me mpara, ya aakantolo bimburu bi aangwene okakunu me. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Mu emakye we aagwene oyitwulu mupara a me kundaa ba baakabunu nzi? Bu ayambvughuru me bu, me ali aankughu obagha ndaana mu nde.” <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo nde ályele kundaa ba báli oŋo ti: “Ligwohono nde mupara munde ya ligwa nde kundaa wu li a mipara kwumu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Bo bályele nde ti: “Mfumu, ta nde li a mipara kwumu mimi oore!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Nde ábvuhulu bo ti: “Me ndyele be, sa babwehe kundaa munde wu li a bye, lo wu gwene a bye, sa bagwohono si okala mana a ndaama yi ali a nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ŋa yulu oŋo, liyabiri mitaara mi me ŋa, mi miibihi ti me nkala mukogho a mye, ya lidzwa mye ŋa mihi mi me.”» <verse eid="LUK 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Bu amana obili obo, Yiisu átswama ŋa nkulu a mpwumu a baara mu okumu ku Yerusaleme.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osomo o Yiisu ku Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-9">Mat 21.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mar 11.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Dzã 12.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Mu matala ma ábehene a nde ŋa bula baba Betefadze ya bvulu lili Betani, ŋa bele a Munguo wu a mi-Olibve, Yiisu ágweghe binduono bi nde byele <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />ya ályele bye ti: «Ligye ku bula ba buli ku nkulu. Ŋa liisomo be oko, sa limono mwana a aane bákuru ŋa muti, ya wuulu si mbwuru mutsyini nkini ámaabwa nsini ŋa yulu a nde o. Linyana nde ya ligya a nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Kala mbwuru fwulu be ti: “Mu emakye be lili mu onyana nde?” Lilyele nde bu: “Mfumu li a nzala a nde.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Binduono bibye bígyene ya bímono mandagha mwohono ti bu ólyele Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ŋa bákanyana bo mwana a aane, banga-a-nde báfwulu bo mu emakye bo bákanyana mwana a aane munde. <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bo bábvuhulu bo ti Mfumu li a nzala a nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo bágyene a mwana a aane kundaa Yiisu. Bágyala biko bi bo ŋa yulu a nde ya bákuhubu Yiisu ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ŋa ókagye Yiisu, baara bákagyala biko bi bo mu nzili.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ŋa áli nde ŋa bele Yerusaleme mu okumunu Munguo wu a mi-Olibve, mpwumu a binduono bi nde yísomo kunsa esee ya yíbaana osyighi Nzaami mu yulu mu nkooro a bimaã bi bámono bo. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bo bu bákalyele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">«<char style="qt">Liseme kundaa Mukogho, munde wu li mu ogya</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">mu nkwumu a Mfumu</char>!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">Edzuunu ekala ku yulu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">
    <char style="qt">ya nsia yikala kundaa Nzaami</char>!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Ndaama a ba-Faridzyẽ yi áli ŋa kara li mpwumu a baara yílyele Yiisu ndiri: «Muluo, tumu binduono bi we binyaã nkele.» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Nde ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Me ndi mu olyele be, kala bye binyaã nkele, mameẽ sa makehe bingubu!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lili mu nkooro a Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ŋa óto Yiisu ŋa bele a Yerusaleme, nde álili mu nkooro a bvulu lilo, ŋa ámono nde lo. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Nde ályele ti: «Yerusaleme, kala wehe si, we aabaghala mandagha ma makughu ogwa we edzuunu mu matala ma! Lo mu matala ma, mo mali ma másweme ŋa mihi mi we. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Bitsughu bili mu ogya, mitaara mi we sa mitsimi miwaghala mu odzwana a we. Mye sa midziŋi we ya sa miswehẽ we nkolo ya nkolo. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Sa mitsala we, ya sa midzwa baara ba we bwohono. Mye ka misihi si limeẽ litsyini ŋa yulu a limeẽ o, mu kuulu we ka aagyahaba matala ma oogya Nzaami kundaa we o.»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Nzaami yi nene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-17">Dzã 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yiisu ásomo mu Nzo a nzaami yi nene ya ábaana obyi ba bákata nkaala omõ. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Nde ákalyele bo bu: «Bisono bi Nzaami bili mu olyele bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:46">“<char style="qt">Nzo a me sa yikala nzo yi a lisamana</char>”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:46">lo be liikirili yo ngala yi ookasweme mituru.»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Nde ákaluo mu Nzo a nzaami yi nene bitsughu byehene. Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami, baluo-mikyene ya bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife bákasagha mayele ma odzwa nde. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Lo ka bágyahaba bu baasa o, mu kuulu baara bwohono bakagyighili ogyughu nde.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Nande aagwi Yiisu muswa wu osa myehene mi akasa nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Etsughu etsyini, Yiisu ákaluo baara mu nzo a Nzaami yi nene, ya ákatsala Nsia yi Mbwe. Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami, baluo-mikyene, ya bakulu bágyi. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bo báfwulu nde ti: «Lyele ati bihi, we nki emfumu li a kye mu osa mandagha ma? Ya nande aagwi we muswa munde?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Mehe si be aangwa efwulu. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Lilyele me, oboghoro o Dzã kuu yulu bwunu we kuu baara?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Lo bo bátsoho bo-a-bo bu: «Kala libvuhulu ti Nzaami aatumu nde, nde sa afwulu bihi-a-be mu emakye liibihi osa kana mu mandagha ma nde? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ya kala lilyele ti kundaa baara, baara bwohono sa bakaha bihi-a-be mameẽ, mu kuulu bo bwohono bákihi ti Dzã mubighili áali.» <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Mu obo, bágwi nde mvuru ti bo ka bagyahaba o. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Ya Yiisu ályele ti: «Mehe si ka andyele be o, mu nsa litumu me ndi mu okagyighili mandagha ma.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a basala ba babi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu áti baara nkumu yi: «Mbwuru mutsyini ákunu nseghe a bviini, ágwihini ya ba bákasala mu yo, ya ágyene ya ásihi nsie a nde, ási matala malagha oko. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Matala ma otolo bimburu bu máto, nde ágweghe musala mumõ kundaa ba bákasala mu nseghe a bviini, mpaala bagwa kaba li bviini lili nde. Bo bágwini a nde mpaana, ya bábvurulu nde myaã a myaã. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nde áfirigweghe musala mukimi. Baara babo bágwini a nde mpaana, ya babvurulu nde myaã a myaã. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Nde áfirigweghe wu batere, bádzwaha nde mabogho ya babyi nde. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Mu obo, mfumu a nseghe a bviini ábili bu: “Me bunu-a-bo aansa? Me mwana a me wu mukolo aangweghe, nkini-a-nki bo bagwi nde budziri.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Lo baara babo bu bamono nde, bábili bu bo-a-bo: “Wu me mbwuru wu aayabyala pfa. Litswe lidzwa nde, mu kuulu pfa likala lili ndaa bihi bameme.” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Mu obo, bátsili nde ku mbala a nseghe a bviini ya bádzwi nde. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nga a nseghe a bviini ema aasa bo? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Nde sa agya, adzwa baara babo, ya sa agwa nseghe a bviini kundaa baara bakimi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ŋa ógyughu baara mandagha mamo, bo bályele ti: «Mandagha mamo ka makughu okala o!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Lo bu atala bo, Yiisu ályele ti: «Limatsimi ati, Ndagha yi básono mu Mukaana a Nzaami yi bunu-a-bo yidzyi olyele?»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">«<char style="qt">Limeẽ li ootsili ba baakatwu nzo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="qt">lo ayi lili lili ngughu ŋa mutswunu a nzo</char>»,<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />«Nswe mbwuru wu aabwa ŋa yulu a lo, sa abwogho, ya kala ti lo libwi ŋa yulu a mbwuru, sa lipwene nde.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya baluo-mikyene básagha bu baasyimi Yiisu mu ena kyini ekye, mu kuulu bo bábaghala ti nkumu oyo mu bo nde áti yo. Lo bo bábara nzalamweẽ a baara.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpagha a Sedzare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Mu obo, bábaana ogyighili okatala Yiisu. Bo bágweghe bankere ba bákamoŋono ti bo bali baba bunsumu, mu kuulu bagyeele obwihi Yiisu mu mandagha ma ndeme. Ya ŋa mbihi oŋo, batyeghe nde ŋa myaã mi mfumu a etsulu e nsie kii Yude. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Baara babo bágwi nde efwulu ki: «Muluo, bihi ligyahaba ti we aakabili ya aakaluo ya bunsumu. We ka aakatala bifa bi baara o, lo we aakaluo nzili a Nzaami mu engaŋma. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Lyele ati bihi: mikyene mi bihi-a-be miikagwa bihi-a-be muswa wu ofiri mpagha kundaa Sedzare, bwunu we pele?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Lo Yiisu ábaghala mayele ma bo ma mabi ya ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Lisuo me denali mumo. <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Edzili ya bisono bi, bibi nande?» Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Bibi ndaa Sedzare.» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele bo ti: «Libvurulu bibi Sedzare kundaa Sedzare, ya bibi Nzaami kundaa Nzaami.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bo ka bákughu omono Yiisu epfwumu mu mandagha mamo ŋa mihi mi baara o. Bo bákiŋimi mu mvuru a Yiisu ya bákuru miŋma.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efwulu mu mi mitala osighili o baara mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Ndaama a ba-Saduseyẽ, baara babo ba baakalyele ti osighili o baara mu lipfu ka oli o, báyabehene ya bágwi Yiisu efwulu ki: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Muluo, Moyidze ágwi bihi mukyene wu: “<char style="qt">Kala ti naana a mbwuru kpi, sihi mupfiili gwene a mwana, mbwee a nde faana ogwolo mupfiili munde, mu kuulu aburu naana a nde baana</char>.” <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Óli a babaghala nsaama ŋa bula bumõ, bo bwohono maama mumõ, taara mumõ. Wu a nsomo kie mukaha, nde yakpa, mwana we. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Wu a buolo kie mupfiili, ya kpi si mwana we. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Wu batere si kie mupfiili ya kpi. Bo bansa nsaama bumõ si, bákpi ku ogwene oburu mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ŋa mbihi a bo, mupfiili si kpi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Lo ŋa akala oosighili baara bwohono mu lipfu, nande aakala mulumu a nde, buulu bo bansa nsaama bákie nde?»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Basi nsie bali mu okie bakala ya balumu, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />lo baara ba oomono Nzaami ti bakughu osighili mu lipfu, ya bagyagha nde mu bula bu bunyaghara, ka bakie bakala bwunu we balumu o. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bo ka bafirikpa o, mu kuulu sa bakala ti bangye-yulu, ya sa bakala baana ba Nzaami mu ku baasighili bo ŋa kara li ba bákpi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Moyidze ágyighili osuo ti ba bákpi sa basighili mu lipfu. Mu emoŋo kii eti-ti ki ékalughulu mbaa lo odzighi we, bályele ti: “Mfumu li Nzaami a Abarahame, Nzaami a Idzake ya Nzaami a Dzakobe.” <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Nzaami ka li Nzaami a ba bákpi o, lo wu a baba mweẽ. Mu kuulu kundaa nde, baara bwohono bali baba mweẽ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Ndaama a baluo-mikyene bábvuhulu bu: «Muluo, we aabili ku obwe.» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Mu obo, bo ka báfiribagha bukyini mu ogwa nde bifwulu o.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagha yitala Kriste ya Dabvide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Bunu-abo bakughu olyele ti Kriste li mwana a Dabvide? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dabvide ndeme ásono mu Mukaana wu Bikwumu ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“<char style="qt">Mfumu aalyele kundaa Mfumu a me:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="qt">Bwa nsini ku kwogho-a-kwogho e me</char>,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />
    <char style="qt">tee ŋa aansa me kuulu mitaara mi we mikala nkara a myili mi we</char>.”»<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />«Kala ti Dabvide aakata nde Mfumu, lo bunu-a-bo nde akughu ofirikala mwana a Dabvide?»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu syeme baluo-mikyene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1">Mat 23.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:5-7">5-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 23:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:37-40">Mar 12.37-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ŋaala baara bwohono mu okagyughu nde, Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Lisa mayele mu baluo-mikyene. Bo badzyi okabuludzie ya binkuru bi bila. Badzyi ti baara bakagwa bo mamboro mu bibini bi ookabvuŋunu baara bwohono. Bo baakasuolo bibini bibi ku nkulu mu manzo mama lisamana mama ba-Dzwife, ya bibini bibi ku nkulu mu malagha. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Baakagwohono bilogho mu manzo ma bapfiili, ya baakasa nsamana yi nda mu kuulu baara bakamono bo. Mu obo, sa babagha masyeme ma maluru.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ekaba kii mupfiili wu mukaha wu muwele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mar 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yiisu bu aseene mihi, ámono bisini bi bíkalo bikaba munsa elogho ki baakagwa bikaba. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Nde ámono si mukaha mutsyini wu mupfiili wu áli muwele mu olo mana mipara myele. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele ti: «Me ndi mu olyele be engaŋma, ekaba kii mupfiili wu muwele wu eluru kii baara bwohono. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Mu kuulu, bo bwohono baalo nzi yi bagwene a yo esala, lo nde kunsa buwele bu nde, aalo nzi yohono yi aakakala a yo mu olaama.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lyele ti Nzo a nzaami yi nene sa yitsaŋama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Baara babake bákabili mu mi mitala Nzo a Nzaami yi nene, ya mu bu bátwu yo mu mameẽ ma mabwe, ya mu bilogho bi okagwa baara Nzaami bikaba. Mu obo Yiisu ályele: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Etsughu eli kiili mu myehene mi lili mu okamono be, ka osyili si limeẽ litsyini ŋa yulu a limeẽ likimi o. Nzo yohono sa yibwa mu nsie.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bilyimi bi biitswama-nkulu ya mpara yi aagya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-8">Mat 24.3-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-8">Mar 13.3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Bo báfwulu nde: «Muluo, mu nki matala mandagha mamo maatswighi, ya nki elyimi eesuo ti myehene sa mikala?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yiisu ábvuhulu bu: «Lisa mayele, mbwuru anyaã opfiri be. Mu kuulu, baara balagha akala baagya mu nkwumu a me ya olyele ti: “Wu me Kriste wu lili mu okakebe be!” Ya “Matala maato!” Ka linama bo o. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ŋa liigyughu be nsia yi a mamvulu ya mandagha mama mpaatsala, ka likala a nzalamweẽ o. Mandagha mamo mafaana otswama ogya, lo masini ma nsie ka magya maswa-maswa o.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo nde ályele bo ti: «Ekaana e baara etsyini sa edzwana ya ki eke, nsie a mukogho mutsyini sa yidzwana ya yi a mukogho mukimi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Nsie sa yinyiŋi mu mpini yohono, ya nkolo ya nkolo bifulu bibi mabyele sa bibiri baara mu lipfu, ya biwala sa bigya. Mandagha ma maagwa baara nzalamweẽ yi alagha sa makala, ya bilyimi bi binene sa bimoŋono mu mayulu.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwehẽ banga a kana kimini, elyimi ki ebvulu bubwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:17-22">Mat 10.17-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:9-12">Mar 13.9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Lo, nsomo-a-nsomo, sa basyimi be, ya sa bamwehẽ be kimini. Sa basa be muyala mu manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife ya sa batsili be mu boloko. Sa babiri be kundaa mikogho ya bamfumu mu nkooro a nkwumu a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Mu obo be sa libagha mpeene yi okala bampughulu ba me. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ka limono mukolo mpara o mu mi liibili be ŋa baasa be muyala, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />mu kuulu meme sa ngwa be mayele mama obili ya munzeele bi biisa ti bataara ba be bwohono ka bakughu okemene mandagha ma be bwunu we obwihi be o. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Si okala basyana ya bangughu ba be, baana ba ngughu ya baana ba taara, badzighi ya bandughu ba be sa batyeghe be, ya sa badzwa babake ŋa kara li be.»<verse eid="LUK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:9-13">Mat 24.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar 13.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />«Baara bwohono sa babele be mu nkooro a nkwumu a me. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Lo si lifu li be litsyini ku mutswi ka lipfighili o. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Mu nkooro a mukama a be sa libagha laama.»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusaleme sa litsaŋama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-22">Mat 24.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-20">Mar 13.14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Ŋa liimono be mampwumu ma bambumbulu mu odzyi Yerusaleme, ligyahaba ti matala masala maasyili mpaala bvulu litsaŋama. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Mu obo baara ba baakala ku etsulu e nsie kii Yude bafaana obara ku yulu a minguo, ba baakala ŋa nsa Yerusaleme bapala, ya ba baakala ku bibiri banyaã oyasomo kunsa bvulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Bitsughu bibye sa bikala bitsughu bibi masyeme ma Nzaami, mu kuulu myehene mi básono mu Mukaana a Nzaami mitswighi. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Mu bitsughu bibye, nyiĩ mu bakaha ba baakala a mayimi ya basuomo! Mu kuulu nsie yohono sa yisomo kunsa mpara yi alagha, ya Nzaami sa asuo nkehe a nde mu baara baba nsie yi. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Mitaara sa midzwa baara balagha mu mapee, sa babiri bo kunsa bunkana ku mansie mwohono, ya baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o sa badzyara Yerusaleme tee ku ookughu matala ma bo.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogya o Mwana a mbwuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Bilyimi sa bimoŋono kunsa tala, kunsa ngoono ya kunsa baŋomaŋomo. Ŋa yulu a nsie baara bwohono sa bateghere. Nkele yi aafa ku mubu ya mimpagha mi madza sa bigwa baara nzalamweẽ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Baara sa bakpa mu nzalamweẽ ŋa baatsimi bo mi mili mu ogya mu nsie nsyini, mu kuulu tala, ngoono ya baŋomaŋomo sa binyiŋi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo <char style="qt">baara sa bamono Mwana a mbwuru mu ogya ŋa yulu a edzi</char>, mu lileene ya nsia yohono. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ŋa obaana omoŋono mandagha mamo, litemene ya litala ku yulu mu kuulu obvwughu o be oobehene.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efaana kii mufinge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo Yiisu áti bo nkumu nsyini: «Litala mufinge ya miti myehene. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ŋa liikamono be ti mye mibaana omyehe masagha ma manyaghara, be liikasoolo ti mvulu a nsomo aabehene. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Behe si bumõ, ŋa liimono be mandagha mamo, ligyahaba ti Emfumu e Nzaami eebehene. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" /><char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele be ti baara baba eseene ki bo bwohono ka basomo mu lipfu o obaana mandagha mamo mamoŋono. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Yulu ya nsie sa biluru, lo mandagha ma me ka maluru o.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okala yeelee matala mwohono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Lisa mayele! Mikolo mi be minyaã obyi mu byiri, mu okolo mala, bwunu we mu mpara a nsie, kala pele etsughu ekye sa ebwa be ensihibi, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />mu kuulu sa ebwa ŋa yulu a baara bwohono ba bali ŋa yulu a nsie ti likoho. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mu obo likahala mihi ya lisamana matala mwohono, mu kuulu likala a makpa ma olughulu ŋa nkulu a myehene mi mili mu ogya, ya lileene otemene ŋa nkulu a Mwana a mbwuru.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitsughu bi Yiisu bibi masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Bitsughu byehene mu nkara-a-mwiĩ, Yiisu ákaluo mu Nzo a nzaami yi nene, ya ákayiluhu mpyibi ku yulu a Munguo wu a mi-Olibve. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Mu obo baara, bwohono bákagya kundaa nde epala-epala ku Nzo a nzaami yi nene mu ogyughu nde.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Bamfumu bakuru mfwunu yi odzwa Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Kyiri kii mampa ma magwene a pfini, ki baakata Paake, ébehene. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya Baluo-mikyene bákasagha bu baadzwa Yiisu, lo bo báli a nzalamweẽ a baara.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda kihi otyeghe Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Ankoho Satana ásomo mu mukolo a Yuda wu bákata Isikaryote. Nde áli mumõ ŋa kara li bantumu kwumu a buolo (12). <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Nde ágyene ayigwihini ya bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya bakwuru ba baakakebe Nzo a nzaami yi nene, mu mi mitala bunu nde akughu otyeghe Yiisu kundaa bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Bo básomo kunsa esee ya bagwihini ti bagwa nde nzi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda ákihi ya ábaana osagha mpeene yi faana mu otyeghe Yiisu ku ogwene a mpwumu a baara ogyahaba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binduono bi Yiisu bigyighili bilogho bibi kyiri kii Paake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mar 14.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Etsughu kii mampa ma magwene a pfini éto. Kye áli etsughu ki baakadzwa mwana a endoomo mu ogwa mukaba, mu odza kyiri kii Paake. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Mu obo, Yiisu ágweghe Piere ya Dzã, ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ligye ligyighili bilogho bi liidza bihi-a-be kyiri kii Paake.» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bo báfwulu nde ti: «Kunu-ako we dzyi ti bihi ligyighili bye?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yiisu ágwi bo mvuru yi: «Mono, ŋa liisomo be munsa bvulu, be sa libwana a baghala mutsyini ya yughu li madza. Linama nde tee mu nzo yi aasomo nde, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />ya lilyele nga a nzo bu: “Muluo bu afwulu we: Ngwumu a nzo yi aandza me kyiri kii Paake ya binduono bi me yini a yo?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Nde sa asuo be ngwumu yi nene yi a ku yulu ku oli bilogho byehene mukughu. Me omo be liigyighili bilogho bi-odza mu kyiri kii Paake.» <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Bo bágyene ya bámono mandagha mwohono ti bu ólyele bo Yiisu, ya bagyighili bi-odza bi kyiri kii Paake.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyuru ya makili ma Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20">Mat 26.20</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17">Mar 14.17</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">22-25</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1 Kor 11.23-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Matala mama odza bu mato, Yiisu ábwi nsini ya bantumu. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Me aandzyi ku olagha odza kyiri kii Paake ki ya be, nsomo-a-nsomo me mono mpara! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Mu kuulu me ndi mu olyele be yo, me ka aafirindza kye o, tee matala ma ootswighi kye mu Emfumu e Nzaami.» <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ya bu agwolo ebaha, nde ábvurulu matuono ya ályele ti: «Ligwolo ebaha ki, ya likaba kye be a be, <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />mu kuulu, me ndi mu olyele be, me ka afiriŋma mala ma bviini o, tee mu matala ma oogya Emfumu e Nzaami.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ágwolo limpa, bu abvurulu matuono, nde átsyiri lo, ágwi bo lo ya ályele ti: «Yi me nyuru a me yi bágwi mu be. Liikasa bu mu okalibili me mweẽ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Bumõ si mu ebaha, bu bamana odza, nde ágwi bo kye ya ályele ti: «Ebaha ki eli ogwihini ku onyaghara mu makili ma me ma matsaŋama mu be.»<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lyele ti sa batyeghe nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:21-25">Mat 26.21-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:18-21">Mar 14.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />«Lo litala! Kwogho kii munde wu aatyeghe me eli emõ ya me ŋa yulu a tabele. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mu engaŋma, Mwana a mbwuru faana ogye ti bu ogwaa Nzaami. Lo nyiĩ kundaa munde wu aatyeghe nde!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Mu obo, bo bábaana ofwulu bo-a-bo, nande ŋa kara li bo aagyighili ndagha oyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nande bvulu bukwuru ŋa kara li binduono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:24-28">Mat 20.24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">19.28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:41-45">Mar 10.41-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Binduono si bíbaana otsoho bye-a-bye mu ogyahaba nande bvulu babake bukwuru. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yiisu ályele bo ti: «Mikogho mi mansie miikatumu mansie ma bo, ya babo ba bali a litumu ŋa yulu a mo, baakata bo ba baakasa mi mibwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Lo ka oli bubo o mu be, ka lisa obo o. Ŋa kara li be, mbwuru wu bvulu bukwuru, akala ti wu bvulu bungagye, ya munde wu li mu okatumu, akala ti musala. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Nande bvulu bukwuru ŋa kara li munde wu aalabala myili mu odza ya munde wu li mu okasalala? Ka oli munde wu aalabala myili mu odza o? Lo ŋa kara li be, me ndi munde wu li mu okasalala.»<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />«Be lili babo ba baasi mukama ya me kunsa bigyeele. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Me mu obo, bu ógwi me Taara Emfumu, me obo si me aangwi be kye. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Mpaala be lidza ya liŋma emõ ya me ŋa tabele mu Emfumu e me. Ya be sa libwa nsini ŋa makubu mu olamana madzumu kwumu ya muolo (12) ma Isarayele.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lyele Piere ti sa atunu nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:37-38">Dzã 13.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />«Simõ, Simõ, Satana aaluomo we mu onyihi we ti bu baakakele bimburu bi bele, <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Lo me aambuono Nzaami mu nkooro a we, mpaala kana li we linyaã obwa, ya mu matala ma akala aafiriyabvughuru we kundaa me, we gwa bambaala ba we bukyini.» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Piere ályele nde ti: «Mfumu, me aankughu mu osomo boloko ya mu okpa ya we.» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yiisu ábvuhulu nde ti: «Piere, me ndyele we: Mu mpyibi yi a lolo yi, nsomo nsuhu akwolo, we sa tunu nsa tere ti we ka gyahaba me o.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Empogholo e nzi, bikoghoro ya lipee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yiisu áfirilyele kundaa bo ti: «Mu matala ma ángweghe me be ku ogwene obiri nzi, ku ogwene a empogholo, ku ogwene a bikoghoro, be áli liigweene a elogho?» Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Ti elogho we!» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ya, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Lo mu matala ma, wu li a nzi, agwolo yo, bumõ si mu munde wu li a empogholo, agwolo kye, ya wu gwene a lipee atyeghe enkuru ya aswumu lipee limõ. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Me ndi mu olyele be ti, mandagha ma básono mu Mukaana a Nzaami mafaana otswighi mu me: <char style="qt">Baatwulu nde mu muluo a baara ba babi</char>. Mandagha mamo sa mamoŋono edzi-dzighi mu me.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Bantumu bályele kundaa nde ti: «Mfumu, mapee mwolo mama.» Nde ábvuhulu bo ti: «Ookughu!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu buono ku Munguo wu a mi-Olibve</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yiisu ápala ya ágyene ku Munguo wu a mi-Olibve ti bu óli epfu e nde. Binduono bi nde bínama nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Bu ato oko, nde ályele bo: «Lisamana mpaala be linyaã obwa mu bigyeele.» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ábulusihi bo ya ágyene mu etiiri ki bakughu otubu limeẽ, ákunu mabuo mu nsie ya ásamana. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Nde ályele bu: «Taara, kala we dzyi, maha me ebaha ki. Lo ka bu ndzyi me o, lo bu dzyi we.» [<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Mu obo ngye-yulu áfi ku yulu mu ogwa nde bukyini. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Yiisu ámono mpara yi alagha kunsa mukolo, ya áfirisamana mu mpini yi luru. Tsughuru li nde líli ti mabere ma makili ma mali mu okatsolo mu nsie.]<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Bu amana osamana, átemene ya ágyene ku oli binduono bi nde. Nde áyabaha bye bigyoŋomo tolo mu nkooro a nyiĩ. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Yiisu ályele bye ti: «Mu emakye be liigyoŋomo? Litemene, ya lisamana, mpaala linyaã obwa mu bigyeele.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bambumbulu basyimi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-49">Mar 14.43-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Dzã 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ŋaala Yiisu nkini mu okabili, mpwumu a baara yígyi. Yuda, mumõ ŋa kara li bantumu kwumu a buolo (12), áayabiri mpwumu oyo. Nde áyasele ŋa bele a Yiisu mu onyuburu nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yiisu ályele nde ti: «Yuda, me mu onyuburu we tyeghe Mwana a mbwuru!»<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ŋa omono binduono bi Yiisu mandagha ma mali mu ogya, bye bífwulu nde: «Mfumu, lidzwana mu mapee?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ya mumõ ŋa kara li bo ákaha musala a Mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami ya atsyiri nde tswi lili kwogho-a-kwogho. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Lo Yiisu átsughu ndagha ti: «Linyaã! Lisa bwunu!» Mu obo, ábyeme tswi li mbwuru munde ya ádzuhu nde.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ályele bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami, bakwuru baba bankyele ba Nzo a nzaami yi nene ya bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife ba bágyi mu oyasyimi nde bu: «Be liigyi a mapee ya mimpagha, ti be liiyasyimi ntwumu, <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />bitsughu byehene, me aakankala ya be mu Nzo a nzaami yi nene, ya be ka liisyimi me o. Lo li me tala lili ndaa be ya lili lileene lili mpyibi.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere tunu ti nde gyahaba Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-27:1">Mat 26.57–27.1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-15:1">Mar 14.53–15.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-27">Dzã 18.13-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Mu obo, básyimi Yiisu, bábiri nde ya bágyene a nde ku nzo a mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami. Piere ákanama bo la la.<verse eid="LUK 22:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bábvughu mbaa ŋa kara-a-kara a mbala ya bábwi nsini. Piere ágyene ayibwa nsini ya baara ba bákagyoro mbaa. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Musala mutsyini wu mukaha wu áamono nde abwi nsini ŋa nkwu-a-mbaa, átuunu nde mihi ya ályele ti: «Baghala wuhu si aali ya nde.» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Lo Piere átunu ya ályele: «Ma mwana, me ka ngyahaba nde o.» <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Mana matala bu maluru, mbwuru mukimi ámono nde ya ályele ti: «Wehe si li mumõ ŋa kara li baara ba bo.» Lo Piere ábvuhulu nde: «Pele ta baghala, ka oli me o.» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Tala litsyini bu liluru, mbwuru mukimi ágyighili onyeme: «Mu engaŋma baghala wu ya nde aali mu kuulu nde li musi Ngalile.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Lo Piere ágwi mvuru yi: «Me ka ngyahaba mi dzyi we olyele o.» Mu ena kyini ekye, ŋaala Piere nkini mu okabili, nsuhu ákwolo. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mfumu ákaghala ya átala Piere. Piere álibili mweẽ ndagha yi áli olyele nde Mfumu: «Mu mpyibi yi a lolo nsomo nsuhu akwolo, we sa tunu nsa tere ti we gyahaba me.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Mu obo, Piere ábulupala ya ágwubulu mukaba a elili.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baara batughu ya bakaha Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Baara ba bákakebe Yiisu bákasebe nde ya bákakaha nde. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Báfughu nde mihi ya bályele nde ti: «Bighili, nande aakaha we.» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bo bákatsyala nde bitughu ku oluru.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekwuru kii ba-Dzwife esi muyala a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Bwihi bu buki, ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife, bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya baluo-mikyene bábvuŋunu ebini emõ. Bo bátumu bayabiri Yiisu kundaa ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bo bályele Yiisu ti: «Lyele bihi, kala we li Kriste.» Yiisu ábvuhulu bo ti: «Kala me ndyele be, be ka lisa kana o, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />ya kala me mfwulu be, be ka ligwa me mvuru o. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Lo, obaana matala ma, Mwana a mbwuru sa abwa nsini ku kwogho-a-kwogho e Nzaami Nga-a-Mpwũ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Bo bwohono báfwulu nde ti: «We me Mwana a Nzaami?» Nde ábvuhulu bo ti: «Beme lilyele ti me ndi nde.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Mu obo, bo bályele ti: «Bihi-a-be ka liifirisyili a nzala a bampughulu o. Bihi bameme liigyughu mi míipala mu muŋma a nde.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu muyala kundaa Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:2">Mat 27.2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28">Dzã 18.28</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Baara bwohono bátemene ya bábiri Yiisu ŋa nkulu a Pilate.<verse eid="LUK 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Bábaana oburulu nde mandagha bu: «Bihi liimono mbwuru wu mu okagwa baara ba bihi mutswi mpini, ya olighi bo banyaã ofiri mpagha kundaa Sedzare. Ya aalyele ti nde li Kriste ya Mukogho.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilate ágwi nde efwulu ki: «We me mukogho a ba-Dzwife?» Yiisu ábvuhulu nde ti: «Weme lyele obo!» <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilate ályele kundaa bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya kundaa mpwumu a baara ti: «Me ka mono ndagha yi mbi yi oosi baghala wu o.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Lo bo bányeme ya bályele ti: «Nde li mu okagwa baara mutswi mpini mu maluo ma nde, mu kuulu bakolo nkehe. Aabana ku Ngalile, aabululuru ku Yude lwohono, mu matala ma aagyi kunu.»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilate gweghe Yiisu kundaa Erode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ŋa ógyughu Pilate mandagha mamo, nde áfwulu bo kala ti Yiisu musi Ngalile ali. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ya bu agyughu ti Yiisu áli mbwuru wu a bula baba emfumu e Erode, Pilate ágweghe nde kundaa Erode wu áali si ŋa Yerusaleme mu bitsughu bibye.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ŋa ómono Erode Yiisu, nde ámono esee ki elagha. Mu kuulu edzighi nde ákasagha omono nde mu nkooro a mi ágyughu nde mu Yiisu, ya nde ákadzyi ti Yiisu asa emamaã ŋa busu bu nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Nde ágwi nde bifwulu bilagha, lo Yiisu ka ágwi nde mvuru si nsyini o. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya baluo-mikyene báli oŋo ya bákaburulu nde mandagha mu nzuŋu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Erode ya bambumbulu ba nde bási nde munkulu. Bu bamana otsaala nde, bálaha nde enkuru ki ebwe ya babvurulu nde kundaa Pilate. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ŋa nsomo, Pilate ya Erode báli mitaara, lo mu etsughu kyini ekye, bo bákala bandughu.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batsyiri Yiisu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">Mat 27.11-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Mar 15.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Dzã 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilate bu abvughu bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami, bamfumu ya baara bwohono, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />nde ályele bo ti: «Be liigyi a me baghala wu ya liilyele ti nde li mu okagwa baara mutswi mpini. Litala, me aangwi nde bifwulu ŋa mihi mi be, ya me ka aamono nde epfwumu mu mandagha ma lili mu okakwighi be nde o. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Erode si ka aamono nde epfwumu o, mu kuulu nde aabvurulu nde kunu. Mu olyele ti baghala wu ka aasi ndagha yi bakughu otsyiri nde lipfu o. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Mu obo, me otumu aantumu bakaha nde yini a nswa-nswa, ŋa mbihi oŋo, me nde aanyaã agye o nde.» <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mikaana mi mike mimi nsomo-a-nsomo ka mili ya etsulu ki o. </char></note>[Mu nswe kyiri, Pilate ákapaha mbwuru mutsyini mu boloko.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Lo bo bwohono mu emvuŋunu bákehe bingubu ya bályele ti: «Dzwa baghala wu, ya paha bihi Barabase mu boloko.» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Barabase munde áli ásomo boloko mu nkooro a baara ba bábihi litumu li bamfumu ba bvulu, ya mbwuru wu bádzwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Mu kuulu nde ákadzyi onyaã Yiisu agye, Pilate áfiribili ya bo, <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />lo bo bákehe bingubu ti: «Komo nde ŋa kuruwa! Komo nde ŋa kuruwa!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilate áfirilyele bo mu sa li li tere ti: «Bu nde nsa ndagha yi mbi aasi? Me ka aamono epfwumu mu nde o ki ekughu osa ti badzwa nde. Mu obo, me otumu aantumu bakaha nde nswa-nswa, ŋa mbihi oŋo me nde aanyaã agye.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Lo bo báfirikehe bingubu bi biluru, ya báluomo bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa. Pilate ágyughu bingubu bibo.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Mu obo, nde átsyiri ndagha bu bákadzyi bo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Nde ápaha mbwuru wu báluomo bo mu boloko, munde wu áasomo boloko mu nkooro a baara ba bábihi litumu li bamfumu ba bvulu, ya ku bádzwi mbwuru, ya ágwi Yiisu ŋa myaã mi bo mu kuulu basa nde mi bákadzyi bo.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ŋa yulu a kuruwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:31-44">Mat 27.31-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:20-32">Mar 15.20-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-24">Dzã 19.17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ŋa ókabiri bambumbulu Yiisu, bábwana a musi Sirene mutsyini, nkwumu a nde áli Simõ. Nde ku manseghe áfi. Bákwighi nde mu obiri kuruwa ŋa mbihi a Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Mpwumu a baara yi nene ya bakaha bákanama Yiisu. Bakaha bákabeere bitulu ya bákagwobolo bilili mu nkooro a nde. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yiisu ákaghala, ályele bo ti: «Batughu ba Yerusaleme, ka lilili mu me o, lo lilili mu beme ya mu baana ba be. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Mu kuulu, mu bitsughu bi bili mu ogya sa akala balyele ti: “Esee kundaa bitini, kundaa ba bagwene oburu, ya ba bagwene osomo busuomo!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Mu matala mamo, baara sa babaana olyele kundaa minguo mi minene: “Libwa ŋa yulu a bihi!” Ya kundaa minguo mi misala ti: “Lifughu bihi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Mu kuulu, kala basi mandagha ma kundaa muti wu mubihi, ema akala baasa kundaa muti wu akee?»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Mu matala maana mamo bákabiri si bantwumu buolo mu oyidzwa bo emõ ya Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ŋa báto bo ŋa ebini ki bákata ti «Etyeghe kii mutswi», bákomo Yiisu ŋa kuruwa ya bantwumu buolo babo, mutsyini ku kwogho-a-kwogho, ya wu muke ku engbambogho. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Yiisu ályele bu: «Taara, sa bo kolokolo, mu kuulu bo ka bali mu ogyahaba mi bali mu okagyighili o.»] Báti empa kii nga a bwehe, ya bákaba biko bi nde.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Baara bátemene oŋo ya bákatala. Bamfumu bákasa Yiisu munkulu ya bályele ti: «Nde aabvwuhu baara babake, abvwuhu nyuru a ndeme, kala ti ngaŋma nde li Kriste wu ósuolo Nzaami!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Bambumbulu si bákasa nde munkulu. Báyasele ku bele a nde, bágwi nde bviini lili ŋeẽ <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />ya bályele ti: «Kala ti we li mukogho a ba-Dzwife, bvwuhu nyuru a we weme!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ŋa yulu a kuruwa li nde básono bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:38">
    <char style="qt">«Wu me Mukogho a ba-Dzwife</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mumõ mu bantwumu ba bákomo ŋa kuruwa, átughu nde ya ályele bu: «We ka li Kriste o? Bvwuhu nyuru a weme, ya bvwuhu bihi!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Lo wu muke áfyeẽ nde ya ályele ti: «We ka aakabara Nzaami o, we wu baatsyiri lipfu limõ ti nde? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Lipfu li lifaana mu bihi a we bansa buolo mu nkooro a bigyighili bi bihi a we bi bibi, lo nde ka aasi ndagha yi mbi o.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ályele kundaa Yiisu ti: «Yiisu, tsimini me mu matala ma ayabvughuru we kunsa emfumu e we.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yiisu ágwi nde mvuru yi: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele we, lolo li we sa kala ya me ku paradise.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu li Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Dzã 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Matala máto ku bele a mbihi a ntaã a minsene, ya mpyibi yíbwi ŋa yulu a nsie yohono tee mu matala mama matere ŋa mbihi a ntaã a minsene. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Tala lípyini, ya nkpaŋa a eko yi áli mu Nzo a nzaami yi nene yíkagha ŋa kara-a-kara. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yiisu ákehe engubu ki enene: «Taara, <char style="qt">me mbvurulu mufulu a me ŋa myaã mi we</char>!» Nde abili obo, átaghaba.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ŋa ómono mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama (100) mi míluru, nde ásyighi Nzaami ya ályele ti: «Ngaŋma, mbwuru wu, mbwuru wu a bunsumu áakakala.» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Baara bwohono ba bágyi mu mampwumu mu oyamono nde, bu bamono mandagha ma máluru, bási myaã ŋa yulu a mitswi ya bábvughuru.<verse eid="LUK 23:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Baara ba básoolo Yiisu ya bakaha ba bákanama nde obaana Ngalile, bátemene la la, ya bákatala mi míkaluru.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badzyighi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Dzã 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Óli a mbwuru mutsyini wu a ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife, nkwumu a nde Dzodzefe. Nde áli mbwuru wu mubwe ya wu bunsumu. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Nde ka áli kunsa mfwunu yi ósi babake mu odzwa Yiisu o. Nde áli musi Arimate, bvulu li ba-Dzwife, ya ákakebe Emfumu e Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Nde ágyene kundaa Pilate ya áluomo nde ebyimi e Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Bu amaha kye ŋa yulu a kuruwa, ádziŋi kye kunsa eko kii lino ya átwulu kye kunsa mpyeme yi bátsimi kunsa limeẽ, mpyeme yiili nkini ka bámaadzyighi mbwuru o. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Kye áli etsughu ki bákagyighili mi mitala etsughu kii Sabate, mu kuulu etsughu kii Sabate áli ayi mu obaana.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Bakaha ba bánama Yiisu obaana ku Ngalile, bágyene nzili mõ ya Dzodzefe, bámono mpyeme ya bu bádzyighi ebyimi e Yiisu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, bo bábvughuru, bágyighili mananaase ya maala, ya bágwumu mu etsughu kii Sabate, bwunu a bu óli mikyene.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Osighili o Yiisu mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Ya mu etsughu kii nsomo mu limiŋi, bakaha bágyene epala-epala ku mpyeme. Babiri mananaase ma bágyighili. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bámono ti limeẽ li baakakyi mpyeme baakimini lo la ya mpyeme. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ya bu basomo, bo ka bámono nyuru a Mfumu Yiisu o. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ya mu kuulu bo ka básoolo bu baasa o mu mi mitala ndagha yi, mono, babaghala buolo báyamoŋono ŋa nkulu a bo ya binkuru bi biikasehene. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Bo bábagha nzalamweẽ, bápfumunu masu mu nsie, ya babaghala babo bályele bo ti: «Mu emakye be lili mu okasagha munde wu li mweẽ ŋa kara li baara ba bákpi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Nde ka ali ŋa o, nde aasighili mu lipfu. Litsimi nsa mandagha nde ákalyele be, ŋaala nde nkini ali ku Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Nde bu ákalyele ti: “Bafaana otyeghe Mwana a mbwuru ŋa myaã mi banga-a-masumu. Sa bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa, lo ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bitere, nde sa asighili mu lipfu.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Bo bálibili mweẽ mandagha ma ókalyele bo Yiisu.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Bámara ŋa mpyeme ya báyilyele mandagha mwohono mamo kundaa bantumu kwumu ya mumõ (11) ya binduono bibike byehene. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Mu bo óli Mari musi Mangadala, Dzaane, Mari maama a Dzake, ya bakaha babake ba báli ya bo. Bo bályele kundaa bantumu, <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />lo bantumu bámono ti mandagha ma ólyele bo bakaha máli bigwobolo. Mu obo, bo ka bási mo kana o. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Lo Piere átemene ya ágyene mu ntyini ku mpyeme. Bu apfuŋumu, nde ámono yini a bisili bi bili mu nsie. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ábvughuru ku nzo a nde, ya ákiŋimi ku olagha mu mi miluru.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu nzili yi a Emawuse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mar 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ya mono, mu etsughu kyini ekye, binduono byele bíkagye ku bula butsyini bubu nkwumu a Emawuse. Etiiri ŋa kara a Yerusaleme ya bula bubo ekughu okala ampe bakilometere kwumu ya mumõ (11). <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Bo bákabulubili mu mandagha mwohono ma máluru. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ŋaala bo mu okabulubili ya mu okabulutsoho, Yiisu áyasele ya ábvughu nzili ya bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bo bámono nde, lo bo ka bákagyahaba ti munde áli nde o. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yiisu áfwulu bo ti: «Be nsa ndagha lili mu okabulutsoho mu nzili?» Bo bátemene ya bámono nyiĩ yi alagha . <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Mumõ ŋa kara li bo, nkwumu a nde Keleopase ágwi nde mvuru yi: «Ŋa kara li baara bwohono ba bali ŋa Yerusaleme, yini a we dzimini mandagha ma maaluru bitsughu bi?» <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yiisu áfwulu bo ti: «Emakye?» Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Mandagha ma maabwi mu Yiisu musi Nadzarete. Nde ali mubighili mumõ wu munene ŋa mihi mi Nzaami ya mimi baara, mu nkooro a bigyighili bi nde ya maluo ma nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba Nzaami ya bakwuru ba bihi baasi nde muyala, baatsyiri nde lipfu, ya baakomo nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Bihi ali liikakala a bitsimi ti me nde aakwulu Isarayele kunsa bunkana. Lo, lolo bitsughu bitere biiluru, obaana bu ooluru mandagha mamo. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Mu engaŋma, ndaama a bakaha ŋa kara li bihi baalyele bihi mandagha mama okiŋimi. Bo baagyene ku mpyeme epala-epala, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />lo ka baamono nyuru a nde o. Baayabvughuru ya baalyele bihi ti bo baamono bangye-yulu ba baalyele bo ti Yiisu li mweẽ. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Ndaama a baara ba baakakala ya bihi baagyene ku mpyeme, ya baamono mandagha mwohono ti bu oolyele bakaha, lo nde ka baamono nde o.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele bo ti: «Be lili baara ba bagwene a mayele. Ya be lili a mikolo mimi maleme mu osa kana mu mandagha ma ólyele mibighili. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Lo, áli ofaana ti Kriste amono mpara mu mandagha mwohono mamo ya asomo mu nsia a nde?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, nde ábaala bo mandagha mwohono ma básono mu nde mu Mukaana a Nzaami, obaana mu mi ósono Moyidze, tee mu mi ósono mibighili.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ŋa báto bo ŋa bele a Emawuse, Yiisu ási ti nde aaluru bula bu bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Lo bo bályele kundaa nde ti: «Agye o, kala ŋa ya bihi. Bwihi buugyili, ya mpyibi edzi-dzighi yibwi.» Mu obo, nde ásomo mu nzo mu okala ya bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ŋa bábwi bo nsini mu odza, nde ágwolo limpa, abvurulu matuono, átsyiri lo ya ágwi bo lo. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Mu matala maana mamo, mihi mi bo mídzubulu, ya bo bábaghala ti munde áli Yiisu, lo nde ádzimini ŋa mihi mi bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bo bábili bo-a-bo ti: «Ŋa aakabili nde ya bihi a we mu nzili ya osuo bihi a we bunu-a-bo Mukaana a Nzaami adzyi olyele, bihi ka ali liimono esee ki eluru mu mikolo o?»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Yini a mu mutala maana mamo, bo bátemene ya bábvughuru ku Yerusaleme. Bo báyibaha bantumu kwumu ya mumõ (11) bábvuŋunu ya binduono bibike, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />bo bályele ti: «Ngaŋma! Mfumu aasighili mu lipfu, nde aayamoŋono kundaa Simõ.» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Bo bályele bo mi baabwana a bo mu nzili, ya bunu-a-bo baagyahaba Yiisu mu matala ma aakatsyiri nde limpa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu moŋono a binduono bi nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Dzã 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ŋaala bo nkini mu okabili obo, Yiisu ndeme áyamoŋono ŋa kara li bo, ya ályele bo ti: «Edzuunu ekala ya be!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bo bábagha nzalamweẽ yi alagha, mu kuulu bátsimi ti munde mupfu baamono. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Lo Yiisu ályele bo ti: «Mu ema be lili a mikolo maã-maã, ya mu ema be lili a mikeme? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Litala myaã ya myili mi me, me me mu engaŋma. Libyeme me ya litala. Mufulu ka ali a nyuru ya miwehe o, ti bu lili mu omono be ti me ndi a bye.» <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Bu abili obo, ásuo bo myaã ya myili mi nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Buulu bo báli kunsa esee, bo áli nkini ka bási kana o, ya báli kunsa okiŋimi, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Be lili a elogho kii odza ŋa?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bágwi nde ekele e nswi ki bágyoho. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yiisu ágwolo kye ya áli ŋa mihi mi bo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo nde ályele bo ti: «Ma me mandagha ma ákandyele me be, mu matala maala me nkini áli ya be: “Myehene mi básono mu mikyene mi Moyidze, mikaana mi mibighili, ya mu Bikwumu mifaana otswighi.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Mu obo, Yiisu ágwi bo mayele mpaala babaghala Mukaana a Nzaami. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Nde ályele bo bu: «Mu obo, básono ti Kriste faana omono mpara ya sa asighili mu lipfu etsughu kii bitere. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Ya bafaana si otsala nsia a nde, obaana ŋa Yerusaleme tee ku mansie mwohono, mu kuulu baara bagyiŋi mayele ya babagha kolokolo lili masumu mu nkwumu a nde. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Be lili bampughulu ba mandagha mwohono. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Me be aangweghe Mufulu a Ngili wu ósi Taara a me misiini. Lo be, limakala ŋa Yerusaleme ŋa, tee matala ma liilaha be lileene lili ku yulu.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bagyene a Yiisu ku yulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar 16.19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:4-14">Big 1.4-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ábiri bo tee ku bele a Betani. Bu aseene myaã ku yulu, nde áseme bo. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Mu matala ma ákaseme nde bo, nde ákaghaba ya bo ya bágyene a nde ku yulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Bo bu bamana obuono nde, bábvughuru ku Yerusaleme kunsa esee kii elagha. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Bitsughu byehene, bo bákasyighi ya bákaseme Nzaami mu Nzo a nzaami yi nene.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>